const CARD_STORIES={"苔庭攀崖羊灵领誓·伊珀":{"zh":"羊的角里卡着一颗门铃，它低头吃草时，屋里便有人应门。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A doorbell is caught in the goat’s horn. Whenever it lowers its head to graze, someone answers inside. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·依珀":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·诺珀":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭灯议长·洛珀":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·岚珀":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭浮辉使领誓·索珀":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·莱珀":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·岑珀":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭地缝蠕虫领誓·塔珀":{"zh":"虫身里能看见吞下的纸条，上面的字朝着相反方向缓慢爬动。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A swallowed note shows through the worm’s body. Its letters move slowly in the opposite direction. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭枝灯树灵领誓·莫珀":{"zh":"墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭巡影狼领誓·伦珀":{"zh":"狼群的脚印在路口分开，回到现场时却全都穿过同一张照片。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The pack’s tracks divide at the crossing. At the scene, every trail passes through the same photograph. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭灯议长·佩珀":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭灯议长·泽珀":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭镜瞳山猫领誓·芮珀":{"zh":"猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铠卫·乌恩":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铠卫·依恩":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭巡灯使·诺恩":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵·瑟恩":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭缄骨客·维恩":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·希恩":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·洛恩":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·米恩":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·岚恩":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭巡灯使·索恩":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭织光蛛·莱恩":{"zh":"蛛网没有粘住飞虫，空出的结点却对应着几处失踪者的住址。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"No insects are caught in the web. Its empty junctions correspond to missing persons’ addresses. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭修灯师·岑恩":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭修灯师·塔恩":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭修灯师·伦恩":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铠卫·佩恩":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵·泽恩":{"zh":"他只需伸手就能碰到屋顶，却低头说自己被关在很小的地方。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He can touch the roof without standing. Looking down, he says he is confined somewhere very small. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭潜印客·图恩":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭潜印客·芮恩":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭环藤蛇·阿拉":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭环藤蛇·艾拉":{"zh":"它盘着一只早已停走的表，表针却一直跟着鳞片慢慢移动。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It coils around a stopped watch. The hands keep moving with the scales. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭缄骨客·伊拉":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭缄骨客·欧拉":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭巡灯使·乌拉":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭绒伞菌灵·依拉":{"zh":"菌褶下沾着旧打字机的色带，孢子落地后排成了几个错字。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"An old typewriter ribbon clings beneath the cap. The falling spores form a few misspelled words. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·雅拉":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭铠卫·诺拉":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭观灯师·瑟拉":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭微烛潜印客":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"老鼠把文件边缘啃得很齐，却从来不碰写着姓名的那一栏。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The rat trims the file’s edges neatly. It never touches the column containing names. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铜缄线尾鼠":{"zh":"它叼走的钥匙都生着旧锈，鼠洞里却总传出开新锁的声音。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The keys it steals are rusted. The sound from its hole is always a new lock opening. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"蛙卵里浮着细小的黑点，放大后看起来像一排站着的人。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Dark specks float inside the frogspawn. Enlarged, they resemble a line of standing people. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕凝光泥团":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"叶脉像一张熟悉的街区图，缺的那条巷子从来没有人走出来。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The leaf veins resemble a familiar street map. Nobody has ever returned from the missing lane. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铜缄绒伞菌灵":{"zh":"它只在有人空出的座位上长出，座位离开房间后也一样。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It grows only on vacated seats, even after those seats are taken out of the room. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭回声绒伞菌灵":{"zh":"菌褶下沾着旧打字机的色带，孢子落地后排成了几个错字。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"An old typewriter ribbon clings beneath the cap. The falling spores form a few misspelled words. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭流砂铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭远路铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭石封铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭夜航观灯师":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭镜纹缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭远路缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭回声环藤蛇":{"zh":"水管里传来吐信声，维修图上却没有画出这条管道。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A tongue flicks inside the pipe. The maintenance plan shows no pipe in that position. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭微烛环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭琉纹峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"这名搬运工搬得动整台锅炉，却从不碰那只没有上锁的箱子。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The porter can move a whole boiler. He will not touch the unlocked box beside it. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭风蚀裂角客":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它站在被擦掉的名字旁边，像还在等谁补上最后一笔。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It stands beside the erased name, as though waiting for someone to finish the final stroke. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭微烛晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭琉纹晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"照片只拍到了它的一只眼，取景器里却一直显示两张脸。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The photograph catches one eye. The viewfinder continues to register two faces. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭琉纹潜印客":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭铜缄凝光泥团":{"zh":"玻璃后面的黏液跟着问话缓慢起伏，没人记录它答了什么。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"The substance behind the glass rises and falls with the questions. Nobody records its answers. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭石封缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地缝前行，身后露出的砖面比房屋本身更陈旧。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It follows the crack in the floor, exposing brickwork older than the house. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭静棱裂角客":{"zh":"窗玻璃映出弯曲的角，站在玻璃前的人却戴着平整的帽子。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Curved horns appear in the window. The person standing before it wears an undamaged hat. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭银露铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭风蚀峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭流砂观灯师":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭琉纹环藤蛇":{"zh":"它盘着一只早已停走的表，表针却一直跟着鳞片慢慢移动。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"It coils around a stopped watch. The hands keep moving with the scales. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"鱼鳃里夹着一小块墙纸，花纹与失踪者卧室的照片相同。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A scrap of wallpaper is caught in the fish’s gill. Its pattern matches the missing person’s bedroom. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭回声浮辉使":{"zh":"有人试着给它拍照，洗出的纸上只有一块始终不干的水迹。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Someone tried to photograph it. The print holds only a patch of water that never dries. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭绒雾裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己的角锯短了，夜里仍会在门框上留下高处的擦痕。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"It has sawn its horns short. At night, fresh scrapes still appear high on the doorframe. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭镜纹观灯师":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭鸣枝缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"苔庭藤印铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"苔庭回声枝灯树灵":{"zh":"枝条钻进密封的档案袋，只在被涂黑的地方重新长出芽。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A branch enters a sealed evidence bag. Buds grow only over the redacted passages. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·希拉":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·洛拉":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·米拉":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·索拉":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟踏铃驹领誓·塔拉":{"zh":"马鞍下的汗渍呈现出地图，标着一条所有车站都否认的旧路线。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Sweat beneath the saddle forms a map of a route every station denies having served. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟苔脊软虫领誓·莫拉":{"zh":"它爬过的纸张没有湿，字迹却全都移到了纸的背面。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The paper it crosses stays dry. Every word has moved to the reverse. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟钩针蝎领誓·图拉":{"zh":"蝎子的尾刺停在封条上方，封条里的东西也不再响了。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The scorpion holds its sting above the seal. Whatever is inside has fallen silent. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟灯议长·芮拉":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟线尾鼠领誓·艾温":{"zh":"老鼠把文件边缘啃得很齐，却从来不碰写着姓名的那一栏。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The rat trims the file’s edges neatly. It never touches the column containing names. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟线尾鼠领誓·伊温":{"zh":"它叼走的钥匙都生着旧锈，鼠洞里却总传出开新锁的声音。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The keys it steals are rusted. The sound from its hole is always a new lock opening. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟露囊蛙领誓·依温":{"zh":"蛙卵里浮着细小的黑点，放大后看起来像一排站着的人。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Dark specks float inside the frogspawn. Enlarged, they resemble a line of standing people. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·雅温":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟温":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·维温":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·希温":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·米温":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·岚温":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·索温":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·莱温":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟浮辉使领誓·岑温":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟晶棘蜥龙领誓·塔温":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟灯议长·莫温":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟灯议长·伦温":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·图温":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫领誓·芮温":{"zh":"猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫领誓·艾雅":{"zh":"它蹲在相片正中央，冲洗之后，所有人的脸都朝向了它。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"It sits in the center of the photograph. Once developed, every face is turned toward it. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟修灯师·伊雅":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫·欧雅":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫·乌雅":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫·依雅":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·雅雅":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·诺雅":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·瑟雅":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·维雅":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·希雅":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·洛雅":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟镜瞳山猫·米雅":{"zh":"这只猫每次带路都会绕过同一扇窗，窗后没有房间。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Whenever the cat leads the way, it avoids the same window. There is no room behind it. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·岚雅":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟巡灯使·索雅":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铠卫·莱雅":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟修灯师·岑雅":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·塔雅":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·莫雅":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·伦雅":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟掠风鸟·佩雅":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·泽雅":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·图雅":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟巡灯使·芮雅":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟钩针蝎·阿弥":{"zh":"它把砂粒推进细缝，最后填出的形状像一枚失踪的指环。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"It pushes sand into the crack until the outline resembles a missing ring. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟观灯师·艾弥":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟修灯师·伊弥":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟浮辉使·欧弥":{"zh":"它站在被擦掉的名字旁边，像还在等谁补上最后一笔。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"It stands beside the erased name, as though waiting for someone to finish the final stroke. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟银露铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟藤印铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟苔痕潜印客":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄潜印客":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟弧光铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟远路巡灯使":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟夜航观灯师":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟流砂观灯师":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟回声线尾鼠":{"zh":"这只鼠的湿毛里夹着纸屑，拼在一起恰好是你昨晚的口供。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Paper scraps cling to the rat’s wet fur. Together they form last night’s statement in your handwriting. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟微烛镜瞳山猫":{"zh":"猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟回声潜印客":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟苔痕岩铃象":{"zh":"厚皮上压着旧吊牌的痕迹，标签早已摘除，编号却每晚都不同。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"An old tag has left its impression in the thick skin. The tag is gone, but its number changes nightly. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄织光蛛":{"zh":"蛛网没有粘住飞虫，空出的结点却对应着几处失踪者的住址。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"No insects are caught in the web. Its empty junctions correspond to missing persons’ addresses. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟回声织光蛛":{"zh":"这只蛛把断线接回原处，每次完工，墙上的裂缝就换一个方向。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The spider joins each broken strand. When it finishes, the crack in the wall points another way. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟镜纹观灯师":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟微烛修灯师":{"zh":"药瓶上的日期早已过期，瓶内的标签却写着下周的天气。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"The medicine has expired. A label inside the bottle gives next week’s weather. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄折面星客":{"zh":"照片中的五官都在正确位置，合在一起却无法让人记住。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Every feature occupies the right place in the photograph. Together, they cannot be remembered. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄夜航铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟回声浮辉使":{"zh":"有人试着给它拍照，洗出的纸上只有一块始终不干的水迹。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Someone tried to photograph it. The print holds only a patch of water that never dries. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟远路观灯师":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"铜钟铜缄流砂铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄远路铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟石封观灯师":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄石封铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟铜缄悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"铜钟苔痕刺灯兽":{"zh":"刺间粘着医院的细线，轻轻拨动，远处就有人按响呼叫铃。钟楼的值班册少了整整一页星期三。","en":"Hospital thread clings between its spines. Touching it makes a call bell ring somewhere far away. A whole Wednesday is missing from the bell tower’s duty book."},"铜钟铜缄银露铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。修表匠不肯说明多出的那根指针。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The watchmaker refuses to explain the extra hand."},"炽砂枝灯树灵领誓·雅弥":{"zh":"墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂裂角客领誓·洛弥":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂凝光泥团领誓·岚弥":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·岑弥":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·塔弥":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·佩弥":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·泽弥":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·阿罗":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂巡影狼领誓·艾罗":{"zh":"狼群的脚印在路口分开，回到现场时却全都穿过同一张照片。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The pack’s tracks divide at the crossing. At the scene, every trail passes through the same photograph. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·欧罗":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂裂角客领誓·乌罗":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依罗":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂修灯师·瑟罗":{"zh":"防火女把汤盛进铁碗，又塞来一卷蓝线。“衣服破了就补，别连人也扔掉。”她守着冷炉，雨衣袖口一直发烫。你认出线头上的小剪口，和那封早已寄到的信里一模一样。","en":"The Fire Warden serves soup in a tin bowl and adds a spool of blue thread. “Mend torn clothes. No need to throw away the person.” She keeps a cold furnace; her raincoat cuffs stay hot. The tiny cut at the thread’s end matches the letter that arrived long ago."},"炽砂铠卫·维罗":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂巡灯使·希罗":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂巡灯使·洛罗":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂缄骨客·米罗":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂缄骨客·岚罗":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂潜印客·索罗":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·莱罗":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·岑罗":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·塔罗":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂潜印客·莫罗":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·伦罗":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂潜印客·佩罗":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂巡灯使·泽罗":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂修灯师·图罗":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·芮罗":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂观灯师·阿安":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂观灯师·艾安":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂观灯师·伊安":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂潜印客·欧安":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂观灯师·乌安":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·依安":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·雅安":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂修灯师·诺安":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂潜印客·瑟安":{"zh":"她的口袋里没有钥匙，所有钥匙的编号却记在皮肤下面。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"There are no keys in her pockets. Their numbers can be read beneath her skin. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·维安":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂巡灯使·希安":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铠卫·洛安":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铠卫·米安":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂琉纹修灯师":{"zh":"药瓶上的日期早已过期，瓶内的标签却写着下周的天气。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The medicine has expired. A label inside the bottle gives next week’s weather. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂回声裂角客":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂夜航缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄掠风鸟":{"zh":"鸦羽粘在没有开启过的窗缝，羽轴上刻着很小的门牌号码。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Raven feathers cling to a window that has never opened. Tiny street numbers mark their shafts. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄巡影狼":{"zh":"它嗅过你的袖口便停止低吼，像认出了一个不该在这里的人。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"It stops growling after smelling your sleeve, as if recognizing someone who should not be here. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄砂脊蜥":{"zh":"鳞片下映出缓慢转动的刻度，靠近时才发现刻度写着人名。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Scales reveal a slowly turning dial beneath. Up close, its marks turn out to be names. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂风蚀修灯师":{"zh":"他让你握住一盏检查灯，自己的影子却留在手术台上不动。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He asks you to hold the examination lamp. His shadow remains motionless on the operating table. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄夜航铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂流砂缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕匣中客":{"zh":"这只箱子贴着失物招领的标签，里面的牙齿却都刻着领取日期。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The box bears a lost-property label. Every tooth inside is marked with a collection date. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂镜纹缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄流砂铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂远路缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂石封缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕铜壳蟹":{"zh":"蟹钳夹着一段门链，锈蚀的位置与案卷里的断口正好吻合。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The crab grips a door chain. The corroded break matches the one in the case file. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂微烛裂角客":{"zh":"窗玻璃映出弯曲的角，站在玻璃前的人却戴着平整的帽子。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Curved horns appear in the window. The person standing before it wears an undamaged hat. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂静棱修灯师":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"虫身里能看见吞下的纸条，上面的字朝着相反方向缓慢爬动。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"A swallowed note shows through the worm’s body. Its letters move slowly in the opposite direction. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂静棱观灯师":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄远路铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄石封铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂鸣枝缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂回声巡影狼":{"zh":"这头狼只对着空座位露齿，座位上的安全带却一直系着。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The wolf bares its teeth at an empty seat. The seat belt remains fastened. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂夜航巡灯使":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂琉纹裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己的角锯短了，夜里仍会在门框上留下高处的擦痕。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"It has sawn its horns short. At night, fresh scrapes still appear high on the doorframe. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂苔痕石指傀儡":{"zh":"这只手保留着完整的指纹，却没有任何一枚指甲长在正面。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The hand retains every fingerprint. None of its nails grows on the front. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"它盘着一只早已停走的表，表针却一直跟着鳞片慢慢移动。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"It coils around a stopped watch. The hands keep moving with the scales. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂回声环藤蛇":{"zh":"水管里传来吐信声，维修图上却没有画出这条管道。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"A tongue flicks inside the pipe. The maintenance plan shows no pipe in that position. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂微烛环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂回声砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄银露铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"叶脉像一张熟悉的街区图，缺的那条巷子从来没有人走出来。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The leaf veins resemble a familiar street map. Nobody has ever returned from the missing lane. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂微烛巡影狼":{"zh":"狼群的脚印在路口分开，回到现场时却全都穿过同一张照片。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The pack’s tracks divide at the crossing. At the scene, every trail passes through the same photograph. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂铜缄藤印铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铜缄弧光铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂绒雾修灯师":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。炉子停了，排班表却还在增加人名。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. The furnaces have stopped. Names keep appearing on the shift sheet."},"炽砂苔痕绛纹蝶":{"zh":"蝶翼的斑纹像两张侧脸，停下来时，总有一张背向光线。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"The wing patterns resemble two faces in profile. Whenever it rests, one turns away from the light. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"蛙卵里浮着细小的黑点，放大后看起来像一排站着的人。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"Dark specks float inside the frogspawn. Enlarged, they resemble a line of standing people. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"炽砂暖灰缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"他只需伸手就能碰到屋顶，却低头说自己被关在很小的地方。灰厂的打卡钟打印着明天的日期。","en":"He can touch the roof without standing. Looking down, he says he is confined somewhere very small. The time clock at the Ash Works prints tomorrow’s date."},"苔庭铠卫·岚安":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。镇上的住户都说那晚没有起雾。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Every resident insists there was no fog that night."},"铜钟缄骨客·索安":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。街上所有手表都比钟声慢一次呼吸。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. Every watch on the street is a breath behind the bell."},"炽砂回声苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"炽砂铠卫·莱安":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。那台机器的说明书只有倒数第二页。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. Only the penultimate page of the machine’s manual remains."},"砂镜凝光泥团领誓·岑安":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·塔安":{"zh":"阿奇，档案称“复卷守备”。护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Archie, filed as Refolded Sentry. Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·莫安":{"zh":"沃尔特，档案称“旧印门卫”。他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Walter, filed as Oldseal Keeper. He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·伦安":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·佩安":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·泽安":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·图安":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜凝光泥团领誓·芮安":{"zh":"玻璃后面的黏液跟着问话缓慢起伏，没人记录它答了什么。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The substance behind the glass rises and falls with the questions. Nobody records its answers. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜织光蛛领誓·阿瑟":{"zh":"伊迪丝，档案称“盲档蛛”。蛛网没有粘住飞虫，空出的结点却对应着几处失踪者的住址。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Edith, filed as Blinddoc Spider. No insects are caught in the web. Its empty junctions correspond to missing persons’ addresses. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜裂角客领誓·艾瑟":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊瑟":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜灯议长·欧瑟":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜灯议长·乌瑟":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜潮纹游鱼领誓·依瑟":{"zh":"珀西，档案称“漏页鱼”。鱼鳃里夹着一小块墙纸，花纹与失踪者卧室的照片相同。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Percy, filed as Leafless Fish. A scrap of wallpaper is caught in the fish’s gill. Its pattern matches the missing person’s bedroom. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·雅瑟":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜地缝蠕虫领誓·诺瑟":{"zh":"虫身里能看见吞下的纸条，上面的字朝着相反方向缓慢爬动。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"A swallowed note shows through the worm’s body. Its letters move slowly in the opposite direction. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟瑟":{"zh":"他只需伸手就能碰到屋顶，却低头说自己被关在很小的地方。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He can touch the roof without standing. Looking down, he says he is confined somewhere very small. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜灯议长·维瑟":{"zh":"奥斯卡，档案称“无字药师”。她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Oscar, filed as Wordless Chemist. She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜修灯师·希瑟":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜浮辉使·洛瑟":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜修灯师·米瑟":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜修灯师·岚瑟":{"zh":"药瓶上的日期早已过期，瓶内的标签却写着下周的天气。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The medicine has expired. A label inside the bottle gives next week’s weather. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·索瑟":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·莱瑟":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·岑瑟":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·塔瑟":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·莫瑟":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·伦瑟":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·佩瑟":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·泽瑟":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·图瑟":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·芮瑟":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·阿尘":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫·艾尘":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜潜印客·伊尘":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·欧尘":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·乌尘":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·依尘":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·雅尘":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜掠风鸟·诺尘":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜潜印客·瑟尘":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜潜印客·维尘":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜观灯师·希尘":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜观灯师·洛尘":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜观灯师·米尘":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜观灯师·岚尘":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜巡灯使·索尘":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜远路铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜镜纹巡灯使":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜回声缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜回声凝光泥团":{"zh":"证物箱里没有漏水，它却不断增加，逼得标签向外翘起。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The evidence box is not leaking. The mass inside keeps growing, lifting the label at its edges. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地缝前行，身后露出的砖面比房屋本身更陈旧。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It follows the crack in the floor, exposing brickwork older than the house. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它站在被擦掉的名字旁边，像还在等谁补上最后一笔。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It stands beside the erased name, as though waiting for someone to finish the final stroke. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜微烛裂角客":{"zh":"窗玻璃映出弯曲的角，站在玻璃前的人却戴着平整的帽子。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Curved horns appear in the window. The person standing before it wears an undamaged hat. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铜缄潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它游过水下的窗户，玻璃里映出的却是一条干燥的走廊。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It swims past a submerged window. The reflection shows a dry corridor. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕苔脊软虫":{"zh":"它爬过的纸张没有湿，字迹却全都移到了纸的背面。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The paper it crosses stays dry. Every word has moved to the reverse. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"老鼠把文件边缘啃得很齐，却从来不碰写着姓名的那一栏。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The rat trims the file’s edges neatly. It never touches the column containing names. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铜缄甲灯虫":{"zh":"它只撞那只没有通电的灯泡，灯丝却在撞击后变得更亮。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It strikes only the unpowered bulb. The filament brightens after each impact. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜石封铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜微烛潜印客":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜静棱缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"这名搬运工搬得动整台锅炉，却从不碰那只没有上锁的箱子。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"The porter can move a whole boiler. He will not touch the unlocked box beside it. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜静棱观灯师":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜绒雾观灯师":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜铜缄晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜回声晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·芮尘":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·伊汀":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·欧汀":{"zh":"照片中的五官都在正确位置，合在一起却无法让人记住。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Every feature occupies the right place in the photograph. Together, they cannot be remembered. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·瑟汀":{"zh":"它认真模仿呼吸，等你屏住气时，整个房间才跟着安静下来。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It carefully imitates breathing. When you hold yours, the whole room becomes quiet. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮灯议长·洛汀":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮灯议长·米汀":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮灯议长·岚汀":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮峰脊巨灵领誓·索汀":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莱汀":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮地缝蠕虫领誓·岑汀":{"zh":"虫身里能看见吞下的纸条，上面的字朝着相反方向缓慢爬动。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"A swallowed note shows through the worm’s body. Its letters move slowly in the opposite direction. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮棱耳猎犬领誓·塔汀":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·莫汀":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮灯议长·伦汀":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·佩汀":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮琉纹折面星客":{"zh":"对方知道姓名该有几个字，却总把最后一笔写到纸的另一面。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It knows how many letters a name should contain. It always finishes the last stroke on the other side of the paper. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮修灯师·泽汀":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·图汀":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·芮汀":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮修灯师·阿芙":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·艾芙":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·伊芙":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·欧芙":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·乌芙":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮修灯师·依芙":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮修灯师·雅芙":{"zh":"药瓶上的日期早已过期，瓶内的标签却写着下周的天气。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The medicine has expired. A label inside the bottle gives next week’s weather. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·诺芙":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·瑟芙":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铠卫·维芙":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·希芙":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·洛芙":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮巡灯使·米芙":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·岚芙":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·索芙":{"zh":"她的口袋里没有钥匙，所有钥匙的编号却记在皮肤下面。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"There are no keys in her pockets. Their numbers can be read beneath her skin. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮折面星客·莱芙":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮巡灯使·岑芙":{"zh":"她随身带着两张返程票，另一位乘客的姓名被水泡掉了。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She carries two return tickets. Water has washed the other passenger’s name away. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮织光蛛·塔芙":{"zh":"蛛网没有粘住飞虫，空出的结点却对应着几处失踪者的住址。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"No insects are caught in the web. Its empty junctions correspond to missing persons’ addresses. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·莫芙":{"zh":"他总在你转头前离开，留下的椅子却比刚坐下时更冷。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He leaves before you turn around. The chair is colder than when he first sat down. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮潜印客·伦芙":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮微烛缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮琉纹缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它认得巡逻车的声音，却总比车上的无线电早一步转身。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It knows the patrol car’s sound. It turns before the radio reports the car’s arrival. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"老鼠把文件边缘啃得很齐，却从来不碰写着姓名的那一栏。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The rat trims the file’s edges neatly. It never touches the column containing names. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮雾羽巡灯使":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮静棱折面星客":{"zh":"照片中的五官都在正确位置，合在一起却无法让人记住。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"Every feature occupies the right place in the photograph. Together, they cannot be remembered. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮风蚀缄骨客":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮苔痕巡影狼":{"zh":"狼群的脚印在路口分开，回到现场时却全都穿过同一张照片。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The pack’s tracks divide at the crossing. At the scene, every trail passes through the same photograph. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮绒雾折面星客":{"zh":"它认真模仿呼吸，等你屏住气时，整个房间才跟着安静下来。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"It carefully imitates breathing. When you hold yours, the whole room becomes quiet. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"它盘着一只早已停走的表，表针却一直跟着鳞片慢慢移动。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It coils around a stopped watch. The hands keep moving with the scales. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"他只需伸手就能碰到屋顶，却低头说自己被关在很小的地方。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He can touch the roof without standing. Looking down, he says he is confined somewhere very small. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮微烛峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"这名搬运工搬得动整台锅炉，却从不碰那只没有上锁的箱子。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The porter can move a whole boiler. He will not touch the unlocked box beside it. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮弧光巡灯使":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮铜缄巡影狼":{"zh":"它嗅过你的袖口便停止低吼，像认出了一个不该在这里的人。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It stops growling after smelling your sleeve, as if recognizing someone who should not be here. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄观灯师":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮夜航折面星客":{"zh":"对方知道姓名该有几个字，却总把最后一笔写到纸的另一面。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"It knows how many letters a name should contain. It always finishes the last stroke on the other side of the paper. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮流砂折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。船票的返程日期比出发早了一周。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. The return date on the ticket is a week before departure."},"暮潮苔痕锈鬃豕":{"zh":"野猪拱开的泥土里埋着病历，最后一页还没有填上日期。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Medical records lie beneath the soil the boar turns over. The final page has no date yet. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮夜航潜印客":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"鱼鳃里夹着一小块墙纸，花纹与失踪者卧室的照片相同。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"A scrap of wallpaper is caught in the fish’s gill. Its pattern matches the missing person’s bedroom. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"它游过水下的窗户，玻璃里映出的却是一条干燥的走廊。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It swims past a submerged window. The reflection shows a dry corridor. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮回声潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"这条鱼只在有人念出名字时浮起，死去之后也没有改变。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The fish surfaces only when a name is spoken. Death has not changed the habit. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮苔痕凝光泥团":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮微烛裂角客":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮回声铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄苔痕巡灯使":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮回声织光蛛":{"zh":"这只蛛把断线接回原处，每次完工，墙上的裂缝就换一个方向。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"The spider joins each broken strand. When it finishes, the crack in the wall points another way. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮铜缄铜缄巡灯使":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·佩芙":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·洛诺":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·米诺":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·岚诺":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·索诺":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·莱诺":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·岑诺":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·塔诺":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·莫诺":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·伦诺":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·佩诺":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄赤角兽":{"zh":"牛角上挂着一截电话线，线路的另一端早在十年前就拆除了。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"A telephone wire hangs from the bull’s horn. The other end was disconnected ten years ago. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·泽诺":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·图诺":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝潜印客·芮诺":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝潜印客·阿烙":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝静棱潜印客":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝绒雾潜印客":{"zh":"她的口袋里没有钥匙，所有钥匙的编号却记在皮肤下面。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"There are no keys in her pockets. Their numbers can be read beneath her skin. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝潜印客·艾烙":{"zh":"他总在你转头前离开，留下的椅子却比刚坐下时更冷。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He leaves before you turn around. The chair is colder than when he first sat down. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝苔痕折面星客":{"zh":"它照着录音学会了敲门，敲击之间却没有留给人开门的时间。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"It learned to knock from a recording. The intervals leave nobody time to open the door. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它站在被擦掉的名字旁边，像还在等谁补上最后一笔。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"It stands beside the erased name, as though waiting for someone to finish the final stroke. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·伊烙":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝苔痕环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝苔痕潮纹游鱼":{"zh":"鱼鳃里夹着一小块墙纸，花纹与失踪者卧室的照片相同。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"A scrap of wallpaper is caught in the fish’s gill. Its pattern matches the missing person’s bedroom. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·欧烙":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝修灯师·乌烙":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝潜印客·依烙":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝巡灯使·雅烙":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝巡灯使·诺烙":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝峰脊巨灵·瑟烙":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·维烙":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·希烙":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·洛烙":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝潜印客·米烙":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝修灯师·岚烙":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝修灯师·索烙":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铠卫·莱烙":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝窑心偶·岑烙":{"zh":"陶罐里面没有盖章的文件，封口处却留下了一圈完整的指印。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"No stamped papers remain in the jar. An unbroken ring of fingerprints surrounds its mouth. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝窑心偶·塔烙":{"zh":"它被搬离原位以后，架子上仍会在同一个位置传出回声。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"After it is moved, an echo continues to come from its old place on the shelf. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝潜印客·莫烙":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝银露铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝藤印铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝镜纹巡灯使":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝石封潜印客":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝鸣枝潜印客":{"zh":"她的口袋里没有钥匙，所有钥匙的编号却记在皮肤下面。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"There are no keys in her pockets. Their numbers can be read beneath her skin. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝弧光铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝微烛攀钟猿":{"zh":"它照着监控学会了举手，镜头停转后仍举着一张不存在的证件。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"It learned to raise its hand from the camera feed. When the feed stops, it keeps holding up an absent identity card. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄折面星客":{"zh":"照片中的五官都在正确位置，合在一起却无法让人记住。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Every feature occupies the right place in the photograph. Together, they cannot be remembered. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝苔痕砂脊蜥":{"zh":"蜥蜴的尾巴留在证物盘里，身体却每天回来替它换一个位置。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The lizard’s tail lies in an evidence tray. Its body returns each day to move it. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝暖灰潜印客":{"zh":"他总在你转头前离开，留下的椅子却比刚坐下时更冷。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He leaves before you turn around. The chair is colder than when he first sat down. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝悬灯潜印客":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。站台的旧广播每天都把你的名字念错。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The old platform announcement mispronounces your name each day."},"霜枝银露潜印客":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。站台的旧广播每天都把你的名字念错。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The old platform announcement mispronounces your name each day."},"霜枝远路巡灯使":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝石封巡灯使":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝鸣枝巡灯使":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝琉纹攀钟猿":{"zh":"猿掌印出现在天花板上，抓痕却从房间里面一直延伸到室外。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Ape handprints mark the ceiling. The scratches continue from inside the room to the exterior. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝苔痕掠风鸟":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"霜枝铜缄峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"霜枝浮辉使·伦烙":{"zh":"有人试着给它拍照，洗出的纸上只有一块始终不干的水迹。雪站的玻璃后面还落着另一场雪。","en":"Someone tried to photograph it. The print holds only a patch of water that never dries. A second snowfall continues behind the station window."},"星铸灯议长·依玟":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸修灯师·希玟":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸裂角客领誓·岚玟":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·索玟":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸镜瞳山猫领誓·莱玟":{"zh":"猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·岑玟":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·塔玟":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·莫玟":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·伦玟":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·佩玟":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸潜印客领誓·泽玟":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸潜印客领誓·图玟":{"zh":"他收走你的照片，只归还底片，说照片会替别人认出你。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He takes your photograph and returns only the negative. He says a print lets someone else recognize you. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮玟":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·阿斐":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫领誓·艾斐":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸掠风鸟领誓·伊斐":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸掠风鸟领誓·欧斐":{"zh":"鸦羽粘在没有开启过的窗缝，羽轴上刻着很小的门牌号码。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Raven feathers cling to a window that has never opened. Tiny street numbers mark their shafts. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·乌斐":{"zh":"墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·依斐":{"zh":"叶脉像一张熟悉的街区图，缺的那条巷子从来没有人走出来。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The leaf veins resemble a familiar street map. Nobody has ever returned from the missing lane. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·雅斐":{"zh":"枝条钻进密封的档案袋，只在被涂黑的地方重新长出芽。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A branch enters a sealed evidence bag. Buds grow only over the redacted passages. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸枝灯树灵领誓·诺斐":{"zh":"墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸镜瞳山猫领誓·瑟斐":{"zh":"它蹲在相片正中央，冲洗之后，所有人的脸都朝向了它。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It sits in the center of the photograph. Once developed, every face is turned toward it. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·维斐":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·希斐":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·洛斐":{"zh":"门框上的刻痕一年比一年高，房主却坚持房客从未长大。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The marks on the doorframe rise each year. The landlord insists the tenant has never grown. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·米斐":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·岚斐":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸凝光泥团领誓·索斐":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸裂角客领誓·莱斐":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸裂角客领誓·岑斐":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸星枝鹿领誓·塔斐":{"zh":"鹿角间缠着白色号码牌，没有哪一张能对应上镇里的住户。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"White number tags hang between its antlers. None belongs to a registered resident. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸星枝鹿领誓·莫斐":{"zh":"它站在封路牌后面，车灯一熄，蹄声便从后座传过来。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It stands behind the road barrier. When the headlights go out, hoofbeats come from the back seat. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伦斐":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·佩斐":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·泽斐":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·图斐":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·芮斐":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·艾霖":{"zh":"狼群的脚印在路口分开，回到现场时却全都穿过同一张照片。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The pack’s tracks divide at the crossing. At the scene, every trail passes through the same photograph. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·伊霖":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·欧霖":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·乌霖":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·依霖":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·雅霖":{"zh":"她随身带着两张返程票，另一位乘客的姓名被水泡掉了。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She carries two return tickets. Water has washed the other passenger’s name away. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·诺霖":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸灯议长·瑟霖":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸赤角兽领誓·维霖":{"zh":"牛角上挂着一截电话线，线路的另一端早在十年前就拆除了。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A telephone wire hangs from the bull’s horn. The other end was disconnected ten years ago. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸赤角兽领誓·希霖":{"zh":"这头牛的眼睛蒙着白膜，每次停步却都朝向同一间空屋。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A white film covers the bull’s eyes. Whenever it stops, it faces the same empty room. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸灯议长·洛霖":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸灯议长·米霖":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·岚霖":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·索霖":{"zh":"它只撞那只没有通电的灯泡，灯丝却在撞击后变得更亮。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It strikes only the unpowered bulb. The filament brightens after each impact. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸裂角客领誓·莱霖":{"zh":"窗玻璃映出弯曲的角，站在玻璃前的人却戴着平整的帽子。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Curved horns appear in the window. The person standing before it wears an undamaged hat. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸甲灯虫领誓·岑霖":{"zh":"这只甲虫的壳内有敲击声，节奏和楼下的报时声一样。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Knocking comes from inside the beetle’s shell. Its rhythm matches the clock downstairs. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·塔霖":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·莫霖":{"zh":"照片只拍到了它的一只眼，取景器里却一直显示两张脸。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The photograph catches one eye. The viewfinder continues to register two faces. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伦霖":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·佩霖":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·泽霖":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·图霖":{"zh":"照片只拍到了它的一只眼，取景器里却一直显示两张脸。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The photograph catches one eye. The viewfinder continues to register two faces. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·芮霖":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·阿沐":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾沐":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊沐":{"zh":"照片只拍到了它的一只眼，取景器里却一直显示两张脸。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The photograph catches one eye. The viewfinder continues to register two faces. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·欧沐":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸晶棘蜥龙领誓·乌沐":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸石封铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸暖灰铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸悬灯铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸银露铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸藤印铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸雾羽铠卫":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸弧光巡灯使":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸微烛观灯师":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄苔痕巡灯使":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸苔痕露囊蛙":{"zh":"蛙卵里浮着细小的黑点，放大后看起来像一排站着的人。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Dark specks float inside the frogspawn. Enlarged, they resemble a line of standing people. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄铜缄巡灯使":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸绒雾裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己的角锯短了，夜里仍会在门框上留下高处的擦痕。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It has sawn its horns short. At night, fresh scrapes still appear high on the doorframe. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸夜航裂角客":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸流砂裂角客":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸镜纹裂角客":{"zh":"他不肯越过地面的盐线，盐粒却在你眨眼时排到了门外。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He will not cross the line of salt. Between blinks, the grains rearrange themselves outside the door. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸远路裂角客":{"zh":"窗玻璃映出弯曲的角，站在玻璃前的人却戴着平整的帽子。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Curved horns appear in the window. The person standing before it wears an undamaged hat. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸回声潜印客":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕缄骨客":{"zh":"尸检记录写着肺部没有空气，他却能一口气讲完那晚的事。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The autopsy lists no air in his lungs. He tells the whole night’s story without pausing for breath. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸石封裂角客":{"zh":"它把自己的角锯短了，夜里仍会在门框上留下高处的擦痕。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"It has sawn its horns short. At night, fresh scrapes still appear high on the doorframe. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸鸣枝裂角客":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸回声掠风鸟":{"zh":"它每晚带回一枚纽扣，最后一枚正好补齐了失踪者的外衣。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It brings back one button each night. The last completes the missing person’s coat. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸微烛掠风鸟":{"zh":"这只鸟学会了电话的铃声，来电记录却总是在它叫过后才出现。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The bird has learned a telephone’s ring. The call appears in the log only after it cries. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸琉纹掠风鸟":{"zh":"鸦羽粘在没有开启过的窗缝，羽轴上刻着很小的门牌号码。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Raven feathers cling to a window that has never opened. Tiny street numbers mark their shafts. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸苔痕棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"狗把鼻尖贴在空白相片上，随后一直等在没有门的那面墙前。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The dog presses its nose to a blank photograph, then waits beside the wall without a door. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸微烛巡影狼":{"zh":"它嗅过你的袖口便停止低吼，像认出了一个不该在这里的人。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It stops growling after smelling your sleeve, as if recognizing someone who should not be here. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕石背熊":{"zh":"熊掌印压在一层细灰上，灰下的脚印却属于一名失踪的孩子。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Bear prints press into fine ash. Beneath them are the footprints of a missing child. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕铜壳蟹":{"zh":"蟹钳夹着一段门链，锈蚀的位置与案卷里的断口正好吻合。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The crab grips a door chain. The corroded break matches the one in the case file. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄铜壳蟹":{"zh":"它沿着桌边侧行，每次退到同一个角落，就像在躲开提问。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It moves sideways along the desk, retreating to the same corner whenever a question is asked. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄凝光泥团":{"zh":"玻璃后面的黏液跟着问话缓慢起伏，没人记录它答了什么。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The substance behind the glass rises and falls with the questions. Nobody records its answers. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕流墨触灵":{"zh":"吸盘贴住的玻璃不留水印，只留下几枚有姓名的圆形印章。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Its suckers leave no watermarks on the glass, only round stamps bearing names. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸琉纹枝灯树灵":{"zh":"叶脉像一张熟悉的街区图，缺的那条巷子从来没有人走出来。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The leaf veins resemble a familiar street map. Nobody has ever returned from the missing lane. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄浮辉使":{"zh":"它站在被擦掉的名字旁边，像还在等谁补上最后一笔。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It stands beside the erased name, as though waiting for someone to finish the final stroke. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸暖灰裂角客":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铜缄流墨触灵":{"zh":"触腕从水箱后侧伸出，维修人员却找不到那里有任何开口。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"An arm reaches from the back of the tank. Maintenance cannot find an opening there. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸回声峰脊巨灵":{"zh":"它坐过的椅子没有断，地基却像被什么东西往下按了一寸。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The chair it sat on remains intact. The foundation looks as if something pressed it an inch lower. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄回声巡灯使":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸苔痕石指傀儡":{"zh":"这只手保留着完整的指纹，却没有任何一枚指甲长在正面。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The hand retains every fingerprint. None of its nails grows on the front. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄露囊蛙":{"zh":"它在排水口叫了一夜，邻居却都说那是有人试图说话。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It calls from the drain all night. Every neighbor describes someone trying to speak. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸苔痕线尾鼠":{"zh":"老鼠把文件边缘啃得很齐，却从来不碰写着姓名的那一栏。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The rat trims the file’s edges neatly. It never touches the column containing names. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸回声凝光泥团":{"zh":"证物箱里没有漏水，它却不断增加，逼得标签向外翘起。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The evidence box is not leaking. The mass inside keeps growing, lifting the label at its edges. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"它认得巡逻车的声音，却总比车上的无线电早一步转身。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It knows the patrol car’s sound. It turns before the radio reports the car’s arrival. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸回声缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄线尾鼠":{"zh":"它叼走的钥匙都生着旧锈，鼠洞里却总传出开新锁的声音。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The keys it steals are rusted. The sound from its hole is always a new lock opening. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸弧光铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸风蚀掠风鸟":{"zh":"它每晚带回一枚纽扣，最后一枚正好补齐了失踪者的外衣。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"It brings back one button each night. The last completes the missing person’s coat. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸琉纹观灯师":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄苔痕铠卫":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸暖灰晶棘蜥龙":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸铜缄铜缄铠卫":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄回声铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄微烛铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄琉纹铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铠卫·依沐":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铠卫·雅沐":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铜缄修灯师":{"zh":"这名医师听诊很久，最后问你有没有梦见另一个心跳声。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The physician listens for a long time, then asks whether you have dreamed of a second heartbeat. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铜缄微烛巡灯使":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄琉纹巡灯使":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸风蚀观灯师":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸微烛凝光泥团":{"zh":"它在地上留下湿润的轮廓，像一个人曾经在这里躺了很久。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"Its damp outline remains on the floor, as if a person lay there for a long time. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铜缄环藤蛇":{"zh":"蛇蜕从锁孔里拖出来，里面还包着一张没有签名的借条。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A shed snakeskin trails from the keyhole, wrapped around an unsigned note of debt. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫·诺沐":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·瑟沐":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·维沐":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·希沐":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸修灯师·洛沐":{"zh":"她认得每个人的伤痕，却说不清这些记录是哪一次看诊写的。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"She knows every scar. She cannot say which consultation produced the notes. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸观灯师·米沐":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡影狼·岚沐":{"zh":"这头狼只对着空座位露齿，座位上的安全带却一直系着。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The wolf bares its teeth at an empty seat. The seat belt remains fastened. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸观灯师·索沐":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸潜印客·莱沐":{"zh":"他从不走有脚印的那条路，仍会在转角撞见自己的背影。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He avoids paths with footprints. At the next corner he still finds his own back. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡灯使·岑沐":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸窑心偶·塔沐":{"zh":"陶罐里面没有盖章的文件，封口处却留下了一圈完整的指印。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"No stamped papers remain in the jar. An unbroken ring of fingerprints surrounds its mouth. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸窑心偶·莫沐":{"zh":"它被搬离原位以后，架子上仍会在同一个位置传出回声。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"After it is moved, an echo continues to come from its old place on the shelf. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫·伦沐":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·佩沐":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸巡灯使·泽沐":{"zh":"她随身带着两张返程票，另一位乘客的姓名被水泡掉了。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She carries two return tickets. Water has washed the other passenger’s name away. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸巡灯使·图沐":{"zh":"他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸攀钟猿·芮沐":{"zh":"它照着监控学会了举手，镜头停转后仍举着一张不存在的证件。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It learned to raise its hand from the camera feed. When the feed stops, it keeps holding up an absent identity card. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸潜印客·阿洛":{"zh":"她的口袋里没有钥匙，所有钥匙的编号却记在皮肤下面。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"There are no keys in her pockets. Their numbers can be read beneath her skin. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡灯使·艾洛":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·伊洛":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·欧洛":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·乌洛":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·依洛":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·雅洛":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸潜印客·诺洛":{"zh":"他总在你转头前离开，留下的椅子却比刚坐下时更冷。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He leaves before you turn around. The chair is colder than when he first sat down. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸铠卫·瑟洛":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸观灯师·维洛":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸观灯师·希洛":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸观灯师·洛洛":{"zh":"她念出一串没人接听的号码，停电的屋子逐间亮起了灯。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She recites numbers nobody answers. Lights come on one by one in houses without power. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸观灯师·米洛":{"zh":"他把静电噪声抄进本子，错别字在第二天都变成了人名。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"He copies static into a notebook. By morning, every misspelling has become a person’s name. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸观灯师·岚洛":{"zh":"仪表没有连电源，他却要求你别在指针停住时看向窗外。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The meter has no power supply. He asks you not to look outside when its needle stops. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸观灯师·索洛":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸巡灯使·莱洛":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸巡灯使·岑洛":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸铠卫·塔洛":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸修灯师·莫洛":{"zh":"药瓶上的日期早已过期，瓶内的标签却写着下周的天气。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The medicine has expired. A label inside the bottle gives next week’s weather. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸缄骨客·伦洛":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸修灯师·佩洛":{"zh":"他让你握住一盏检查灯，自己的影子却留在手术台上不动。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He asks you to hold the examination lamp. His shadow remains motionless on the operating table. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸峰脊巨灵·泽洛":{"zh":"他只需伸手就能碰到屋顶，却低头说自己被关在很小的地方。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"He can touch the roof without standing. Looking down, he says he is confined somewhere very small. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸峰脊巨灵·图洛":{"zh":"这名搬运工搬得动整台锅炉，却从不碰那只没有上锁的箱子。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The porter can move a whole boiler. He will not touch the unlocked box beside it. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸观灯师·芮洛":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸缄骨客·阿岚":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡灯使·艾岚":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸修灯师·伊岚":{"zh":"她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸浮岛龟·欧岚":{"zh":"壳上的裂纹像一份天气图，暴雨过后，图里总会缺少一个村庄。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Cracks in the shell resemble a weather map. After each storm, another village is missing. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡灯使·乌岚":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸潜印客·依岚":{"zh":"锁没有被撬开的痕迹，屋里却多出一件尺寸合适的雨衣。这份记录一直缺少负责调查的人。","en":"The lock shows no damage. A raincoat in exactly the right size has appeared inside. The investigator’s name is missing from the record."},"星铸铠卫·雅岚":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"星铸巡灯使·诺岚":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸观灯师·瑟岚":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸巡灯使·维岚":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸巡灯使·希岚":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸环藤蛇·洛岚":{"zh":"它盘着一只早已停走的表，表针却一直跟着鳞片慢慢移动。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"It coils around a stopped watch. The hands keep moving with the scales. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸巡灯使·米岚":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。纸上有你尚未说出口的一句回答。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. The page contains an answer you have not spoken yet."},"星铸窑心偶·岚岚":{"zh":"罐底写着一个寄件地址，邮差看完后拒绝再进这栋楼。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"A return address is written under the jar. The postman refuses to enter the building after reading it. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"折光灯议长·索岚":{"zh":"罗杰，档案称“光孔搬运工”。他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Roger, filed as Pinhole Porter. He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·莱岚":{"zh":"科拉，档案称“镜蚀长龙”。桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Cora, filed as Etched Wyrm. Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·岑岚":{"zh":"奥尔登，档案称“重曝门卫”。护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Alden, filed as Exposed Keeper. Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光镜瞳山猫领誓·塔岚":{"zh":"皮普，档案称“倒瞳猫”。猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Pip, filed as Backeye Cat. The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光锈鬃豕领誓·莫岚":{"zh":"野猪拱开的泥土里埋着病历，最后一页还没有填上日期。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Medical records lie beneath the soil the boar turns over. The final page has no date yet. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光钩针蝎领誓·伦岚":{"zh":"蝎子的尾刺停在封条上方，封条里的东西也不再响了。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The scorpion holds its sting above the seal. Whatever is inside has fallen silent. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光石指傀儡领誓·佩岚":{"zh":"这只手保留着完整的指纹，却没有任何一枚指甲长在正面。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The hand retains every fingerprint. None of its nails grows on the front. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·泽岚":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光灯议长·图岚":{"zh":"她把口供念得很慢，每到自己的名字，窗外就响起刹车声。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"She reads her statement slowly. Tires screech outside whenever she reaches her name. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·芮岚":{"zh":"奎恩，档案称“倒瞳执勤者”。这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Quinn, filed as Backeye Watchman. The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·阿泽":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·艾泽":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·伊泽":{"zh":"它收拢翅膀时遮住了月亮，水面上却没有多出一块阴影。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Its folded wings cover the moon. No additional shadow appears on the water. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·欧泽":{"zh":"高处传来巨大的抓挠声，屋顶的灰尘却都从里面向外扬起。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Heavy claws scrape overhead. Dust rises from inside the roof and drifts outward. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光磐颚河兽领誓·乌泽":{"zh":"它张口时露出一颗陌生的门牙，牙根上还绕着医院拆下的细线。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"An unfamiliar incisor shows when it opens its mouth. Hospital suture still circles the root. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫领誓·依泽":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光灯议长·雅泽":{"zh":"他用示波器听取墙内的声音，波形偶尔排成一行可读的字。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He listens to the wall through an oscilloscope. Sometimes the waveform arranges itself into readable words. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·诺泽":{"zh":"照片只拍到了它的一只眼，取景器里却一直显示两张脸。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The photograph catches one eye. The viewfinder continues to register two faces. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光攀钟猿领誓·瑟泽":{"zh":"它照着监控学会了举手，镜头停转后仍举着一张不存在的证件。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"It learned to raise its hand from the camera feed. When the feed stops, it keeps holding up an absent identity card. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·维泽":{"zh":"桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光枝灯树灵领誓·希泽":{"zh":"海泽尔，档案称“断像枯树”。墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Hazel, filed as Cutimage Tree. Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光静棱铠卫":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光绒雾铠卫":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光夜航铠卫":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光苔痕浮辉使":{"zh":"门禁只记下了一个人的重量，监控里却有两个影子走进来。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The access sensor recorded one person’s weight. Two shadows enter on the camera feed. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光流砂铠卫":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光镜纹铠卫":{"zh":"值勤腰带少了一样东西，空出来的位置比枪套还要重。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Something is missing from the duty belt. The empty space weighs more than the holster. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光苔痕裂角客":{"zh":"额骨撑破了旧帽子的边缘，证件上仍写着一个普通职业。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The forehead has split the old cap. The identity card still lists an ordinary occupation. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铜缄观灯师":{"zh":"她在空白磁带上做记号，说录音是从擦掉的部分开始的。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"She marks a blank tape. She says the recording begins in the part that was erased. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"它的影子有两种轮廓，轮到报姓名时，只有其中一个动嘴。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Its shadow has two outlines. Only one mouth moves when it gives a name. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铜缄枝灯树灵":{"zh":"叶脉像一张熟悉的街区图，缺的那条巷子从来没有人走出来。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The leaf veins resemble a familiar street map. Nobody has ever returned from the missing lane. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光苔痕甲灯虫":{"zh":"虫翅沾着洗印药水，飞行时在灯下抖出一小串褪色的人脸。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"Photographic chemicals stain its wings. Faces shake loose beneath the lamp when it flies. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铜缄钩针蝎":{"zh":"它把砂粒推进细缝，最后填出的形状像一枚失踪的指环。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"It pushes sand into the crack until the outline resembles a missing ring. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光苔痕地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"虫身里能看见吞下的纸条，上面的字朝着相反方向缓慢爬动。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"A swallowed note shows through the worm’s body. Its letters move slowly in the opposite direction. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铜缄地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"它沿着地缝前行，身后露出的砖面比房屋本身更陈旧。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"It follows the crack in the floor, exposing brickwork older than the house. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光回声巡灯使":{"zh":"这名乘客一直握着空票夹，说目的地写在车站的另一面。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"The passenger holds an empty ticket wallet. He says the destination is on the other side of the station. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光苔痕窑心偶":{"zh":"陶罐里面没有盖章的文件，封口处却留下了一圈完整的指印。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"No stamped papers remain in the jar. An unbroken ring of fingerprints surrounds its mouth. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光远路铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光石封铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光鸣枝铠卫":{"zh":"他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光铠卫·洛泽":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光铠卫·米泽":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光铠卫·岚泽":{"zh":"他的证件照闭着眼，见到你之后，照片里的眼睛才睁开。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"His identification photograph has its eyes shut. They open after he meets you. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光巡灯使·索泽":{"zh":"他来报失踪，拿出的照片是自己，背面写着尚未发生的事。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He comes to report a disappearance. The photograph is his own, with events that have not happened written on the back. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光巡灯使·莱泽":{"zh":"她拒绝进入镜头，只愿站在照片已经被裁掉的那个位置。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"She refuses to enter the frame. She will stand only where the photograph has already been cropped. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光巡灯使·岑泽":{"zh":"他没有说谎，录音里的回答却总比你提出问题早半拍。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He is not lying. On the recording, his answers arrive a fraction before your questions. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫·塔泽":{"zh":"外套里面缝着许多旧徽章，最靠近心口的一枚没有编号。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"Old badges line his coat. The one nearest his heart has no number. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光巡灯使·莫泽":{"zh":"她认得每条街，唯独说不出自己那栋房子白天在哪里。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"She knows every street. She cannot say where her house goes during the day. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光枝灯树灵·伦泽":{"zh":"枝条钻进密封的档案袋，只在被涂黑的地方重新长出芽。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"A branch enters a sealed evidence bag. Buds grow only over the redacted passages. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光巡灯使·佩泽":{"zh":"他把收据按日期排好，最旧的一张仍带着你掌心的温度。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He sorts the receipts by date. The oldest still carries the warmth of your hand. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光巡灯使·泽泽":{"zh":"电话接通后，他只听不说，隔壁房间却传来同样的呼吸。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He listens without speaking when the call connects. The same breathing comes from the next room. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫·图泽":{"zh":"他答应守住那扇门，问到里面是什么时，却先看你的背后。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"He promises to hold the door. Asked what is inside, he looks behind you before answering. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光铠卫·芮泽":{"zh":"警棍上留着细密的齿印，他说那不是用来打人的一端。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"Fine tooth marks cover the baton. He says they are on the end he never uses to strike. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光巡灯使·阿翎":{"zh":"她说自己来认领遗物，清单上每一样东西都还在你身上。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"She has come to collect personal effects. Every item on the list is still on your person. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"折光铠卫·艾翎":{"zh":"这套旧甲只在无人说话时响动，像有人仍在里面找出口。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"The old armor moves only when the room falls silent, as though someone inside is looking for a way out. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光铠卫·伊翎":{"zh":"他承认曾经离开岗位，却拒绝说明是谁替他签完了整夜。放大的底片里还藏着一间更小的暗房。","en":"He admits leaving his post. He will not say who signed the log for the rest of the night. The enlarged negative contains a smaller darkroom."},"折光巡灯使·欧翎":{"zh":"他不肯在口供上落款，纸张下方却慢慢浮出一笔熟悉的字。负片室里的红灯从来没有真正亮过。","en":"He will not sign the statement. Familiar handwriting slowly appears at the foot of the page. The red lamp in the negative room has never actually lit."},"苔庭暖灰缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"苔庭铜缄掠风鸟":{"zh":"鸦羽粘在没有开启过的窗缝，羽轴上刻着很小的门牌号码。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"Raven feathers cling to a window that has never opened. Tiny street numbers mark their shafts. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭悬灯缄骨客":{"zh":"它的牙齿已经不齐，录音里的齿音却清楚得像贴着话筒。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"Its teeth are incomplete. The sibilants on the tape sound as if its mouth is pressed to the microphone. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"砂镜铠卫·乌翎":{"zh":"这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜观灯师·依翎":{"zh":"他的测绘纸只画房间内侧，折起之后，外面便多出一扇门。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"His survey shows only the inside of the room. Folded shut, it leaves an extra door outside. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"砂镜修灯师·雅翎":{"zh":"他让你握住一盏检查灯，自己的影子却留在手术台上不动。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"He asks you to hold the examination lamp. His shadow remains motionless on the operating table. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜铠卫领誓·诺翎":{"zh":"埃利斯，档案称“灰签巡守”。巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"Ellis, filed as Greytab Patrol. The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"霜枝铜缄风蚀铠卫":{"zh":"他检查每个人的通行证，轮到自己时，指尖总会停很久。等车的人始终没有在地上留下重量。","en":"He checks every pass. When he reaches his own, his fingers remain still for a long time. The waiting passengers leave no weight in the snow."},"暮潮回声棱耳猎犬":{"zh":"项圈里刻着两户人家的地址，其中一户在地图上没有位置。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"Two addresses are engraved inside the collar. One has no position on the map. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"苔庭银露缄骨客":{"zh":"他记得被埋在哪里，却总把回家的路说成另一座墓的地址。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"He remembers where he was buried. His directions home always end at another grave. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"暮潮流砂潜印客":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。码头上的湿脚印始终没有上岸。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The wet footprints on the pier never reach land."},"暮潮微烛织光蛛":{"zh":"它在监控镜头前结网，网后的走廊比现场记录多了一扇门。沉港的潮位表在低潮处画着一道门。","en":"It webs over the security lens. The corridor beyond has one more door than the scene report. A door is drawn at low tide on the Sunken Harbor chart."},"暮潮镜纹折面星客":{"zh":"照片中的五官都在正确位置，合在一起却无法让人记住。船票的返程日期比出发早了一周。","en":"Every feature occupies the right place in the photograph. Together, they cannot be remembered. The return date on the ticket is a week before departure."},"苔庭缄骨客·维翎":{"zh":"这具身体的旧伤都合上了，缝线却在向皮肤外缓慢生长。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"The body’s old wounds have closed. The sutures are slowly growing out through the skin. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"苔庭回声地缝蠕虫":{"zh":"录音里有细小的啃咬声，停下播放，桌下仍能听见。雨停以后，值班室里仍能听到水声。","en":"A faint chewing sound marks the recording. It continues beneath the table after playback stops. Water can still be heard in the duty room after the rain stops."},"苔庭雾羽缄骨客":{"zh":"它不追赶活人，只会跟着那些已经登记过死亡的姓名走。调查员把它记进了第二份失踪记录。","en":"It does not pursue the living. It follows names that have already been entered in the death register. The investigator entered it in the second missing-person report."},"砂镜回声浮辉使":{"zh":"有人试着给它拍照，洗出的纸上只有一块始终不干的水迹。档案室保存着这份证词的另一种结局。","en":"Someone tried to photograph it. The print holds only a patch of water that never dries. The archive holds another ending to the same statement."},"砂镜绒雾缄骨客":{"zh":"封棺时少了一颗钉子，后来在他的外衣口袋里找到了。空出的案卷位置已经积了很厚的灰。","en":"A nail was missing when the coffin was sealed. It was later found in his coat pocket. Thick dust fills the space where the file should be."},"霜枝铜缄静棱铠卫":{"zh":"护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。站台的旧广播每天都把你的名字念错。","en":"Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The old platform announcement mispronounces your name each day."},"霜枝藤印潜印客":{"zh":"她会替人藏起证词，但每份副本都在最不该出现的地方找到。站台的旧广播每天都把你的名字念错。","en":"She hides statements for people. Every copy is found where it ought least to be. The old platform announcement mispronounces your name each day."},"星铸回声线尾鼠":{"zh":"这只鼠的湿毛里夹着纸屑，拼在一起恰好是你昨晚的口供。白室的门牌从里面看也是同一个号码。","en":"Paper scraps cling to the rat’s wet fur. Together they form last night’s statement in your handwriting. The White Room’s door bears the same number on the inside."},"星铸回声微烛铠卫":{"zh":"巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。所有窗户都朝向同一面没有窗的墙。","en":"The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. Every window faces the same wall, which has no windows."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·塔安":{"zh":"阿奇，档案称“复卷守备”。护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。原件的金边没有褪色，背面却比上次多了一行字。","en":"Archie, filed as Refolded Sentry. Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The original’s gold border has not faded. Another line has appeared on its back."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·莫安":{"zh":"沃尔特，档案称“旧印门卫”。他把盾放在椅背上，凹痕朝着室内，像是防备里面的人。金色封条重新贴好，签名的位置却留下了另一种笔迹。","en":"Walter, filed as Oldseal Keeper. He rests his shield against the chair, dents facing inward, as if the room needs containing. The gold seal has been replaced. A different hand marks the signature line."},"鎏金·砂镜潮纹游鱼领誓·依瑟":{"zh":"珀西，档案称“漏页鱼”。鱼鳃里夹着一小块墙纸，花纹与失踪者卧室的照片相同。镀金的相框内没有换过照片，站在里面的位置却变了。","en":"Percy, filed as Leafless Fish. A scrap of wallpaper is caught in the fish’s gill. Its pattern matches the missing person’s bedroom. The gilt frame still holds the same photograph. Its subject has changed position."},"鎏金·砂镜灯议长·维瑟":{"zh":"奥斯卡，档案称“无字药师”。她给伤口换上新的绷带，拆下来的旧布里却没有一点血。这份镶金的副本更清楚，也比原件多保留了一点背景。","en":"Oscar, filed as Wordless Chemist. She changes the dressing. There is no blood anywhere in the cloth she removes. The gilt copy is clearer. It preserves a little more of the background than the original."},"鎏金·折光灯议长·索岚":{"zh":"罗杰，档案称“光孔搬运工”。他记得你的脸，却坚持你们第一次见面是在明天的停尸房。旧印章压在金箔上，印出的日期比记忆早了一天。","en":"Roger, filed as Pinhole Porter. He remembers your face. He insists you first met tomorrow, in the morgue. The old stamp presses into gold foil. Its date is a day earlier than remembered."},"鎏金·折光镜瞳山猫领誓·塔岚":{"zh":"皮普，档案称“倒瞳猫”。猫从不碰那只纸箱，夜里却会向箱内一个看不见的东西让路。金边下压着一根细线，另一端留在上次离开的地方。","en":"Pip, filed as Backeye Cat. The cat never touches the box. At night it steps aside for something leaving it. A thread runs under the gold border. Its other end remains where you last left."},"鎏金·折光铠卫领誓·岑岚":{"zh":"奥尔登，档案称“重曝门卫”。护面里传出另一个人的呼吸，他说执勤表上的姓名已经划掉了。这张金色留档没有增加新证词，只删掉了一个不在场证明。","en":"Alden, filed as Exposed Keeper. Someone else breathes inside the visor. He says his name has been struck from the duty roster. The gold record adds no testimony. It removes one alibi."},"鎏金·折光枝灯树灵领誓·希泽":{"zh":"海泽尔，档案称“断像枯树”。墙内长出的根缠着旧电线，切断电源后仍会轻轻发热。随行的金色副本没有受潮，里面却能听见和原件相同的雨声。","en":"Hazel, filed as Cutimage Tree. Roots inside the wall coil around old wiring. They stay warm after the power is cut. The gilt copy has stayed dry. The same rain as the original can be heard inside."},"鎏金·砂镜铠卫领誓·诺翎":{"zh":"埃利斯，档案称“灰签巡守”。巡逻靴始终干净，鞋底夹着的泥却来自一条已经填平的河。他把这份金边证物带在身边，仍不肯解释空着的落款。","en":"Ellis, filed as Greytab Patrol. The patrol boots stay clean. Mud caught in the soles comes from a river that was filled in. He carries the gilt evidence with him, still unwilling to explain its blank signature line."},"鎏金·折光铠卫领誓·芮岚":{"zh":"奎恩，档案称“倒瞳执勤者”。这名警卫从不摘手套，交回的钥匙却每次都带着新的指纹。金色夹页已经翻旧了，纸上的第一处现场仍然没有结束。","en":"Quinn, filed as Backeye Watchman. The guard never removes his gloves. The returned keys bear a fresh fingerprint each time. The gold insert is worn. The first scene recorded on it has not ended."},"鎏金·砂镜织光蛛领誓·阿瑟":{"zh":"伊迪丝，档案称“盲档蛛”。蛛网没有粘住飞虫，空出的结点却对应着几处失踪者的住址。封条是金色的，收件人却被涂成了和上一份相同的空白。","en":"Edith, filed as Blinddoc Spider. No insects are caught in the web. Its empty junctions correspond to missing persons’ addresses. The seal is gold. The recipient has been redacted into the same blank as the previous copy."},"鎏金·折光晶棘蜥龙领誓·莱岚":{"zh":"科拉，档案称“镜蚀长龙”。桥下留下成片的鳞屑，最大的一片比失踪车辆的车门还宽。新增的金色标记停在门外，同行者都说自己没有画过它。","en":"Cora, filed as Etched Wyrm. Sheets of scale remain beneath the bridge. The largest is wider than the missing car’s door. A new gold mark stops outside the door. Every companion denies drawing it."},"苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"zh":"诺亚，档案称“守夜人”。守夜人把缺口朝外的搪瓷杯推过来，瞥了一眼停在03:17的表。“登记人也得签字。”他说。你认得最后那一笔，想问是谁写的，他却先把案卷折好，压在自己的值班簿下面。","en":"Noah, filed as Night Watch. The Night Watch pushes over an enamel cup, its chipped side turned away, and glances at the watch stopped at 03:17. “The reporting person signs too.” You recognize the last stroke. Before you can ask who wrote it, he folds the file under his own duty book."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"zh":"诺亚，档案称“守夜人”。金边值班簿的最后一页没有封住。守夜人递来一支笔，笔帽上的齿印恰好贴合你的牙。“多放一把椅子吧。”他说。钟停在03:17，你终于看见，报失踪和接班，用的是同一张表。","en":"Noah, filed as Night Watch. The gold-edged duty book lies open at its last page. The pen he offers has tooth marks that fit your teeth. “Another chair, perhaps.” The clock reads 03:17. At last you see that reporting someone missing and taking a shift use the same form."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"zh":"亚伯，档案称“断角客”。他额头上的硬角刮伤了测量尺。档案写着先天畸形，附上的出生照里却没有这个人。","en":"Abel, filed as Broken Horn. The hard growths on his forehead have scored the measuring rule. The file calls it a birth defect. The attached birth photograph contains no child."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"zh":"亚伯，档案称“断角客”。他额头上的硬角刮伤了测量尺。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Abel, filed as Broken Horn. The hard growths on his forehead have scored the measuring rule. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"zh":"布鲁诺，档案称“井牛”。牛栏里只有一头牛，地上却有两排工鞋印。它顶开木板时，栏外那排脚印也向你靠近。","en":"Bruno, filed as Well Bull. One bull stands in the pen, but two rows of work-boot prints cross the mud. When it shoulders the boards aside, the prints outside move closer."},"鎏金·苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"zh":"布鲁诺，档案称“井牛”。牛栏里只有一头牛，地上却有两排工鞋印。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Bruno, filed as Well Bull. One bull stands in the pen, but two rows of work-boot prints cross the mud. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"zh":"西拉，档案称“倒吊客”。他们说屋顶上的焦印来自雷击。你等到雨停，才发现焦印下面有人站立过的干燥轮廓。","en":"Silas, filed as Hanged Guest. They blame the scorched roof on lightning. After the rain stops, you find a dry outline beneath it, the shape of someone standing there."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"zh":"西拉，档案称“倒吊客”。他们说屋顶上的焦印来自雷击。封存后留下的指纹，不属于任何到过这里的人。","en":"Silas, filed as Hanged Guest. They blame the scorched roof on lightning. The prints left after sealing belong to nobody who has been here."},"苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"zh":"芬恩，档案称“空手人”。他把口供中间一页藏进袖口，证人的座位随即换到了窗边。录音里，椅子却没有移动过。","en":"Finn, filed as Empty Hands. He slips the middle page of the statement into his sleeve. The witness is suddenly seated by the window. On the tape, no chair has moved."},"鎏金·苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"zh":"芬恩，档案称“空手人”。他把口供中间一页藏进袖口，证人的座位随即换到了窗边。录音中多了一次呼吸，恰好填满你沉默的地方。","en":"Finn, filed as Empty Hands. He slips the middle page of the statement into his sleeve. An extra breath on the tape exactly fills your silence."},"苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"zh":"欧文，档案称“旧警卫”。旧警卫用鞋跟磕掉门槛上的泥，再把烟掐灭，夹回湿透的烟盒。他说戒烟最难的是打发夜班。你注意到每根烟都剩同样长，滤嘴上，是几个月后才会印出的日期。","en":"Owen, filed as Old Guard. The Old Guard knocks mud from the sill with his heel, stubs out his cigarette, and returns it to a wet packet. Quitting, he says, leaves too much of the night to fill. Every cigarette is the same length. Their filters bear a date months away."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"zh":"欧文，档案称“旧警卫”。旧警卫用鞋跟磕掉门槛上的泥，再把烟掐灭，夹回湿透的烟盒。他说戒烟最难的是打发夜班。你注意到每根烟都剩同样长，滤嘴上，是几个月后才会印出的日期。","en":"Owen, filed as Old Guard. The Old Guard knocks mud from the sill with his heel, stubs out his cigarette, and returns it to a wet packet. Quitting, he says, leaves too much of the night to fill. Every cigarette is the same length. Their filters bear a date months away."},"苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"zh":"伊拉，档案称“报丧蝶”。蝶翅上的纹路像两个相向的人脸。照片两端各少了一名证人，底片却没有裁剪的痕迹。","en":"Ira, filed as Mourning Moth. The markings on its wings resemble two faces turned toward each other. A witness is missing from each edge of the photograph. The negative has not been cropped."},"鎏金·苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"zh":"伊拉，档案称“报丧蝶”。蝶翅上的纹路像两个相向的人脸。被删去的那一行，在你合上纸张后重新出现。","en":"Ira, filed as Mourning Moth. The markings on its wings resemble two faces turned toward each other. The deleted line returns after you fold the sheet."},"苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"zh":"梅布尔，档案称“井蛛”。蛛网里没有猎物，只有剪下来的门牌。每一块都来自同一条已经拆除的街，背面带着温度。","en":"Mabel, filed as Well Spider. The web holds no prey, only house numbers cut from their doors. All belong to a street demolished years ago. Their backs are still warm."},"鎏金·苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"zh":"梅布尔，档案称“井蛛”。蛛网里没有猎物，只有剪下来的门牌。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Mabel, filed as Well Spider. The web holds no prey, only house numbers cut from their doors. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"zh":"雨果，档案称“搬尸人”。他比值班室的门框还高，进门时却不用弯腰。你量了两遍，少掉的那段长度都在自己这边。","en":"Hugo, filed as Body Porter. He is taller than the duty-room doorway, yet enters without stooping. You measure twice. Each time the missing length comes from your side."},"鎏金·苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"zh":"雨果，档案称“搬尸人”。他比值班室的门框还高，进门时却不用弯腰。交接栏只有一个签名，墨迹分成了不同的年份。","en":"Hugo, filed as Body Porter. He is taller than the duty-room doorway, yet enters without stooping. The handover field has one signature, written in inks from different years."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"zh":"里昂，档案称“无证者”。他的手电每隔片刻就会闪一下，收音机同时停声。维修记录说两件东西从未装过电池。","en":"Leon, filed as No Witness. His torch flashes at intervals, and the radio falls silent each time. The service record says neither device has ever contained a battery."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"zh":"里昂，档案称“无证者”。他的手电每隔片刻就会闪一下，收音机同时停声。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Leon, filed as No Witness. His torch flashes at intervals, and the radio falls silent each time. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"zh":"里德，档案称“桥下卫”。他只敲走廊中间那扇门。门后的住户说自己住在尽头，两份租约上的指纹却完全一致。","en":"Reed, filed as Bridge Guard. He knocks only at the middle door. The tenant behind it insists he lives at the far end. Both leases carry the same fingerprints."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"zh":"里德，档案称“桥下卫”。他只敲走廊中间那扇门。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Reed, filed as Bridge Guard. He knocks only at the middle door. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"zh":"阿莫斯，档案称“掘墓人”。焚化登记上划掉了他的名字，骨灰袋却每天多一个。最新那袋很轻，里面有鞋底留下的灰。","en":"Amos, filed as Gravedigger. His name has been crossed out in the cremation register, but another ash bag appears each day. The newest is light. It holds dust from a shoe sole."},"鎏金·苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"zh":"阿莫斯，档案称“掘墓人”。焚化登记上划掉了他的名字，骨灰袋却每天多一个。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Amos, filed as Gravedigger. His name has been crossed out in the cremation register, but another ash bag appears each day. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"zh":"赛斯，档案称“誓证人”。他把枪放在桌上，整夜没有碰过。天亮后枪口仍然温热，墙上的新刻痕比昨天多了一道。","en":"Seth, filed as Sworn Witness. He leaves the gun on the table all night. At dawn the barrel is warm, and the wall has gained a fresh notch."},"鎏金·苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"zh":"赛斯，档案称“誓证人”。他把枪放在桌上，整夜没有碰过。他保留了空白那页，说那里曾经写过你的去向。","en":"Seth, filed as Sworn Witness. He leaves the gun on the table all night. He keeps the blank page. He says it once gave your destination."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"zh":"埃兹拉，档案称“雾龙”。山上的长影被写成一场误认。你找到脱落的翼膜，气象站却坚持那晚没有任何东西经过。","en":"Ezra, filed as Mist Drake. The long shape above the hill was filed as a mistaken sighting. You find a piece of wing membrane. The weather station insists nothing crossed the sky that night."},"鎏金·苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"zh":"埃兹拉，档案称“雾龙”。山上的长影被写成一场误认。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Ezra, filed as Mist Drake. The long shape above the hill was filed as a mistaken sighting. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"zh":"科尔，档案称“灰客”。他的证件照每次复印都会换一张脸，纸角却保留同一处折痕。被换下的脸出现在失踪名单里。","en":"Cole, filed as Ash Guest. Each copy of his identity photograph shows a different face, but the same folded corner remains. The discarded faces appear on the missing-person list."},"鎏金·苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"zh":"科尔，档案称“灰客”。他的证件照每次复印都会换一张脸，纸角却保留同一处折痕。相同的证物出现了两次，第二次带着你的体温。","en":"Cole, filed as Ash Guest. Each copy of his identity photograph shows a different face, but the same folded corner remains. The same exhibit appears twice. The second is warm with your body heat."},"苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"zh":"尼尔斯，档案称“收信人”。桌上只剩一根燃过的火柴，他却说还没开始值夜。你抬手挡光，影子已经替你落下了牌。","en":"Niles, filed as Letter Keeper. One spent match lies on the desk. He says his night shift has not begun. You raise a hand against the glare; your shadow has already played a card."},"鎏金·苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"zh":"尼尔斯，档案称“收信人”。桌上只剩一根燃过的火柴，他却说还没开始值夜。你找到另一份结案页，订书钉下没有任何纸张。","en":"Niles, filed as Letter Keeper. One spent match lies on the desk. You find another closing sheet. Its staple holds no paper."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"zh":"奥托，档案称“敲钟人”。敲钟人给手心抹松香，细细揉进旧茧。他替你扶了一下楼梯，力气轻得出奇。“这份工伤耳朵。”他笑着说。楼顶没有钟，楼下卖耳塞的柜台却从没关过门。","en":"Otto, filed as Bell Ringer. The Bell Ringer works rosin into the calluses on his palms, then steadies the stair for you with surprising gentleness. “Hard on the ears, this job.” There is no bell above. Below, the counter selling earplugs has never closed."},"鎏金·铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"zh":"奥托，档案称“敲钟人”。敲钟人给手心抹松香，细细揉进旧茧。他替你扶了一下楼梯，力气轻得出奇。“这份工伤耳朵。”他笑着说。楼顶没有钟，楼下卖耳塞的柜台却从没关过门。","en":"Otto, filed as Bell Ringer. The Bell Ringer works rosin into the calluses on his palms, then steadies the stair for you with surprising gentleness. “Hard on the ears, this job.” There is no bell above. Below, the counter selling earplugs has never closed."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"zh":"库尔特，档案称“铁面人”。他只在钟摆越过中线时换岗。你拍下的连续照片里，走廊始终空着，钥匙却逐张向前移动。","en":"Kurt, filed as Iron Mask. He changes post only as the pendulum crosses its center. The corridor is empty in every photograph, but the key advances a little in each frame."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"zh":"库尔特，档案称“铁面人”。他只在钟摆越过中线时换岗。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Kurt, filed as Iron Mask. He changes post only as the pendulum crosses its center. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"zh":"埃米尔，档案称“空壳人”。他站着的地方总会留下另一道人形凹痕。清晨的检修员摸到凹痕时，说里面还站着人。","en":"Emil, filed as Hollow Man. A second human-shaped hollow remains wherever he stands. The morning inspector touches it and says someone is still inside."},"鎏金·铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"zh":"埃米尔，档案称“空壳人”。他站着的地方总会留下另一道人形凹痕。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Emil, filed as Hollow Man. A second human-shaped hollow remains wherever he stands. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"zh":"艾达，档案称“账房”。账房把算盘珠子擦得发亮，给你倒茶时也没停手。“欠着吧，出去再算。”你在账本上找到一笔早饭钱，字写得很熟。那顿早饭你还没吃，欠账的人已经付过三次。","en":"Ada, filed as Ledger Clerk. The Bookkeeper polishes the abacus beads while pouring your tea. “On credit. Settle outside.” In the ledger, a charge for breakfast is written in a familiar hand. You have not eaten it yet. Whoever owes it has already paid three times."},"鎏金·铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"zh":"艾达，档案称“账房”。账房把算盘珠子擦得发亮，给你倒茶时也没停手。“欠着吧，出去再算。”你在账本上找到一笔早饭钱，字写得很熟。那顿早饭你还没吃，欠账的人已经付过三次。","en":"Ada, filed as Ledger Clerk. The Bookkeeper polishes the abacus beads while pouring your tea. “On credit. Settle outside.” In the ledger, a charge for breakfast is written in a familiar hand. You have not eaten it yet. Whoever owes it has already paid three times."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"zh":"莫里斯，档案称“守尸人”。钟楼地下收着一辆没有座位的小车，轮轴内缠着细骨。它行过的轨道，总比图纸多转一圈。","en":"Morris, filed as Mortuary Guard. A small cart without a seat is kept beneath the tower. Thin bones wind around its axle. Its track always makes one more turn than the plan shows."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"zh":"莫里斯，档案称“守尸人”。钟楼地下收着一辆没有座位的小车，轮轴内缠着细骨。录音中多了一次呼吸，恰好填满你沉默的地方。","en":"Morris, filed as Mortuary Guard. A small cart without a seat is kept beneath the tower. An extra breath on the tape exactly fills your silence."},"铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"zh":"巴兹尔，档案称“盘钟蛇”。蛇蜕被装进医务盒，里面的药瓶却都贴着人名。负责保管的人说，吞下去才知道谁还活着。","en":"Basil, filed as Bell Serpent. The shed snakeskin is stored in a medical box. Every bottle inside bears a person's name. The custodian says you must swallow before you know who is alive."},"鎏金·铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"zh":"巴兹尔，档案称“盘钟蛇”。蛇蜕被装进医务盒，里面的药瓶却都贴着人名。你发现修补过的地方，正好绕开了照片里的自己。","en":"Basil, filed as Bell Serpent. The shed snakeskin is stored in a medical box. The repaired area passes carefully around your own figure in the photograph."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"zh":"拉尔斯，档案称“炉边客”。他的袖口一直在冒热气，摸上去却是冷的。消防报告记着一名死者，伤情栏填的是冻伤。","en":"Lars, filed as Stove Guest. Steam rises from his cuffs, though the cloth is cold to the touch. The fire report lists one fatality. Under injuries it says frostbite."},"鎏金·铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"zh":"拉尔斯，档案称“炉边客”。他的袖口一直在冒热气，摸上去却是冷的。被删去的那一行，在你合上纸张后重新出现。","en":"Lars, filed as Stove Guest. Steam rises from his cuffs, though the cloth is cold to the touch. The deleted line returns after you fold the sheet."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"zh":"费利克斯，档案称“拆钟人”。他把三张烧黑的照片并排放好，中间那张开始漏出灰。你把它移开，另外两张仍保持着间距。","en":"Felix, filed as Clock Breaker. He sets three charred photographs in a row. Ash spills from the middle one. You remove it; the other two remain the same distance apart."},"鎏金·铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"zh":"费利克斯，档案称“拆钟人”。他把三张烧黑的照片并排放好，中间那张开始漏出灰。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Felix, filed as Clock Breaker. He sets three charred photographs in a row. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"zh":"格蕾塔，档案称“缝钟蛛”。它把卵袋藏在停摆的钟里，表盘后面传来细小的指甲声。清点时，记在纸上的数目自己增加了。","en":"Greta, filed as Clock Spider. Its egg sac is hidden in a stopped clock. Small nails scratch behind the dial. During the count, the number on the sheet increases by itself."},"鎏金·铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"zh":"格蕾塔，档案称“缝钟蛛”。它把卵袋藏在停摆的钟里，表盘后面传来细小的指甲声。交接栏只有一个签名，墨迹分成了不同的年份。","en":"Greta, filed as Clock Spider. Its egg sac is hidden in a stopped clock. The handover field has one signature, written in inks from different years."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"zh":"伊万，档案称“不眠者”。他身上的缝合线与旧钟绳是同一种纤维。伤口闭合后，钟楼里就会有一架钟重新开始计时。","en":"Ivan, filed as The Sleepless. The thread in his stitches is the same fiber as the old bell ropes. Whenever a wound closes, another clock in the tower begins keeping time."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"zh":"伊万，档案称“不眠者”。他身上的缝合线与旧钟绳是同一种纤维。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Ivan, filed as The Sleepless. The thread in his stitches is the same fiber as the old bell ropes. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"zh":"鲍里斯，档案称“刺衣卫”。镜面盾里映着两个人，盾外只有他。你问起第二个人，他把反光面转向了失踪告示。","en":"Boris, filed as Bristle Guard. Two people appear in the mirrored shield, though only he stands outside it. When you ask about the other, he turns the glass toward a missing-person notice."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"zh":"鲍里斯，档案称“刺衣卫”。镜面盾里映着两个人，盾外只有他。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Boris, filed as Bristle Guard. Two people appear in the mirrored shield, though only he stands outside it. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"zh":"莉娜，档案称“饮露人”。他说自己不需要进食，证物袋里的牙齿却每天少一颗。最新的检验报告上，多了你的牙模。","en":"Lena, filed as Dew Drinker. He says he does not eat. A tooth disappears from the evidence bag each day. The newest examination report includes a mold of your teeth."},"鎏金·铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"zh":"莉娜，档案称“饮露人”。他说自己不需要进食，证物袋里的牙齿却每天少一颗。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Lena, filed as Dew Drinker. He says he does not eat. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"zh":"露丝，档案称“旧根”。树根顶穿了钟楼地板，分成两种颜色。值班员按明暗记录它的脉搏，却从不检查树干里面。","en":"Ruth, filed as Old Root. Roots break through the tower floor in two colors. The attendant records their pulse by light and dark, but never checks inside the trunk."},"鎏金·铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"zh":"露丝，档案称“旧根”。树根顶穿了钟楼地板，分成两种颜色。他保留了空白那页，说那里曾经写过你的去向。","en":"Ruth, filed as Old Root. Roots break through the tower floor in two colors. He keeps the blank page. He says it once gave your destination."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"zh":"维克托，档案称“讨债人”。他只在钟声压低时承认受了伤，随后就换一副嗓音。旧录音里，那声音一直在替你作证。","en":"Victor, filed as Debt Collector. He admits he is hurt only when the bells grow quiet. Then his voice changes. On the old tapes, that voice has always been giving evidence for you."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"zh":"维克托，档案称“讨债人”。他只在钟声压低时承认受了伤，随后就换一副嗓音。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Victor, filed as Debt Collector. He admits he is hurt only when the bells grow quiet. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"zh":"索尔，档案称“独眼卫”。他的口供总比提问晚半拍，铅笔却先一步写完答案。你按下暂停，纸上的字仍在继续。","en":"Saul, filed as One-Eye Guard. His statement trails each question by half a beat, though the pencil finishes its answer first. You pause the tape. The writing continues."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"zh":"索尔，档案称“独眼卫”。他的口供总比提问晚半拍，铅笔却先一步写完答案。相同的证物出现了两次，第二次带着你的体温。","en":"Saul, filed as One-Eye Guard. His statement trails each question by half a beat, though the pencil finishes its answer first. The same exhibit appears twice. The second is warm with your body heat."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"zh":"西里尔，档案称“报时人”。冻结的钟罩里封着一枚戒指，尺寸与你相同。他说别急着认领，失物登记上的日期还没有到。","en":"Cyril, filed as Timekeeper. A ring is sealed inside the frozen bell cover. It fits your finger. He says not to claim it yet; the date on the lost-property form has not arrived."},"鎏金·铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"zh":"西里尔，档案称“报时人”。冻结的钟罩里封着一枚戒指，尺寸与你相同。你找到另一份结案页，订书钉下没有任何纸张。","en":"Cyril, filed as Timekeeper. A ring is sealed inside the frozen bell cover. You find another closing sheet. Its staple holds no paper."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"zh":"古斯，档案称“炉门卫”。他沿着传送带巡逻，制服背后全是向前拖拽的手印。工厂停产以后，那些手印才开始出现。","en":"Gus, filed as Furnace Guard. He patrols the conveyor. Handprints drag forward across the back of his uniform. They began appearing only after the factory closed."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"zh":"古斯，档案称“炉门卫”。他沿着传送带巡逻，制服背后全是向前拖拽的手印。复印件上多出一行字，写的是你尚未问出口的问题。","en":"Gus, filed as Furnace Guard. He patrols the conveyor. The copy has gained a line: a question you have not asked yet."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"zh":"罗尔夫，档案称“铁醉汉”。安全帽内侧刻着一排名字，最浅的那个是你的。刮掉之前，他让你先确认谁还在使用这顶帽子。","en":"Rolf, filed as Iron Drunk. A row of names is cut inside his safety helmet. Yours is the shallowest. Before you scratch it out, he asks you to check who is still wearing it."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"zh":"罗尔夫，档案称“铁醉汉”。安全帽内侧刻着一排名字，最浅的那个是你的。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Rolf, filed as Iron Drunk. A row of names is cut inside his safety helmet. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"zh":"伊诺克，档案称“烟中人”。他从碎玻璃里取出另一副眼镜，两副镜片反射着不同的车间。佩戴记录却只允许他领取一副。","en":"Enoch, filed as Smoke Caller. He takes a second pair of glasses from the broken glass. The lenses reflect different workshops. His issue record permits only one pair."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"zh":"伊诺克，档案称“烟中人”。他从碎玻璃里取出另一副眼镜，两副镜片反射着不同的车间。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Enoch, filed as Smoke Caller. He takes a second pair of glasses from the broken glass. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"zh":"埃德温，档案称“灰医”。灰医先暖手，再碰你的伤口。药瓶上贴着手写标签，字挤得很小；他说药贵，纸也贵。绷带拆开时，伤口已经合拢。洗手盆里，却慢慢浮出一张浸着血的出院单。","en":"Edwin, filed as Ash Doctor. The Ash Doctor warms his hands before touching the wound. The labels on his bottles are crowded with tiny writing. Medicine costs money, he says; so does paper. Under the bandage, your skin has closed. A blood-soaked discharge slip rises in the washbasin."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"zh":"埃德温，档案称“灰医”。灰医先暖手，再碰你的伤口。药瓶上贴着手写标签，字挤得很小；他说药贵，纸也贵。绷带拆开时，伤口已经合拢。洗手盆里，却慢慢浮出一张浸着血的出院单。","en":"Edwin, filed as Ash Doctor. The Ash Doctor warms his hands before touching the wound. The labels on his bottles are crowded with tiny writing. Medicine costs money, he says; so does paper. Under the bandage, your skin has closed. A blood-soaked discharge slip rises in the washbasin."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"zh":"安东，档案称“复工者”。他把用完的工牌投入炉口，再从另一端取回一张新的。新照片里，站在他身边的人少了一个。","en":"Anton, filed as Shift Return. He feeds a used work pass into the furnace and takes a new one from the far end. One person beside him is missing from the new photograph."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"zh":"安东，档案称“复工者”。他把用完的工牌投入炉口，再从另一端取回一张新的。录音中多了一次呼吸，恰好填满你沉默的地方。","en":"Anton, filed as Shift Return. He feeds a used work pass into the furnace and takes a new one from the far end. An extra breath on the tape exactly fills your silence."},"炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"zh":"托比亚斯，档案称“拾骨人”。车间里一共三排空座，只有最外侧两排留下抓痕。他说最后下班的人，从来不坐中间。","en":"Tobias, filed as Bone Collector. There are three rows of empty seats in the workshop. Only the outer rows bear scratches. He says the last people to leave never sit in the middle."},"鎏金·炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"zh":"托比亚斯，档案称“拾骨人”。车间里一共三排空座，只有最外侧两排留下抓痕。你发现修补过的地方，正好绕开了照片里的自己。","en":"Tobias, filed as Bone Collector. There are three rows of empty seats in the workshop. The repaired area passes carefully around your own figure in the photograph."},"炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"zh":"伊妮德，档案称“洗片师”。洗片师把夹子挪远，给你腾出一块干净台面。醋味钻进鼻子，红灯下，水滴落得很慢。“先别认人。”他把照片翻过去。纸背已经写好合影名单，最下面一行，墨还没干。","en":"Enid, filed as Film Washer. The Darkroom Hand clears a dry patch of counter for you. Vinegar stings your nose. Drops fall slowly under the red lamp. “Do not identify anyone yet.” He turns the photograph over. Its group list is already written on the back. The last line is still wet."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"zh":"伊妮德，档案称“洗片师”。洗片师把夹子挪远，给你腾出一块干净台面。醋味钻进鼻子，红灯下，水滴落得很慢。“先别认人。”他把照片翻过去。纸背已经写好合影名单，最下面一行，墨还没干。","en":"Enid, filed as Film Washer. The Darkroom Hand clears a dry patch of counter for you. Vinegar stings your nose. Drops fall slowly under the red lamp. “Do not identify anyone yet.” He turns the photograph over. Its group list is already written on the back. The last line is still wet."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"zh":"霍勒斯，档案称“扛炉人”。他的体检表一直显示健康，纸边却有不断渗出的血迹。每次炉门响起，检验员就把表翻过去。","en":"Horace, filed as Furnace Porter. His examination form always says healthy, though blood seeps from its edge. Whenever the furnace door sounds, the examiner turns the sheet over."},"鎏金·炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"zh":"霍勒斯，档案称“扛炉人”。他的体检表一直显示健康，纸边却有不断渗出的血迹。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Horace, filed as Furnace Porter. His examination form always says healthy, though blood seeps from its edge. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"zh":"罗兰，档案称“烟衣卫”。他把火源标在了空白的车间图上，标记随脚步改变位置。报告里的燃烧时间，恰好是你闭眼的长度。","en":"Roland, filed as Smoke Guard. He marks the fire on a blank workshop plan. The mark moves with his footsteps. The recorded burn lasts exactly as long as you kept your eyes shut."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"zh":"罗兰，档案称“烟衣卫”。他把火源标在了空白的车间图上，标记随脚步改变位置。交接栏只有一个签名，墨迹分成了不同的年份。","en":"Roland, filed as Smoke Guard. He marks the fire on a blank workshop plan. The handover field has one signature, written in inks from different years."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"zh":"埃德加，档案称“封炉人”。他的护面罩内侧有一道闪电留下的纹路，外侧却没有烧伤。电工说，电流那晚是从里面出来的。","en":"Edgar, filed as Furnace Seal. A lightning pattern marks the inside of his face shield. The outer surface is unburned. The electrician says the current came from within that night."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"zh":"埃德加，档案称“封炉人”。他的护面罩内侧有一道闪电留下的纹路，外侧却没有烧伤。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Edgar, filed as Furnace Seal. A lightning pattern marks the inside of his face shield. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"zh":"菲伊，档案称“拾火者”。他替每份销毁记录保留一张副本，复印机却只能吐出薄薄一层人影。纸上的伤口都还没有愈合。","en":"Faye, filed as Fire Finder. He keeps a copy of every destruction record. The copier produces only thin human shapes. The wounds on the paper have not healed."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"zh":"菲伊，档案称“拾火者”。他替每份销毁记录保留一张副本，复印机却只能吐出薄薄一层人影。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Faye, filed as Fire Finder. He keeps a copy of every destruction record. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"zh":"薇拉，档案称“焚档人”。他在高压线旁站了一夜，衣服没有沾灰。只有工牌上的人像被吹到了照片背面，正面对着纸外。","en":"Vera, filed as File Burner. He stands beside the power line all night without gathering dust. Only his portrait has been blown to the back of the pass, facing out through the paper."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"zh":"薇拉，档案称“焚档人”。他在高压线旁站了一夜，衣服没有沾灰。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Vera, filed as File Burner. He stands beside the power line all night without gathering dust. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"zh":"马丁，档案称“返厂人”。他每次进入车间都会换一件工具，领料单从不重复。你把四张单据重叠，缺口恰好拼成一扇门。","en":"Martin, filed as Shift Ghost. He takes a different tool into the workshop each time. The issue slips never repeat. Overlaid, four slips have a gap shaped like a door."},"鎏金·炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"zh":"马丁，档案称“返厂人”。他每次进入车间都会换一件工具，领料单从不重复。他保留了空白那页，说那里曾经写过你的去向。","en":"Martin, filed as Shift Ghost. He takes a different tool into the workshop each time. He keeps the blank page. He says it once gave your destination."},"炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"zh":"迈尔斯，档案称“热线员”。他的口供有三种版本，分别写在纸的正面、背面和夹层。检验员说那只是一张没有夹层的纸。","en":"Miles, filed as Hotline Clerk. His statement has three versions: front, back, and between. The examiner insists it is one sheet, with nothing between its surfaces."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"zh":"迈尔斯，档案称“热线员”。他的口供有三种版本，分别写在纸的正面、背面和夹层。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Miles, filed as Hotline Clerk. His statement has three versions: front, back, and between. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"zh":"雷克斯，档案称“炉龙”。炉灰里挖出一片带鳞的铁皮，弯曲时会发出很远的呼吸声。车间平面图上，没有能容下它的地方。","en":"Rex, filed as Furnace Drake. A scaled sheet of metal is dug from the furnace ash. Bent, it gives a breath from far away. No space on the workshop plan is large enough to contain it."},"鎏金·炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"zh":"雷克斯，档案称“炉龙”。炉灰里挖出一片带鳞的铁皮，弯曲时会发出很远的呼吸声。相同的证物出现了两次，第二次带着你的体温。","en":"Rex, filed as Furnace Drake. A scaled sheet of metal is dug from the furnace ash. The same exhibit appears twice. The second is warm with your body heat."},"炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"zh":"多里安，档案称“停工者”。他拆开的旧灯里有一道修补过的刻痕，笔势与你一样。工厂的停产日期，比你的出生还早。","en":"Dorian, filed as The Shutdown. Inside the old lamp is a repaired cut in your handwriting. The factory closed before you were born."},"鎏金·炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"zh":"多里安，档案称“停工者”。他拆开的旧灯里有一道修补过的刻痕，笔势与你一样。你找到另一份结案页，订书钉下没有任何纸张。","en":"Dorian, filed as The Shutdown. Inside the old lamp is a repaired cut in your handwriting. You find another closing sheet. Its staple holds no paper."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"zh":"米洛，档案称“逆潮鹿”。鹿角上的渔线挂着几枚缝衣针，针尖都朝向旧伤。潮位上涨时，伤口反而露出了干燥的边。","en":"Milo, filed as Backtide Deer. Fishing line on the deer's antlers holds sewing needles, all pointing toward an old wound. As the tide rises, its edges become dry."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"zh":"米洛，档案称“逆潮鹿”。鹿角上的渔线挂着几枚缝衣针，针尖都朝向旧伤。复印件上多出一行字，写的是你尚未问出口的问题。","en":"Milo, filed as Backtide Deer. Fishing line on the deer's antlers holds sewing needles, all pointing toward an old wound. The copy has gained a line: a question you have not asked yet."},"暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"zh":"裘德，档案称“赌客”。他每次鸣笛都会流鼻血，船上的人却听不见声音。岸边的录音机替他们录下了回应。","en":"Jude, filed as Cardsharp. His nose bleeds whenever he sounds the horn. Nobody aboard hears it. A recorder on shore captures their reply."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"zh":"裘德，档案称“赌客”。他每次鸣笛都会流鼻血，船上的人却听不见声音。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Jude, filed as Cardsharp. His nose bleeds whenever he sounds the horn. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"zh":"卢卡，档案称“潮牙”。他身上的盐结成了细牙，擦掉后衣料就开始渗水。诊所把这份样本登记成了活体血液。","en":"Luca, filed as Tide Maw. The salt on his clothes forms small teeth. Wipe it away and the cloth begins to weep. The clinic has registered the sample as living blood."},"鎏金·暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"zh":"卢卡，档案称“潮牙”。他身上的盐结成了细牙，擦掉后衣料就开始渗水。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Luca, filed as Tide Maw. The salt on his clothes forms small teeth. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"zh":"奥林，档案称“浮尸鹿”。鹿蹄陷过的地方留不住海水，像几口安静的井。救援名单贴在井边，没有一个名字被风吹动。","en":"Orin, filed as Drift Deer. Seawater will not stay in the deer's hoofprints. They resemble small, quiet wells. A rescue list beside them does not move in the wind."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"zh":"奥林，档案称“浮尸鹿”。鹿蹄陷过的地方留不住海水，像几口安静的井。封存后留下的指纹，不属于任何到过这里的人。","en":"Orin, filed as Drift Deer. Seawater will not stay in the deer's hoofprints. The prints left after sealing belong to nobody who has been here."},"暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"zh":"哈兰，档案称“旧船长”。旧船长晾干帽子，先拍出盐，再端端正正戴回去。他在桌上给你画航线，铅笔短得只够两根指头捏。“别嫌船小。”他说。纸上那条船的影子，正慢慢沉过你放杯子的地方。","en":"Harlan, filed as Old Captain. The Old Captain dries his cap, beats out the salt, and puts it squarely back on. His pencil is scarcely long enough for two fingers as he draws your course. “Small boat. Do not complain.” On the paper, its shadow sinks slowly past the place where your cup stands."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"zh":"哈兰，档案称“旧船长”。旧船长晾干帽子，先拍出盐，再端端正正戴回去。他在桌上给你画航线，铅笔短得只够两根指头捏。“别嫌船小。”他说。纸上那条船的影子，正慢慢沉过你放杯子的地方。","en":"Harlan, filed as Old Captain. The Old Captain dries his cap, beats out the salt, and puts it squarely back on. His pencil is scarcely long enough for two fingers as he draws your course. “Small boat. Do not complain.” On the paper, its shadow sinks slowly past the place where your cup stands."},"暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"zh":"尼科，档案称“换牌人”。他用一段海蛇蜕皮替换了录音带，机器仍能播放。里面没有海声，只有谁在练习你的停顿。","en":"Nico, filed as Card Dealer. He replaces a tape with a strip of sea-snake skin. The machine still plays. There is no sea on it, only someone practicing your pauses."},"鎏金·暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"zh":"尼科，档案称“换牌人”。他用一段海蛇蜕皮替换了录音带，机器仍能播放。你发现修补过的地方，正好绕开了照片里的自己。","en":"Nico, filed as Card Dealer. He replaces a tape with a strip of sea-snake skin. The repaired area passes carefully around your own figure in the photograph."},"暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"zh":"玛塔，档案称“海底蛛”。巨蛛把救生圈包得严严实实，圈里的人形已经没有呼吸。岸上仍有人坚持，那是最近一次获救者。","en":"Marta, filed as Deep Spider. The great spider has sealed a lifebuoy in silk. The human outline inside no longer breathes. Someone ashore insists it is the latest rescue."},"鎏金·暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"zh":"玛塔，档案称“海底蛛”。巨蛛把救生圈包得严严实实，圈里的人形已经没有呼吸。被删去的那一行，在你合上纸张后重新出现。","en":"Marta, filed as Deep Spider. The great spider has sealed a lifebuoy in silk. The deleted line returns after you fold the sheet."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"zh":"康拉德，档案称“舱底客”。他看过每一具打捞上来的尸体，却从不在记录上写死因。最后一页写着，下一具会自己上岸。","en":"Conrad, filed as Bilge Guest. He examines every recovered body but never writes a cause of death. The last page says the next one will come ashore by itself."},"鎏金·暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"zh":"康拉德，档案称“舱底客”。他看过每一具打捞上来的尸体，却从不在记录上写死因。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Conrad, filed as Bilge Guest. He examines every recovered body but never writes a cause of death. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"zh":"伊莱，档案称“灯塔守护者”。灯塔守护者擦镜片时，总给你留一块干布。“先看落款，再问是谁回信。”水底的光又早亮了一次。你翻开纸页，末尾那块抹开的墨，刚好盖住了自己名字的最后一笔。","en":"Eli, filed as Lighthouse Warden. The Lighthouse Warden leaves you a dry cloth for the lens. “Check the signature before asking who replied.” The underwater light comes early again. At the foot of the letter, a smear of ink covers the last stroke of your name."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"zh":"伊莱，档案称“灯塔守护者”。灯塔守护者把旧灯芯叠进烟盒，替你按住被风吹起的回信。“知道谁寄的，不等于知道谁在水底。”他把灯转向你身后。纸上的字迹没有变，那束光却仍比你们先到。","en":"Eli, filed as Lighthouse Warden. The Lighthouse Warden folds the old wick into a tobacco tin and holds down your letter. “Knowing the sender doesn’t tell you who’s under the water.” He turns the lamp behind you. The handwriting is unchanged. The light still arrives before either of you."},"暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"zh":"泰丝，档案称“雾中影”。他的声音只在海水碰到鞋边时出现，嘴唇从来不动。干燥的录音带上，却留着持续的吞咽声。","en":"Tess, filed as Fog Shade. His voice is heard only when seawater touches his shoes. His lips never move. A dry recording carries the sound of continuous swallowing."},"鎏金·暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"zh":"泰丝，档案称“雾中影”。他的声音只在海水碰到鞋边时出现，嘴唇从来不动。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Tess, filed as Fog Shade. His voice is heard only when seawater touches his shoes. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"zh":"达蒙，档案称“换舷人”。他把乘客的位置重新安排了一遍，座位上的水迹没有跟着移动。照片里，原来的乘客仍坐在原处。","en":"Damon, filed as Rail Switcher. He rearranges the passengers, but the wet marks on their seats stay put. In the photograph, the original passengers are still where they were."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"zh":"达蒙，档案称“换舷人”。他把乘客的位置重新安排了一遍，座位上的水迹没有跟着移动。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Damon, filed as Rail Switcher. He rearranges the passengers, but the wet marks on their seats stay put. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"zh":"埃丝梅，档案称“梦眼”。他只在你碰过海水后认得你，随后问起一段你没有说过的话。验水瓶里，浮着一层新鲜的指纹。","en":"Esme, filed as Dream Eye. He recognizes you only after you touch the sea, then asks about words you have not spoken. Fresh fingerprints float in the water sample."},"鎏金·暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"zh":"埃丝梅，档案称“梦眼”。他只在你碰过海水后认得你，随后问起一段你没有说过的话。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Esme, filed as Dream Eye. He recognizes you only after you touch the sea, then asks about words you have not spoken. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"zh":"贾尔斯，档案称“浪蹄”。马鞍下塞着两份相反的航行许可，墨水都还很新。马不肯靠岸，却能准确踏上水下的台阶。","en":"Giles, filed as Wave Hoof. Two conflicting sailing permits are tucked beneath the saddle. Both inks are fresh. The horse refuses the shore but finds each submerged step."},"鎏金·暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"zh":"贾尔斯，档案称“浪蹄”。马鞍下塞着两份相反的航行许可，墨水都还很新。他保留了空白那页，说那里曾经写过你的去向。","en":"Giles, filed as Wave Hoof. Two conflicting sailing permits are tucked beneath the saddle. He keeps the blank page. He says it once gave your destination."},"暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"zh":"卢西安，档案称“红酒客”。他把一点血滴进航灯，光就转向了看不见的船。港务记录上，那艘船只来过一次，从未离开。","en":"Lucian, filed as Red Guest. He puts a drop of blood into the harbor light. Its beam turns toward an unseen ship. The harbor log says the ship arrived once and never left."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"zh":"卢西安，档案称“红酒客”。他把一点血滴进航灯，光就转向了看不见的船。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Lucian, filed as Red Guest. He puts a drop of blood into the harbor light. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"zh":"芙萝拉，档案称“刺枝鹿”。鹿角上缠着一段烧过的缆绳，湿透后反而开始发热。渔民认得打结的手法，随即说自己认错了。","en":"Flora, filed as Thorn Deer. A burned mooring rope winds around its antlers. It grows warm when soaked. A fisherman recognizes the knot, then immediately says he was mistaken."},"鎏金·暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"zh":"芙萝拉，档案称“刺枝鹿”。鹿角上缠着一段烧过的缆绳，湿透后反而开始发热。相同的证物出现了两次，第二次带着你的体温。","en":"Flora, filed as Thorn Deer. A burned mooring rope winds around its antlers. The same exhibit appears twice. The second is warm with your body heat."},"暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"zh":"诺兰，档案称“听潮人”。船尾刻着一句你看不清的话，他却拒绝替你照亮。等岸灯扫过，木纹里出现了“你又回来了”。","en":"Nolan, filed as Tide Listener. Words are cut into the stern, but he will not light them for you. The shore lamp passes. In the grain you read: you have come back."},"鎏金·暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"zh":"诺兰，档案称“听潮人”。船尾刻着一句你看不清的话，他却拒绝替你照亮。你找到另一份结案页，订书钉下没有任何纸张。","en":"Nolan, filed as Tide Listener. Words are cut into the stern, but he will not light them for you. You find another closing sheet. Its staple holds no paper."},"霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"埃里克，档案称“雪角”。他把雪站外的人影往灯下拖，拖到的却只有一件外套。外套内侧印着整齐的肋骨痕，仍在缓慢起伏。","en":"Erik, filed as Snow Horn. He drags the shape outside the station toward the light. Only a coat arrives. Neat rib marks inside it still rise and fall."},"鎏金·霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"zh":"埃里克，档案称“雪角”。他把雪站外的人影往灯下拖，拖到的却只有一件外套。复印件上多出一行字，写的是你尚未问出口的问题。","en":"Erik, filed as Snow Horn. He drags the shape outside the station toward the light. The copy has gained a line: a question you have not asked yet."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"zh":"布拉姆，档案称“破冰卫”。他的靴底只在换线时留下雪，站台其他地方始终干净。列车记录说这一班车没有中途停靠。","en":"Bram, filed as Ice Guard. Snow falls from his boots only when he changes tracks. The rest of the platform stays clean. The train log lists no intermediate stop."},"鎏金·霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"zh":"布拉姆，档案称“破冰卫”。他的靴底只在换线时留下雪，站台其他地方始终干净。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Bram, filed as Ice Guard. Snow falls from his boots only when he changes tracks. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"zh":"伊瓦尔，档案称“盲牛”。牛的角上缠着融化的红色电线，雪地却找不到断口。它迈一步，站内的广播就少报一个站名。","en":"Ivar, filed as Blind Bull. Melting red cable winds around the bull's horns. There is no broken end in the snow. Each step removes a station name from the announcement."},"鎏金·霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"zh":"伊瓦尔，档案称“盲牛”。牛的角上缠着融化的红色电线，雪地却找不到断口。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Ivar, filed as Blind Bull. Melting red cable winds around the bull's horns. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"zh":"马雷克，档案称“飞刀客”。她从镜头前退出后，冲洗盘里还留着一道人影。你确认她就在身旁，底片上的人却没有转过头。","en":"Marek, filed as Flying Knife. She steps away from the lens, but a figure remains in the developing tray. She stands beside you. The person on the negative has not turned."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"zh":"马雷克，档案称“飞刀客”。她从镜头前退出后，冲洗盘里还留着一道人影。封存后留下的指纹，不属于任何到过这里的人。","en":"Marek, filed as Flying Knife. She steps away from the lens, but a figure remains in the developing tray. The prints left after sealing belong to nobody who has been here."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"zh":"安塞尔，档案称“冰线卫”。他用两段金属线接通手电，灯却照出一片更黑的雪。电流表的指针始终指着你站立的位置。","en":"Ansel, filed as Ice Watch. He joins two wires in the torch. Its beam reveals a patch of darker snow. The meter needle keeps pointing at where you stand."},"鎏金·霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"zh":"安塞尔，档案称“冰线卫”。他用两段金属线接通手电，灯却照出一片更黑的雪。录音中多了一次呼吸，恰好填满你沉默的地方。","en":"Ansel, filed as Ice Watch. He joins two wires in the torch. An extra breath on the tape exactly fills your silence."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"zh":"阿洛，档案称“白猿”。猿笼上的观察窗结了霜，霜下是一张完整的人脸。看护员让你等解冻再来，随后撕掉了预约单。","en":"Arlo, filed as White Ape. The observation pane on the ape enclosure has frozen over a complete human face. The attendant tells you to return after the thaw, then tears up the appointment."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"zh":"阿洛，档案称“白猿”。猿笼上的观察窗结了霜，霜下是一张完整的人脸。你发现修补过的地方，正好绕开了照片里的自己。","en":"Arlo, filed as White Ape. The observation pane on the ape enclosure has frozen over a complete human face. The repaired area passes carefully around your own figure in the photograph."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"zh":"乌尔里克，档案称“断臂猿”。解剖报告说它已经没有头，笼内的食盆却仍然移动。监控拍到一只手，把饭送到画面以外。","en":"Ulric, filed as One-Arm Ape. The autopsy says it has no head. The food bowl still moves in its cage. A camera records a hand carrying the meal beyond the frame."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"zh":"乌尔里克，档案称“断臂猿”。解剖报告说它已经没有头，笼内的食盆却仍然移动。被删去的那一行，在你合上纸张后重新出现。","en":"Ulric, filed as One-Arm Ape. The autopsy says it has no head. The deleted line returns after you fold the sheet."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"zh":"内斯托，档案称“老雪猿”。两只猿影在雪墙上轮流出现，笼里始终只有一只。每次清点完，饲养员都要重写自己的年龄。","en":"Nestor, filed as Old Snow Ape. Two ape shadows alternate on the snow wall. Only one animal occupies the cage. After every count, the keeper rewrites his own age."},"鎏金·霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"zh":"内斯托，档案称“老雪猿”。两只猿影在雪墙上轮流出现，笼里始终只有一只。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Nestor, filed as Old Snow Ape. Two ape shadows alternate on the snow wall. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"zh":"阿尔玛，档案称“冻哨”。他的防寒服内衬是整页病历，换岗前必须重新排序。你看见同一张脸，排在了两种不同的结局里。","en":"Alma, filed as Frozen Sentry. His winter coat is lined with medical records that must be reordered before each shift. The same face appears under two different outcomes."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"zh":"阿尔玛，档案称“冻哨”。他的防寒服内衬是整页病历，换岗前必须重新排序。交接栏只有一个签名，墨迹分成了不同的年份。","en":"Alma, filed as Frozen Sentry. His winter coat is lined with medical records that must be reordered before each shift. The handover field has one signature, written in inks from different years."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"zh":"索伦，档案称“隐名人”。他在口供里标出了需要停顿的地方，墨迹随后变成细小的霉。你跳过一行，喉咙便像被谁握住。","en":"Soren, filed as Hidden Name. He marks where the statement requires a pause. The ink turns into a fine mold. Skip a line and something seems to close around your throat."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"zh":"索伦，档案称“隐名人”。他在口供里标出了需要停顿的地方，墨迹随后变成细小的霉。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Soren, filed as Hidden Name. He marks where the statement requires a pause. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"zh":"英格丽，档案称“封站人”。他替失踪者缝好冬衣，再把衣服挂回空柜。最新那件比原来高了一寸，针脚却没有改动。","en":"Ingrid, filed as Station Keeper. He repairs the missing people's winter clothes and returns them to empty lockers. The newest garment is an inch taller. Its stitches have not changed."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"zh":"英格丽，档案称“封站人”。他替失踪者缝好冬衣，再把衣服挂回空柜。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Ingrid, filed as Station Keeper. He repairs the missing people's winter clothes and returns them to empty lockers. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"zh":"雷夫，档案称“眠龙”。结霜的鳞片贴在站台玻璃上，从里面看像一排握紧的拳头。融雪机接通时，广播先传来一声吸气。","en":"Leif, filed as Sleeping Drake. Frosted scales cover the platform glass. From inside they resemble clenched fists. When the snowmelt machine starts, the loudspeaker draws a breath."},"鎏金·霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"zh":"雷夫，档案称“眠龙”。结霜的鳞片贴在站台玻璃上，从里面看像一排握紧的拳头。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Leif, filed as Sleeping Drake. Frosted scales cover the platform glass. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"zh":"希尔达，档案称“山医”。山医把水壶贴在胸前暖着，倒给你时，小心避开裂口。“手还会抖，就是好事。”他翻着病历说。窗外的雪一直落，纸上几个没到站的病人，却已经逐个留下了湿手印。","en":"Hilda, filed as Hill Doctor. The Mountain Doctor warms the kettle against his chest and pours carefully around its crack. “Shaking hands are a good sign,” he says over the records. Snow keeps falling outside. Patients who have not reached the station are leaving wet handprints on their files."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"zh":"希尔达，档案称“山医”。山医把水壶贴在胸前暖着，倒给你时，小心避开裂口。“手还会抖，就是好事。”他翻着病历说。窗外的雪一直落，纸上几个没到站的病人，却已经逐个留下了湿手印。","en":"Hilda, filed as Hill Doctor. The Mountain Doctor warms the kettle against his chest and pours carefully around its crack. “Shaking hands are a good sign,” he says over the records. Snow keeps falling outside. Patients who have not reached the station are leaving wet handprints on their files."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"zh":"内尔，档案称“窃听人”。他的录音总在别人开口之前发出咳嗽，像是预先提醒。你换了空白带，咳嗽仍出现在同一秒。","en":"Nell, filed as Wiretapper. His recording coughs before another person speaks, as if giving warning. You change to a blank tape. The cough remains at the same second."},"鎏金·霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"zh":"内尔，档案称“窃听人”。他的录音总在别人开口之前发出咳嗽，像是预先提醒。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Nell, filed as Wiretapper. His recording coughs before another person speaks, as if giving warning. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"zh":"塔伦，档案称“火怒客”。他擦掉雪墙上最后一道人影后，掌心多出了一道烧伤。交接记录上，每一道烧伤都对应一个新岗位。","en":"Taran, filed as Burnt Guest. After he wipes the last shadow from the snow wall, a burn appears on his palm. Each burn in the handover log corresponds to a new post."},"鎏金·霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"zh":"塔伦，档案称“火怒客”。他擦掉雪墙上最后一道人影后，掌心多出了一道烧伤。相同的证物出现了两次，第二次带着你的体温。","en":"Taran, filed as Burnt Guest. After he wipes the last shadow from the snow wall, a burn appears on his palm. The same exhibit appears twice. The second is warm with your body heat."},"霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"zh":"乔纳斯，档案称“望乡人”。望乡人把行李绳解了又系，给每个结都留出手指的宽度。他怕到了家，手冻僵了拆不开。你说起镇外的路，他笑着挪了挪箱子。箱底压着的返程票，出发站写着同一个家。","en":"Jonas, filed as Homeward Man. The Homesick Traveler reties his luggage, leaving a finger’s width in every knot. He worries his hands will be too cold to undo them at home. At the mention of a road out, he smiles and shifts the case. Its return ticket gives that same home as the departure station."},"鎏金·霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"zh":"乔纳斯，档案称“望乡人”。望乡人把行李绳解了又系，给每个结都留出手指的宽度。他怕到了家，手冻僵了拆不开。你说起镇外的路，他笑着挪了挪箱子。箱底压着的返程票，出发站写着同一个家。","en":"Jonas, filed as Homeward Man. The Homesick Traveler reties his luggage, leaving a finger’s width in every knot. He worries his hands will be too cold to undo them at home. At the mention of a road out, he smiles and shifts the case. Its return ticket gives that same home as the departure station."},"星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"zh":"卡勒布，档案称“守页人”。他守着一道画在白墙上的门，门缝里夹着制服的一角。你伸手拨开布料，墙后传来扣纽扣的声音。","en":"Caleb, filed as Page Guard. He guards a door drawn on a white wall. A corner of uniform is caught in its seam. You move the cloth, and someone behind the wall buttons a coat."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"zh":"卡勒布，档案称“守页人”。他守着一道画在白墙上的门，门缝里夹着制服的一角。复印件上多出一行字，写的是你尚未问出口的问题。","en":"Caleb, filed as Page Guard. He guards a door drawn on a white wall. The copy has gained a line: a question you have not asked yet."},"星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"zh":"奥蒂斯，档案称“裂面客”。他的口供被排在所有人之后，纸上却印着第一个到场的时间。你想核对顺序，订书钉已经生进桌面。","en":"Otis, filed as Split Face. His statement comes last, though the paper gives the earliest arrival time. You try to reorder it. The staples have grown into the desk."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"zh":"奥蒂斯，档案称“裂面客”。他的口供被排在所有人之后，纸上却印着第一个到场的时间。你再看照片时，画面里的空位已经有人站过。","en":"Otis, filed as Split Face. His statement comes last, though the paper gives the earliest arrival time. When you look again, someone has occupied the empty space in the photograph."},"星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"zh":"沃恩，档案称“摘星人”。他划掉一份口供，桌上就会多出两份互相矛盾的副本。两份都用你的笔迹签了同一个假名。","en":"Vaughn, filed as Star Taker. He crosses out a statement. Two contradictory copies appear on the desk. Both are signed in your handwriting, with the same false name."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"zh":"沃恩，档案称“摘星人”。他划掉一份口供，桌上就会多出两份互相矛盾的副本。纸背的铅笔印，比正面的证词早了整整一天。","en":"Vaughn, filed as Star Taker. He crosses out a statement. The pencil marks on the back predate the statement by a full day."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"zh":"罗南，档案称“逐月狼”。狼从白室一角走向另一角，地面留下人的鞋底纹。它回头时，监控里的走廊比房间长了很多。","en":"Ronan, filed as Moon Wolf. The wolf crosses the white room, leaving human sole marks. When it turns, the camera corridor has become much longer than the room."},"鎏金·星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"zh":"罗南，档案称“逐月狼”。狼从白室一角走向另一角，地面留下人的鞋底纹。封存后留下的指纹，不属于任何到过这里的人。","en":"Ronan, filed as Moon Wolf. The wolf crosses the white room, leaving human sole marks. The prints left after sealing belong to nobody who has been here."},"星铸灯议长·图烙":{"zh":"伊欧妮，档案称“盲测师”。他把一张照片翻成背面，照片里的人随即从证词中消失。纸上仍有压痕，像是谁刚刚试过写字。","en":"Ione, filed as Blind Surveyor. He turns a photograph face down. Its subject disappears from the statements. Indentations remain in the paper, as though someone has just tried to write."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·图烙":{"zh":"伊欧妮，档案称“盲测师”。他把一张照片翻成背面，照片里的人随即从证词中消失。录音中多了一次呼吸，恰好填满你沉默的地方。","en":"Ione, filed as Blind Surveyor. He turns a photograph face down. An extra breath on the tape exactly fills your silence."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"zh":"西塞尔，档案称“石碑卫”。他总让最靠墙的人往里坐，空出的椅子却离墙更近。地面没有划痕，房间也没有变小的记录。","en":"Cecil, filed as Stone Guard. He asks the people nearest the wall to move inward. Their empty chairs end up closer to it. There are no scrape marks or records of the room shrinking."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"zh":"西塞尔，档案称“石碑卫”。他总让最靠墙的人往里坐，空出的椅子却离墙更近。你发现修补过的地方，正好绕开了照片里的自己。","en":"Cecil, filed as Stone Guard. He asks the people nearest the wall to move inward. The repaired area passes carefully around your own figure in the photograph."},"星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"zh":"奥尔顿，档案称“无面卫”。他胸前的通行证在白光里发出细响，塑封下有东西反复弯曲。换成新证以后，照片仍带着旧裂痕。","en":"Alton, filed as Faceless Guard. His pass clicks in the white light. Something bends beneath its plastic. The replacement photograph retains the old crack."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"zh":"奥尔顿，档案称“无面卫”。他胸前的通行证在白光里发出细响，塑封下有东西反复弯曲。被删去的那一行，在你合上纸张后重新出现。","en":"Alton, filed as Faceless Guard. His pass clicks in the white light. The deleted line returns after you fold the sheet."},"星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"zh":"达拉，档案称“裂夜客”。他口述的每一个停顿都被单独装袋，袋内慢慢生出水雾。负责封存的人说，那些袋子以前放过肺。","en":"Dara, filed as Night Split. Each pause in his statement has been bagged separately. Mist gathers inside. The custodian says the bags once contained lungs."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"zh":"达拉，档案称“裂夜客”。他口述的每一个停顿都被单独装袋，袋内慢慢生出水雾。背面写着一段提醒，落款却用了你的旧住址。","en":"Dara, filed as Night Split. Each pause in his statement has been bagged separately. A warning on the back is signed with your former address."},"星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"zh":"阿斯彭，档案称“环尾蛇”。蛇在洗手池里蜕下一层带姓名的皮，护士却把它放进病历夹。你见过的那一页，上面没有蛇的姓名。","en":"Aspen, filed as Ringtail Snake. The snake sheds a named skin into the sink. A nurse files it among the medical records. On the page you saw before, the snake had no name."},"鎏金·星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"zh":"阿斯彭，档案称“环尾蛇”。蛇在洗手池里蜕下一层带姓名的皮，护士却把它放进病历夹。交接栏只有一个签名，墨迹分成了不同的年份。","en":"Aspen, filed as Ringtail Snake. The snake sheds a named skin into the sink. The handover field has one signature, written in inks from different years."},"星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"zh":"埃尔默，档案称“夜食客”。他只肯用自己的血校对记录，改过的字却会慢慢退回原位。你找到一滴旧血，颜色比新墨还深。","en":"Elmer, filed as Night Eater. He will proofread only in his own blood. Corrected words slowly return to their former places. An old drop is darker than the fresh ink."},"鎏金·星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"zh":"埃尔默，档案称“夜食客”。他只肯用自己的血校对记录，改过的字却会慢慢退回原位。你听见他重复证词，这次多了一个不存在的房间。","en":"Elmer, filed as Night Eater. He will proofread only in his own blood. He repeats the statement. This time it includes a room that does not exist."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"zh":"路德，档案称“托梁人”。他把一扇铁门搁在肩上，门后始终传来有人敲打的声音。白室的疏散图上，那扇门被涂成了实墙。","en":"Luther, filed as Beam Holder. He carries an iron door on his shoulder. Someone keeps knocking behind it. The evacuation plan has painted it in as a solid wall."},"鎏金·星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"zh":"路德，档案称“托梁人”。他把一扇铁门搁在肩上，门后始终传来有人敲打的声音。第二份检验结果里，污迹被列为了另一名证人。","en":"Luther, filed as Beam Holder. He carries an iron door on his shoulder. The second examination lists the stain as another witness."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"zh":"韦德，档案称“失群狼”。狼嘴里叼着一截空录音带，带面却不断渗出指纹。检验员认出其中一枚，随后把自己的手藏了起来。","en":"Wade, filed as Lost Wolf. The wolf carries a length of blank tape. Fingerprints keep seeping from its surface. The examiner recognizes one, then hides his hands."},"鎏金·星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"zh":"韦德，档案称“失群狼”。狼嘴里叼着一截空录音带，带面却不断渗出指纹。时间戳已经褪色，停顿的长度却和上次完全一样。","en":"Wade, filed as Lost Wolf. The wolf carries a length of blank tape. The timestamp has faded, but the pause lasts exactly as long as before."},"星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"zh":"勒内，档案称“空座客”。他把两个相反的出口指给你看，左右手的掌纹却完全一样。门边的读卡器只承认不存在的那只手。","en":"Rene, filed as Empty Seat. He points to two opposite exits. Both palms have the same lines. The reader beside the door accepts only the hand that is not there."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"zh":"勒内，档案称“空座客”。他把两个相反的出口指给你看，左右手的掌纹却完全一样。他保留了空白那页，说那里曾经写过你的去向。","en":"Rene, filed as Empty Seat. He points to two opposite exits. He keeps the blank page. He says it once gave your destination."},"星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"zh":"阿丝特莉，档案称“证血人”。他替你擦掉了纸上的血，纸下面却露出另一份尚未写完的口供。最新一行，恰好是你刚才的犹豫。","en":"Astrid, filed as Blood Witness. He wipes the blood from the page. An unfinished statement shows through beneath it. Its newest line records the hesitation you just had."},"鎏金·星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"zh":"阿丝特莉，档案称“证血人”。他替你擦掉了纸上的血，纸下面却露出另一份尚未写完的口供。归档时留下的缝隙，刚好能从里面望见你。","en":"Astrid, filed as Blood Witness. He wipes the blood from the page. The gap left during filing is just wide enough to see you from within."},"星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"zh":"欧内斯特，档案称“署名者”。署名者用袖口垫着纸，免得汗洇开墨迹。他问你名字怎么写，听得十分认真。“总得有一回写对。”你还没答，他已在空栏里停下笔。那一笔的转弯，和你小时候的一模一样。","en":"Ernest, filed as The Signer. The Signatory rests his cuff under the page so sweat will not blur the ink. He listens carefully to your name. “We ought to get it right once.” Before your answer, his pen stops in the blank field. Its small turn matches the handwriting you had as a child."},"鎏金·星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"zh":"欧内斯特，档案称“署名者”。署名者用袖口垫着纸，免得汗洇开墨迹。他问你名字怎么写，听得十分认真。“总得有一回写对。”你还没答，他已在空栏里停下笔。那一笔的转弯，和你小时候的一模一样。","en":"Ernest, filed as The Signer. The Signatory rests his cuff under the page so sweat will not blur the ink. He listens carefully to your name. “We ought to get it right once.” Before your answer, his pen stops in the blank field. Its small turn matches the handwriting you had as a child."},"星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"zh":"埃文，档案称“门后人”。门后人扶住门沿，让你先走。他的袖子磨得发白，指节有一道搬家具留下的旧伤。“出去别急着关门。”门里飘来煮水声，你认得那只壶；壶把上缠的布，是你刚撕下的。","en":"Evan, filed as Behind the Door. The One Behind the Door holds the frame for you. His cuffs are worn pale, one knuckle scarred from moving furniture. “Do not shut it straight away.” A kettle boils beyond him. You know that kettle. Around its handle is the cloth you have only just torn off."},"鎏金·星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"zh":"埃文，档案称“门后人”。门后人扶住门沿，让你先走。他的袖子磨得发白，指节有一道搬家具留下的旧伤。“出去别急着关门。”门里飘来煮水声，你认得那只壶；壶把上缠的布，是你刚撕下的。","en":"Evan, filed as Behind the Door. The One Behind the Door holds the frame for you. His cuffs are worn pale, one knuckle scarred from moving furniture. “Do not shut it straight away.” A kettle boils beyond him. You know that kettle. Around its handle is the cloth you have only just torn off."}};
const LOOP_STORY={"version":1,"title":{"zh":"未结案","en":"An Open Case"},"opening":{"zh":{"title":"值班室里的陌生人","text":"你先闻到湿羊毛的气味。\n外套搭在椅背上，水沿着袖口滴进铁盆。盆底已经积了半寸，脚上的鞋却很干净。你不记得走过哪一条路，也不记得是谁替你脱下了外套。\n桌对面的男人正在补一只手套。他的制服领口发白，线头夹在嘴角，收音机里只有低低的沙声。热水壶坐在小炉上，壶嘴却塞着一团旧报纸。\n“醒了？”他把针插回袖口，“杯子自己拿。缺口朝外，省得割嘴。”\n你没喝。杯底有一圈茶垢，闻起来是冷铁的味道。\n“我想离开这里。”\n“好事。”他说，“说明你还没打算接我的班。”\n他笑了一下，把手套翻过来，又拆掉刚缝好的两针。你等着他继续。他却伸出手，推来一份薄薄的案卷。封皮受过潮，纸页粘在一起。你用拇指分开它，看见自己的照片。\n失踪日期是明天。登记人那一栏折进封皮，只露出一个收笔过重的钩。\n“日期写错了。”\n“我也这么说过。”守夜人诺亚低下头，继续穿线。\n墙上的钟停在03:17。那滴水从袖口落下，撞进盆底；紧接着，你在收音机里又听见它响了一次。\n他收起针线，把一副边缘发软的牌放到桌上。手套被翻到了里面，露出你刚才留在案卷上的那枚湿指印。\n指印周围的水迹，已经干了。","button":"坐到桌前"},"en":{"title":"The Stranger in the Duty Room","text":"Wet wool is the first thing you smell.\nYour coat hangs over a chair. Water runs from its cuff into a tin basin, already half an inch deep. Your shoes are clean. You cannot remember the road you took, or who helped you out of the coat.\nAcross the desk, a man is mending a glove. His uniform collar has worn pale. He holds a thread between his lips. A radio murmurs static. A kettle sits on the stove with newspaper stuffed into its spout.\n“Awake? Help yourself to a cup. Keep the chipped side away from your mouth.” He tucks the needle into his sleeve.\nYou do not drink. Tea has left a ring in the cup. It smells of cold iron.\n“I want to leave.”\n“Good. You haven't decided to take my job.”\nHe smiles, turns the glove over, and unpicks the two stitches he has just made. You wait for more. Instead, he pushes a thin file across the desk. Damp has glued its pages together. You separate them with your thumb and find your photograph.\nYou are due to go missing tomorrow. The reporting person’s name is folded into the cover. Only a heavily hooked final stroke shows.\n“The date is wrong.”\n“I said that too.” Noah, the Night Watch, bends over his thread.\nThe clock on the wall reads 03:17. A drop falls from your sleeve into the basin. A moment later, the radio repeats the sound.\nHe puts the sewing away and lays a soft-edged deck of cards between you. The glove has turned inside out. On its lining is the wet thumbprint you have just left on the file.\nThe water around it has dried.","button":"Take a Seat"}},"home":{"zh":{"eyebrow":"案卷编号：03:17","subtitle":"有人替你记得","caption":"先坐下。外面的雨，还没有开始。","text":"你在一间漏雨的值班室醒来。守夜人诺亚递来冷茶，还有一份明天的失踪案卷。照片是你。沿着钟声、炉灰与海底的灯光，走过六处现场；有些对手会留在桌边，有些愿意陪你找出口。他们说，这是第一次见面。可你记得其中一人喝茶时，总把杯子的缺口朝外。","start":"打开案卷","return":"重新调查","loop":"第{loop}次调查 · 椅子还给你留着"},"en":{"eyebrow":"CASE NUMBER: 03:17","subtitle":"Someone remembers for you.","caption":"Sit down. The rain outside has not started yet.","text":"You wake in a leaking duty room. Noah, the Night Watch, offers cold tea and tomorrow's missing-person file. The photograph is yours. Follow bells, furnace ash and a light beneath the water through six sites. Some opponents stay at the table. Others will help you find the exit. They say you have never met. Yet you remember how one of them drinks: always with the chipped side of the cup turned away.","start":"Open the File","return":"Reopen the Case","loop":"Investigation {loop} · Your chair is waiting"}},"chapters":{"mire":{"name":{"zh":"雾镇","en":"Fogtown"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"冷掉的早饭","text":"走出值班室时，你先闻到一股煮豆子的气味。街对面的熟食铺开着半扇门，老板把锅盖掀起一条缝，让蒸汽擦过自己发红的鼻尖。\n“还没走？”他问。\n你停在门口。“我们见过？”\n老板用勺背敲了敲锅沿。“我做生意的。谁站在外面不进来，我都这么问。”\n他递来一只搪瓷杯，杯口缺了块蓝漆。豆汤很热，胡椒呛得你咳了一声。老板笑了，把收音机拍响。天气预报里，一个女人正在念你的姓名。\n他立刻把声音拧小。\n“总把失踪的人安排在早饭时间。”他说，“影响胃口。”\n你问起停电。他说是星期三。隔壁买烟的人说星期日。两个人很快吵到谁欠了谁的钱，倒都坚持钟停在03:17。\n你低头放杯子，发现柜台下面挂着十六把钥匙。最末一把还在滴水。老板顺着你的目光看过去，笑意慢慢收住。\n“先别碰。那把门锁，还没装。”"},"en":{"title":"A Breakfast Gone Cold","text":"Outside the duty room, the first thing you notice is the smell of beans. The cook across the street has his door half open. He lifts the lid just far enough to let the steam warm his reddened nose.\n“Still here?” he asks.\n“Have we met?”\n“I run a business. I say that to anyone standing outside without buying.”\nHe hands you an enamel cup with a chip in its blue rim. The soup is hot. Pepper catches your throat. Laughing, he thumps the radio into life. A woman in the weather forecast is reading out your name.\nHe turns it down at once.\n“Missing people at breakfast. They ought to think about appetites.”\nYou ask about the outage. He says Wednesday. The man buying cigarettes next door says Sunday. Soon they are arguing about an unpaid debt. Both agree that the clock stopped at 03:17.\nYou set down the cup. Sixteen keys hang beneath the counter. The last is dripping onto the floor. The cook follows your gaze. His smile fades.\n“Leave that one. They haven't fitted its lock yet.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"没人拆开的信","text":"你把最后一张牌收好，熟食铺的老板也恰好合上锅盖。街上的雾淡了些，露出对面邮局歪斜的招牌。\n柜台上放着一个没有封口的信封。寄件栏写着你的姓名，里面只有一小截蓝线。那截线打了个反结，你小时候学错了，到现在也改不过来。你翻过来，邮戳是明天，墨却已经吃进纸里。\n“镇上邮差办事一向慢。”老板说。\n“这算快吧。”\n“所以我才不喜欢。”\n门外有人停下脚步，愿意陪你走一段。你侧身让出路，把信封塞进外套。那截线挂住袖口的破洞，轻轻一扯，竟严丝合缝。\n出门时，老板把那把湿钥匙扔过来。你没问锁装好了没有。\n去钟楼的路就在邮局后面。你走出几步，回头想还那只杯子。老板已经把它洗净，倒扣在架上。\n你摸了摸手里。杯子还热着。"},"en":{"title":"An Unopened Letter","text":"As you put away the last card, the cook replaces the lid on his pot. The fog has thinned enough to reveal the crooked post-office sign across the street.\nAn unsealed envelope lies on the counter. Your name is in the sender field. Inside is a short piece of blue thread. Its knot is tied backward, a habit you learned badly as a child and never corrected. The postmark is dated tomorrow, but its ink has soaked deep into the paper.\n“Our postman always takes his time,” the cook says.\n“This seems fairly quick.”\n“That's what bothers me.”\nSomeone pauses outside, willing to walk a little of the road with you. You make room in the doorway and pocket the envelope. The thread catches on your torn cuff. One small tug pulls the edges neatly together.\nOn your way out, the cook tosses you the wet key. You do not ask whether the lock has been fitted.\nThe road to the bell tower runs behind the post office. A few steps along it, you turn to return the cup. The cook has already washed it and placed it upside down on the shelf.\nYou look at your hand. Your cup is still warm."}}},"brass":{"name":{"zh":"钟楼","en":"Bell Tower"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"钟声之前","text":"钟楼的木扶手有一层油腻的亮光。你沿楼梯上去，鞋底每响一次，楼上就迟半拍回一声。\n值守间里，一个瘦女人正给旧录音机换带。她把铅笔插进卷轴，慢慢转动，桌边摆着两瓣剥好的橘子。\n“吃一瓣？”\n你摇头。她自己吃了，酸得眯起眼。\n“好。至少还有人相信我。”\n你递上信封。她看见邮戳，把橘皮拢到一边，腾出一块干净地方。\n“这得往上送。我们只记声音，不管日期。”\n录音机忽然咔哒一响。你还没开口，磁带里的声音已经问：“楼上是谁？”\n女人没有看机器。她拉开抽屉，拿出一张印着问询项目的表，熟练地划掉第一行。\n“通常你会晚一点问。”她说。\n你走到窗边。楼顶的钟架空着，断绳从梁上垂下。巷子里却有人开始收摊，仿佛听到了报时。\n女人递来耳机，替你理好缠住衣领的线。她的手指很冷。\n“到第十六份就停。最后那一声，别跟着数。”"},"en":{"title":"Before the Chime","text":"The wooden banister is polished with old grease. As you climb, each footstep receives an answer from upstairs, half a beat late.\nIn the duty room, a thin woman is changing the tape in a recorder. She turns a spool with a pencil. Two peeled orange segments wait beside her elbow.\n“Want one?”\nYou decline. She eats it herself and winces at the sourness.\n“Good. Someone still trusts me.”\nYou show her the envelope. At the sight of the postmark, she sweeps aside the peel to make a clean space.\n“That goes upstairs. We deal in sounds, not dates.”\nThe recorder clicks. Before you can speak, your voice on the tape asks, “Who's upstairs?”\nWithout looking at the machine, she opens a drawer, takes out a printed interview sheet and crosses off the first question.\n“You usually wait a little longer.”\nAt the window, you can see the empty bell frame overhead. A broken rope hangs from the beam. Down in the alley, traders begin packing their stalls as though the hour has sounded.\nShe offers you the headphones and untangles the cable from your collar. Her fingers are cold.\n“Stop at the sixteenth statement. Don't count along with the last chime.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"没拔下来的插头","text":"楼梯间的脚步终于停了。你等了一会儿，没人推门进来。\n瘦女人把磁带装进纸盒，写上灰厂的地址。她的铅笔只剩半截，写到门牌号时断了一次。你把自己的笔递过去，她接得很快，仿佛早知道你会伸手。\n“那边有人修东西。”她说，“人也修，别抱太大希望。”\n你合上盒盖，里面传来一声轻咳。\n女人抬起眼。“没关系。只是带子绕得太紧。”\n盒盖里侧写着白室的门牌号，最后一个数字描过两遍。你拿笔的手停了一下，指腹上正沾着同样颜色的墨。\n你伸手去拔录音机的插头，指尖却只碰到一截齐根剪断的电线。切口积着灰，绝不是刚剪的。\n走出钟楼时，同行的人替你接过沉重的盒子。隔着纸板，你听见录音里的自己道了声谢。\n那人看着你。你还没有开口。"},"en":{"title":"The Plug You Didn't Pull","text":"The footsteps in the stairwell stop at last. You wait. Nobody opens the door.\nThe thin woman packs the tape into a cardboard box and writes the Ash Works address on its lid. Her pencil is a stub. It breaks halfway through the building number. You offer your pen. She takes it so quickly she seems to have been waiting for your hand.\n“They repair things there. People too. Keep your expectations sensible.”\nYou close the box. A small cough comes from inside.\nShe looks up. “Nothing to worry about. The tape is wound too tight.”\nThe White Room address is written inside the lid, its last digit retraced. Your hand stops over the pen. The same color of ink stains your fingertip.\nYou reach to unplug the recorder. Your fingers find a cable cut off close to the casing. Dust has settled into the end. It was cut a long time ago.\nOutside, a companion takes the heavy box from you. Through the cardboard, you hear your recorded voice thank them.\nThey look at you.\nYou haven't spoken yet."}}},"cinder":{"name":{"zh":"灰厂","en":"Ash Works"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"防火女的午饭","text":"灰厂的门卫室飘着白菜汤的气味。你推门时，防火女正用勺子撇油，旧雨衣搭在膝上。炉膛里没有火，锅里的汤却一直开着。\n“碗在上面。”她说。\n你没动。她回头看了看你，又看了看锅。\n“放心，难吃归难吃，没下别的东西。”\n你接过碗。热气松开了冻僵的指头。她从你手里拿走录音盒，擦去底部的煤灰，在交接簿上签字。笔尖划过纸面时，你听见了一小段钟声。\n防火女停了一下，只把字写完。\n午饭过后，她挽起袖子检查炉门。封条贴得很齐，每一道折角都压过两遍。你问她，厂子关了二十七年，为什么还值班。\n“机器停了，工钱可没结。”她说，“再说，里面的东西不知道停产。”\n炉门深处有人轻轻敲了一下。\n她把勺子搁下，戴上隔热手套。方才还在开玩笑的脸慢慢绷紧。那只手套在袖口处有一道蓝线，缝得很细。\n“汤喝完就把碗放着。”她对你说，“不管它待会儿喊谁的名字。”"},"en":{"title":"The Fire Warden's Lunch","text":"Cabbage soup scents the gatehouse at Ash Works. When you push the door open, the Fire Warden is skimming fat from the pot, an old raincoat spread across her knees. There is no fire in the stove. The soup keeps boiling.\n“Bowls are up there.”\nYou hesitate. She looks from you to the pot.\n“It's bad, I'll grant you. Nothing added to make it worse.”\nYou take a bowl. Its heat loosens your stiff fingers. She accepts the tape box, wipes coal dust from its base and signs the handover book. As the nib moves across the page, you hear a brief chime.\nShe pauses, then finishes her signature.\nAfter lunch, she rolls up her sleeves to inspect the furnace door. Every seal is straight, every corner pressed down twice. You ask why she still works here after twenty-seven years of closure.\n“The machines stopped. They never settled the wages. Besides, what's in there hasn't heard about the closure.”\nSomething taps from deep inside the furnace.\nShe puts down her spoon and draws on insulated gloves. The humor leaves her face. A fine line of blue stitching repairs one glove at the cuff.\n“Finish your soup and leave the bowl,” she says. “Whatever name it starts calling.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"关火以后","text":"最后一张交接单压进抽屉，炉门后终于安静下来。防火女摘下一只手套，在桌边坐了很久，肩膀一点点低下去。\n你想问她里面是什么，话到嘴边，改成了：“还有汤吗？”\n她看了你一眼，伸手把锅推近。\n“凉的。别挑。”\n断电的复印机忽然送出一张照片。纸面温热，拍的是沉港码头。防火女用指甲挑开粘在角上的一片灰，露出一只缺蓝漆的杯子，倒扣在栏杆上。\n你认出了杯口的缺口。照片里的水面，却映着一扇钟楼的窗。\n“走靠左那条路。”她说，“涨水时别问路人时间。”\n她把一卷蓝线放进你掌心，怕你推辞，先剪下一截。“给破衣服用的。不是让你给这里办葬礼。”\n离开前，你把空碗放进水池。池底的水没有流向下水口，而是缓缓爬上那只碗，洗净了你的指纹。"},"en":{"title":"After the Heat","text":"The last transfer slip goes into the drawer. At last, the furnace falls quiet. The Fire Warden removes one glove and sits at the table until her shoulders begin to ease.\nYou mean to ask what is inside. Instead, you ask whether there is any soup left.\nShe looks at you and pushes the pot closer.\n“Cold. Don't complain.”\nThe disconnected copier feeds out a photograph. The paper is warm. It shows a quay at Sunken Harbor. She picks a flake of ash from one corner, revealing a blue-rimmed cup upside down on the rail.\nYou recognize the chip. In the photographed water, a bell-tower window is reflected.\n“Take the left road,” she says. “When the water rises, don't ask anyone the time.”\nShe presses a spool of blue thread into your palm and cuts a length before you can refuse. “For torn clothes. You needn’t hold a funeral for the place.”\nBefore leaving, you put your bowl in the sink. The water in the bottom moves away from the drain. Slowly, it climbs the bowl and washes off your fingerprints."}}},"tide":{"name":{"zh":"沉港","en":"Sunken Harbor"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"先到的回信","text":"沉港没有海风，空气里的盐却咬得嘴唇发疼。码头木板底下有水，你走一步，下面就传来一步湿漉漉的回声。\n灯塔守护者伊莱坐在矮凳上，拆一盏满是铜绿的航灯。他把螺丝按大小排进烟盒，手边烧着一壶水。壶嘴塞了根木棍，免得它叫。\n“水开了怎么知道？”你问。\n“它会骂人。”\n你看了看他。他拧下一颗螺丝，嘴角动了一下。\n“等久了，我也会。”\n你递上灰厂的照片。他没有接，只把灯芯挑高，透过磨花的玻璃照了一下。照片上的水纹动了。\n木板下面，有一束光先亮起来。冷白的，直直穿过黑水。片刻以后，他手里的航灯才点着。\n他低头看表，拿铅笔记下一分钟的误差，又在旧记录旁添了一横。\n“以前只早几秒。”\n水壶忽然发出短促的嘶声。你伸手去拿，守护者按住你的手腕。他的掌心很暖，力道很稳。\n“先等它把话说完。”"},"en":{"title":"The Reply Arrives First","text":"There is no sea breeze at Sunken Harbor, but salt stings your lips. Water lies beneath the quay. Each step brings a wet answering step from below.\nEli, the Lighthouse Warden, sits on a low stool, taking apart a navigation lamp green with corrosion. He sorts the screws by size inside a tobacco tin. A kettle boils beside him, a stick wedged in its spout to keep it quiet.\n“How do you know when it's ready?”\n“It starts swearing.”\nYou look at him. He removes another screw. One corner of his mouth moves.\n“Given enough time, so do I.”\nYou offer the Ash Works photograph. He leaves it in your hand and raises the wick, shining through the scratched glass. The photographed water stirs.\nA beam appears beneath the boards: cold white, straight through the black water. Only then does the lamp in his hands light up.\nHe checks his watch and notes a difference of one minute, adding a mark beside an older entry.\n“It used to be a few seconds.”\nThe kettle gives a sharp hiss. You reach for it. He catches your wrist with a warm, steady hand.\n“Let it finish.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"第三个乘客","text":"守护者把拆下的灯罩装回去，用袖口擦了一遍。水下没有再亮。他没有显出高兴，只在记录簿上把最后一横描深。\n出港的船停在台阶下。摆渡人蹲着补鞋，针从厚皮里穿过，发出细小的吱声。你把港务簿递过去，他翻到失踪乘客那页，指着一张照片问是不是你。\n脸是你的。姓名不是。\n你身后有人低声念出另一个名字，听上去很熟。那人却立刻否认自己说过话。\n摆渡人把鞋穿好，站起来试了试。\n“一张脸省不了两张票。”他说。\n你正要回答，远处电报机响起来。纸带一路吐到地上，上面只有雪站的地址和三个字：别回答。\n纸带末尾有一块被拇指抹开的墨，正好遮住发报人。你把话咽了回去。摆渡人等得太久，便把刚才的问题又问了一遍。"},"en":{"title":"The Third Passenger","text":"The Warden fits the lamp glass back into place and wipes it with his cuff. No further light comes from below. He does not seem relieved. He only presses harder on the last mark in his book.\nA boat waits at the steps. The ferryman is crouched over a shoe repair. The needle squeaks as it passes through the thick leather. He takes the harbor ledger, finds the missing-passenger page and asks whether the photograph is yours.\nYour face. Another name.\nBehind you, someone quietly says a third name. It sounds familiar. When you turn, they deny having spoken.\nThe ferryman puts on his shoe and tests it.\n“One face won't get you two tickets.”\nBefore you can answer, a telegraph starts clattering farther along the quay. Its paper unrolls onto the floor. It gives the Snow Station address and three words: DO NOT ANSWER.\nA thumb has smeared the ink over the sender’s name. You swallow your answer.\nThe ferryman waits too long, then asks you the question again."}}},"frost":{"name":{"zh":"雪站","en":"Snow Station"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"给迟到的人留的座位","text":"雪站候车室的暖气烫得碰不得，窗内却结着一层薄冰。值班员蹲在长椅旁，用旧报纸垫平一条短腿。你等他站起来，才发现他把最干净的那个座位留给了你。\n“晚点多久？”你问。\n“看你坐多久。”\n他从铁皮盒里摸出一块薄荷糖，想了想，又放回去，换成两块。糖纸冻脆了，捏在手里细细作响。\n墙上的广播报出一趟没有终点的车。值班员照常在黑板上添了一笔，随后拧开电台。你的求救声从喇叭里挤出来，夹着急促的喘息。\n他慢慢把音量调小。\n“这次能听清地址了。”他说。\n求救声说到最后一个数字时，迟疑了一下，又重念一遍。你认得那个停顿，刚才看盒盖时，自己也这么念过。\n你看着电台。开关一直停在接收。\n录音里的你说出白室的门牌号。那串数字刚说完，值班员的手指便停在旋钮上。你以为他听到了什么，直到他把手摊给你看。\n掌心的糖已经化了。两张糖纸之间，夹着一张湿透的车票。\n上面的出发站，叫雾镇。"},"en":{"title":"A Seat for the Late Arrival","text":"The waiting-room radiator is too hot to touch. A film of ice coats the inside of the window. The attendant crouches beside a bench, folding old newspaper beneath its short leg. When he stands, you see that he has saved the cleanest seat for you.\n“How late is the train?”\n“Depends how long you sit.”\nHe finds a peppermint in a tin, considers it, then replaces it with two. The brittle wrappers crackle in his fingers.\nA service with no destination is announced over the loudspeaker. He adds a routine mark to the blackboard and turns on the radio. Your distress call forces its way through the speaker, broken by hard breathing.\nHe lowers the volume slowly.\n“We can make out the address this time.”\nAt the last digit, the voice hesitates and repeats it. You recognize the pause. That is how you read the address inside the box lid.\nThe switch has stayed on receive.\nYour recorded voice gives the White Room building number. As the final digit sounds, his fingers stop on the dial. You think he has heard something. Then he shows you his open hand.\nThe sweets have melted. A sodden ticket lies between their two wrappers.\nThe departure station is Fogtown."}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"不用归还的外套","text":"站台尽头没有火车，只有一盏被雪压歪的灯。你把最后一份口供摊在灯下，纸上完整记着刚才那场牌局。连你反悔过的一步也在。\n记录时间是03:17。\n值班员替你拍掉肩上的雪，想把自己的外套借给你。你说有了。他摸了摸那层薄得透风的料子，没有争，只把一根缝衣针别在你的袖口。\n“脱线了就补。别等回来再说。”\n你问他自己怎么御寒。\n他朝候车室抬了抬下巴。“我有暖气。烫得很。”\n通往白室的小门在站房背后。门上没有把手，只留着一个旧钥匙孔。你把雾镇带来的钥匙靠近，锁舌便自己退了回去。\n身后，长椅吱呀一响。\n值班员正在给下一个人垫椅脚。"},"en":{"title":"A Coat You Needn't Return","text":"There is no train at the end of the platform. Only a lamp bent beneath the snow. In its light, you spread out the last statement. It describes the match you have just played, including a move you thought better of making.\nThe time is 03:17.\nThe attendant brushes snow from your shoulders and offers you his coat. You tell him you have one. He feels the thin material, makes no argument and pins a sewing needle to your cuff.\n“If a seam goes, mend it. Don't leave it until you get back.”\nYou ask how he will keep warm.\nHe nods toward the waiting room. “I've got the radiator. Hot as anything.”\nThe small door to the White Room stands behind the station building. No handle, just an old keyhole. As you lift the Fogtown key toward it, the bolt withdraws by itself.\nBehind you, the bench creaks.\nThe attendant is folding paper under its leg for the next arrival."}}},"astral":{"name":{"zh":"白室","en":"White Room"},"intro":{"zh":{"title":"对面的椅子","text":"白室闻起来像刚拖过的地板。没有窗，墙脚却留着一圈潮痕。桌上放着三只搪瓷杯，水面都很平，杯底的影子却各自晃动。\n记录员替你拉开椅子。他穿着熨得整齐的衬衫，袖口还别着一枚生锈的曲别针。\n“外套不用脱。”他说，“这里坐不久。”\n你问他多久算久。他翻开案卷，没有答，只把一张照片推到桌子中央。照片里的你正坐在这把椅子上，身后的人被裁掉了一半。\n失踪者、目击者、记录人，三栏都是你的姓名。登记栏的最后一笔拖出一个钩。你刚才替记录员补完门牌号，落笔时也是这样。\n你碰了一下纸角，灰厂那股白菜汤的气味忽然浮上来。记录员也闻到了。他咽了一下，继续摆正桌上的笔。\n“问完能走？”你说。\n“能离开这间屋子。”\n你看着他。他把那句话划掉，重新写了一遍，一个字没改。\n门后的灯亮了。你听到衣料摩擦椅背的声音，对面那把空椅子慢慢向后挪开。\n记录员终于松开了手里的笔。\n“现在，请你听听另一份说法。”"},"en":{"title":"The Opposite Chair","text":"The White Room smells of a freshly mopped floor. It has no windows, though damp marks ring the walls. Three enamel cups stand on the table. Their water is still. The shadows at their bases move independently.\nThe recording officer pulls out a chair. His shirt is neatly pressed. A rusted paper clip is pinned to one cuff.\n“Keep your coat on. You won't be sitting long.”\nYou ask what counts as long. He opens the file instead of answering and places a photograph in the middle of the table. You are seated in this chair. The person behind you has been cropped in half.\nMissing person. Witness. Recording officer. Your name fills all three fields. The last stroke in the reporting field ends in a hook. You made the same mark a moment ago, finishing the address for him.\nYou touch the paper. The smell of cabbage soup from Ash Works rises briefly between you. He smells it too. He swallows and straightens the pens.\n“Can I go when we're finished?”\n“You can leave this room.”\nYou look at him. He crosses out the sentence and writes it again without changing a word.\nA light comes on behind the door. Cloth brushes against a chair back. The empty seat opposite you begins sliding away from the table.\nAt last, he puts down his pen.\n“Now I'd like you to hear the other account.”"}},"clear":{"zh":{"title":"还热着的杯子","text":"最后一张牌落下，白室里响起水壶烧开的声音。记录员低头看了看桌面，没有去关。\n桌角的录音机转了起来。里面有人喘着气，问有没有人听见。你认得那口气：在雪站，你曾嫌它太吵，把音量拧小过。\n“先把地址说清楚。”你对着话筒报出白室的门牌号。最后一个数字念得含糊，你又重念一遍。磁带里那个人也停在同一个地方。\n你松开话筒，手心已经湿了。\n记录员递来一张空白的失踪登记表。“没人报失踪，就不会有人出去找。”\n照片是你的。表格还空着。你想起一路为你留门、留汤的人，把自己的姓名写了上去。失踪日期那一栏，你迟疑很久，最后填了明天。至少还有一天，你想。\n登记人处的最后一笔，拖出一个收不住的钩。\n你怕过去的自己在码头说错话，在电报纸上写下雪站的地址和“别回答”。拇指蹭过未干的墨，抹掉了发报人的名字。\n防火女给的蓝线还在口袋里。你剪下一截，打了个反结，装进写着自己姓名的信封。那把湿钥匙压住封口；你把它们连同登记表推进墙边的退件槽，想给走不出去的人留一条路。\n铁槽里响了一声勺子碰锅沿的轻响。随后，你听见熟食铺的天气预报开始念你的姓名。\n你把手伸回去，只摸到潮湿的铁皮。\n墙上的潮痕退下去，露出一道窄门。登记表已经不在桌上；留下的复写纸，正是你醒来时翻过的第一页。\n“我把它送回去了。”你说。\n记录员看着你手上的墨，没有说“终于”。\n你推开门。\n雾镇的值班室里，守夜人诺亚正往杯子里添水。钟停在03:17。他抬头看你，先看脸，再看你身后，壶嘴便在杯沿上多停了一会儿。\n“姓名？”他问。\n你没有立刻回答。桌上的失踪案卷还是明天的日期，纸角却多了一块汤渍。你把一路带来的东西放在上面，压住了照片。\n“你这里有几把椅子？”你说。\n守夜人低头数了一遍。屋里明明安静，你却听见有人在门外忍笑。\n“今天大概要少一把。”他答。\n你替身后的人挪开椅子，把外套脱下来，搭回原来的椅背。木腿擦过地板，发出很普通、很难听的一声。那声音让你的手停了一下。\n你知道是谁寄了那封信。可守夜人拆掉的两针、手套里面的指印，还有水底那束光，仍然没有人认领。\n窗外的雾仍旧不散。你坐下时，掌心被杯子烫痛。缺掉的蓝漆正一点点浮回来；这回，你没有把登记人那一栏折进封皮。"},"en":{"title":"The Cup Is Still Warm","text":"The last card lands. Somewhere in the White Room, a kettle comes to the boil. The recording officer looks down at the table. He makes no move to switch it off.\nThe recorder at the corner of the desk begins turning. Someone is breathing hard, asking whether anyone can hear. You know that breath. At Snow Station, you turned it down because it was too loud.\n“Give them the address.” Into the microphone, you read the White Room building number. You stumble over the last digit and repeat it. The person on the tape pauses in the same place.\nYou let go of the microphone. Your palm is wet.\nThe officer offers a blank missing-person form. “Nobody goes looking until somebody reports it.”\nThe photograph is yours. The form is empty. You remember everyone who has held a door or saved a meal for you, and write your name. At the date, you hesitate. Then you put tomorrow. At least there is still a day, you think.\nThe last stroke of the reporting person’s name ends in a hook you cannot quite control.\nAfraid your earlier self will answer the ferryman, you write the Snow Station address and DO NOT ANSWER on telegraph paper. Your thumb catches the wet ink, smearing the sender’s name.\nThe Fire Warden’s blue thread is still in your pocket. You cut a length, tie the backward knot, and put it in an envelope bearing your name. The wet key holds down its flap. You push everything, with the report, into the return slot in the wall, hoping to leave a route for someone who cannot get out.\nInside the metal chute, a spoon taps the edge of a pot. Then the cook’s weather forecast begins reading your name.\nYou reach back in. Your fingers find only damp metal.\nThe wet mark retreats down the wall, revealing a narrow door. The form has left the desk. Its carbon copy is the first page you opened when you woke.\n“I sent it back,” you say.\nThe officer looks at the ink on your hand. He does not say, “At last.”\nYou open the door.\nIn the Fogtown duty room, the Night Watch, Noah is pouring water. The clock reads 03:17. He looks at your face, then at the space behind you. The kettle lingers above the rim.\n“Name?”\nYou do not answer at once. The missing-person file is still dated tomorrow, but a soup stain marks one corner. You place the things you have brought back over the photograph.\n“How many chairs do you have?”\nHe counts them. The room is quiet. You hear someone trying not to laugh outside the door.\n“One short today, I think.”\nYou pull out a chair for whoever has followed you and hang your coat over the chair where you first found it. Its wooden legs scrape the floor with an ordinary, ugly sound. Your hand stops at the familiarity of it.\nYou know who sent the letter. Nobody has accounted for the two stitches the Night Watch unpicked, the print inside his glove, or the light beneath the water.\nThe fog has not cleared. As you sit, the cup burns your palm. The missing blue enamel is returning. This time, you leave the reporting person’s name unfolded."}}}},"companions":{"zh":{"rewardTitle":"桌边多了一把椅子","rewardText":"对手把手从牌上收回来，暂时没有走。也许只是等雨停，也许和你一样，不愿再独自上路。","recruit":"{boss}拉过一把椅子。“先说好，路上要是有热饭，你请。”说着，替你扶住了那扇往回合的门。","recruitGold":"{boss}把金边的那张记录递过来，纸角还带着体温。“收好。别又当成别人的东西。”","recruitAgain":"{boss}看了看你的旧外套，往旁边挪出一点位置。“还是这里破了。坐下，我找根线。”","cardNote":"曾经坐在对面的人。如今愿意替你扶一会儿门。","ordinaryReward":"桌面上留下几张记录，纸页带着刚才那个人指尖的温度。选一张，带去下一处现场。","selectionHint":"选中Boss奖励牌后，对方才成为同行证人。原有卡牌技能、费用与组卡规则继续生效。"},"en":{"rewardTitle":"Another Chair at the Table","rewardText":"Your opponent takes a hand off the cards but does not leave. Perhaps they are waiting for the rain to stop. Perhaps they are tired of traveling alone.","recruit":"{boss} pulls up a chair. “If there's a hot meal on the road, you're buying.” Then they hold the door before it swings shut.","recruitGold":"{boss} hands over the record with the gold border. The corner is still warm. “Keep it. Don't mistake it for someone else's again.”","recruitAgain":"{boss} notices your old coat and makes room. “Torn in the same place. Sit down. I'll find some thread.”","cardNote":"Someone who once sat opposite you. Now willing to hold the door for a while.","ordinaryReward":"Several records remain on the table, the paper still warm from the other person's fingers. Choose one for the next site.","selectionHint":"A Boss becomes a witness traveling with you only when you choose its reward card. Existing abilities, costs and deck rules still apply."}},"loop":{"zh":{"button":"推开值班室的门","continue":"继续调查","notice":"新一轮调查开始时，同行者、已获卡牌、收藏、最近保存的牌组和重战解锁都会保留。","returnTitle":"茶还没有凉透","returnText":"铁盆放在原来的位置。你的外套也在，只是袖口缝上了一截蓝线。守夜人诺亚听见椅脚响，抬头数了数门口的人，默默多拿出几个杯子。\n“人多了，水得兑淡一点。”\n你闻到冷茶里的铁味。墙上的钟仍停在03:17，可收音机这回没有抢先替你说话。你把案卷摊开，终于没有躲过那一栏：登记人，还是你的姓名。\n“我想离开这里。”你说。\n他捏着针，等了一会儿。\n“我知道。先把外套穿好。”","countLabel":"第{loop}次调查"},"en":{"button":"Open the Duty Room Door","continue":"Continue the Investigation","notice":"The next investigation keeps your companions, acquired cards, collection, latest saved deck and replay unlocks.","returnTitle":"The Tea Is Still Warm","returnText":"The tin basin is where you left it. So is your coat, with a length of blue thread mending its cuff. Hearing the chair scrape, the Night Watch, Noah counts the people in the doorway and brings out more cups.\n“More mouths. I'll have to water it down.”\nThe tea smells of iron. The clock still reads 03:17. This time, the radio does not speak ahead of you. You open the file without hiding the reporting field. It is still your name.\n“I want to leave,” you say.\nHe waits with the needle between his fingers.\n“I know. Put your coat on first.”","countLabel":"Investigation {loop}"}}};
const COMPANION_DIALOGUE={"苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"join":"钥匙挂我腰上，簿子归你拿。有人问几点，就让他看03:17，别借表给他。上回借出去，天就没亮。","joinEn":"I will keep the keys; you take the book. If anyone asks the time, show them 03:17. Do not lend them your watch. Last time, morning never came."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"join":"那把椅子归你了。坐稳再走，别笑；我就是坐着它来的，镇口还没有到。","joinEn":"The chair is yours. Sit firmly before we leave. Laugh if you like; it brought me here, and the edge of town is still ahead."},"苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"join":"你把铃收好。它饿的时候，我听得出来；要是它叫我的名字，先别让我答应。","joinEn":"Keep the bell. I can hear when it is hungry. If it calls me by name, do not let me answer at once."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"join":"往上爬时，替我扶住梯子。往下就不必了，这地方往下走，通常得再爬一次。","joinEn":"Hold the ladder when I climb. Do not bother on the way down. Going down here usually means another climb."},"苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"join":"钱袋扣紧，我走外侧。你可以数钱，不过到了桥头，先数数还剩几只手。","joinEn":"Fasten your purse. I will walk on the outside. Count your money if you must; at the bridge, count the hands first."},"苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"join":"外套借你。别嫌烟味，我洗过三回了。口袋里那张车票要是发热，就叫醒我。","joinEn":"Borrow my coat. Never mind the smoke; I have washed it three times. Wake me if the ticket in the pocket grows warm."},"苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"join":"把灯罩留条缝。它想跟着我们，不想被人看见。你也有这种时候，对吧？","joinEn":"Leave a gap in the lampshade. It wants to come without being seen. You know the feeling, do you not?"},"苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"join":"脚放在白线上，慢一点。我会补好你身后的网。那些敲门的，今晚只能再等一等。","joinEn":"Keep your feet on the white thread. Slowly. I will mend the web behind you. Those at the door can wait another night."},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"join":"绳子你拿这一头。我答应过不再丢下谁；担架上的也算，虽然他自己不这么想。","joinEn":"Take this end of the rope. I promised not to leave anyone behind. That includes the one on the stretcher, whatever he thinks."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"join":"证件我没有，路倒认得。你若肯带我，查证的时候就说我是给你送伞的。","joinEn":"I have no papers, but I know the road. Take me along; at a checkpoint, say I brought your umbrella."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"join":"桥中间有块松木板，绕开它。我每晚都修，早上钉子却总在我的鞋底。","joinEn":"Mind the loose plank in the middle. I mend it every night. By morning, the nails are always in my soles."},"苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"join":"铲子别放进车厢，会弄脏座位。我跟你走，可不想一到下一站就开始上班。","joinEn":"Keep the shovel out of the carriage. It dirties the seats. I will come, but I would rather not start work at the next stop."},"苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"join":"我把名字签在背面了。正面留给你；要是有人问，这回我们至少有两份说法。","joinEn":"My name is on the back. The front is yours. If anyone asks, at least we have two accounts of it now."},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"join":"等雾往低处走再动身。你看它在躲什么；我不敢问，也不想在它前头带路。","joinEn":"Wait until the mist moves downhill. Watch what it avoids. I dare not ask, and I will not lead the way ahead of it."},"苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"join":"照片由你收着。我不爱照相，尤其不爱那张。底片上，我比现在还年轻一天。","joinEn":"Keep the photograph. I dislike cameras, that picture most of all. On its negative, I am a day younger than I am now."},"苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"join":"信我收下了，地址你来读。邮差欠我三趟回程，今晚总该让他替我们跑一次。","joinEn":"I have the letter. You read the address. The postman owes me three return trips. Tonight he can make one for us."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"join":"把耳朵捂好，门我来推。我们听到的若不是同一声，进去以后就别分开走。","joinEn":"Cover your ears. I will push the door. If we hear different chimes, we stay together once we are inside."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"join":"钥匙别碰我的脸，冻得厉害。走吧，换岗的人该到了；我不想再跟自己交班。","joinEn":"Keep the key away from my face. It is bitterly cold. Let us leave before the relief arrives. I am tired of handing over to myself."},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"join":"替我留个座位就行。不用垫子，我感觉不到。椅子响的时候，你装作没听见。","joinEn":"A seat is enough. No cushion; I would not feel it. When the chair creaks, pretend you did not hear."},"铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"join":"赊账本也带上。走出镇子就一笔勾销；你别高兴太早，写这句话的人还没回来。","joinEn":"Bring the credit book. All debts end beyond the town. Do not celebrate yet; whoever wrote that has not returned."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"join":"布给他盖严一点。我的活儿做到这就够了；路上若听见敲棺声，先查查是谁在外头。","joinEn":"Cover him properly. My work here is done. If the coffin starts knocking on the road, first check who is outside it."},"铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"join":"把钟摆卸下来再走。它已经不报时了，可闻到生人的气味，还是会往那边摆。","joinEn":"Take down the pendulum before we leave. It no longer tells time, but it still swings toward the smell of a stranger."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"join":"炉边那壶水带上，我记得还热。你先别喝；壶嘴刚才，叫出了我母亲的名字。","joinEn":"Take the kettle by the stove. It should still be warm. Do not drink yet. The spout just said my mother’s name."},"铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"join":"小齿轮收进纸包，别放衣袋。它们爱往心口钻。你笑什么？修钟的也有修不好的东西。","joinEn":"Wrap the small gears in paper, not in your pocket. They work their way toward the heart. Laugh all you like; even a clockmaker has limits."},"铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"join":"钟面我替你缝住。听见它在里头走，就继续走你的，千万别好心放它出来。","joinEn":"I will stitch the clock face shut. If you hear something moving inside, keep walking. Do not be kind enough to let it out."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"join":"困了就推推我，我还认得路。只要不是梦里那条；那条路，醒着的人走不了。","joinEn":"Nudge me if you grow tired. I still know the road. Unless it is the one in my dreams. Nobody awake can take that road."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"join":"走的时候离我远半步。衣服上的刺不认朋友，上次拥抱我可赔了一整件大衣。","joinEn":"Stay half a step away as we walk. The thorns do not know a friend. My last embrace cost someone an entire overcoat."},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"join":"杯底那一点留着，等天亮再喝。要是咽下去还是咸的，我们就还没离开楼里。","joinEn":"Leave a little in the cup until daylight. If it still tastes of salt, we have not left the tower."},"铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"join":"你扶着那截根，别用斧头。它肯松开台阶，我们就有路；要换什么，等它开口。","joinEn":"Hold the root. No axe. If it lets go of the stairs, we have a way through. Let it name its price."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"join":"欠条我没撕，先折起来。出了门再谈利息。我也想知道，这几年究竟是谁在替我收钱。","joinEn":"I have folded the note, not torn it up. We can discuss interest outside. I would like to know who has been collecting for me."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"join":"站在我看得见的这边。另一边我也能看见点东西，不过没有一样像是活人。","joinEn":"Stay on the side where I can see you. I see things on the other side too. None looks particularly alive."},"铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"join":"表我停好了，等你走远再上弦。别道谢，迟到一回的感觉，我也想试试。","joinEn":"I have stopped the watch. I will wind it when you are well away. No thanks needed. I would like to be late for once."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"join":"手套给你，门上还有余热。我先检查封条；厂里最不缺的，就是擅自开门的人。","joinEn":"Take the gloves. The door is still warm. Let me check the seals first. This factory has never lacked people who open doors without asking."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"join":"瓶子是空的，别闻了。酒早没了，醉意倒还在。出去以后，我想喝点真的。","joinEn":"The bottle is empty. Stop smelling it. The drink is gone; the drunkenness remains. Outside, I would like something real."},"炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"join":"靠墙走，我会跟上。烟里还有我的半件外套，等它肯放手，剩下的半个也就齐了。","joinEn":"Stay by the wall. I will catch up. The smoke still has half my coat. When it lets go, the rest of me will be complete."},"炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"join":"止血钳收好，别夹文件。纸会疼的，你昨天没听见么？走吧，路上的伤我管。","joinEn":"Put the forceps away. Not on the papers; paper feels it. Did you not hear yesterday? Come on. I will see to any wounds on the road."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"join":"工牌不用还，拿着吧。万一外面也查考勤，咱们总不能算无故旷工。","joinEn":"Keep the pass. They may check attendance outside too. We should not be marked absent without leave."},"炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"join":"骨头我分开装了，不会再响。就是那只手有自己的主意，经过栏杆时你看着点。","joinEn":"I packed the bones separately. They will not rattle now. The hand has ideas of its own. Watch it near railings."},"炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"join":"底片给你，别迎着灯看。我陪你去找拍照的人；这张合影里，我还没来得及站好。","joinEn":"Take the negative. Keep it out of the light. I will come to find the photographer. In that group picture, I had not taken my place yet."},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"join":"炉子我背着就行，别往里添柴。它最近胃口不好，连纸上写的木头都烧。","joinEn":"I can carry the furnace. Do not feed it. Its appetite has been strange lately; it even burns the word for wood on paper."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"join":"风口我挡着。你先走，别踩墙边那排脚印；鞋底的花纹，我认得是我的。","joinEn":"I will block the vent. Go ahead, but avoid those prints along the wall. I recognize the tread. It is mine."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"join":"封条留我一半，你拿一半。要是两边都发烫，就别争是谁开了门，先跑。","joinEn":"Half the seal for you, half for me. If both halves turn hot, never mind who opened the door. Run."},"炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"join":"这点火够照路，别拿来取暖。有人靠得太近，它就会记住那个人的温度。","joinEn":"This flame is enough to light the road, not to warm us. Lean too close and it remembers your temperature."},"炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"join":"灰装进铁盒，我留着有用。字烧掉了，笔迹还在；也许门外有人肯认领。","joinEn":"Put the ash in the tin. I can use it. The words burned away, but the handwriting remains. Someone outside may claim it."},"炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"join":"卡我替你打好了。出厂后别回头刷第二次，这台机器从来分不清离开和报到。","joinEn":"I have punched your card. Do not turn back to punch it again. That machine has never distinguished leaving from arriving."},"炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"join":"电话线别拔，我拿着听筒走。对面那个人还没说完，至少今晚，不能再让他独自等了。","joinEn":"Leave the line connected. I will carry the receiver. The caller has not finished. Tonight, at least, they need not wait alone."},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"join":"把铁片按平，慢慢来。它肯从喉咙里吐出来，已经算客气了，别再拿来试火。","joinEn":"Flatten the metal, gently. It was kind enough to cough it up. Do not test it in the fire again."},"炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"join":"下班铃我关了。让他们多坐一会儿。你说外头有天亮？那我可得亲自看看。","joinEn":"I switched off the closing bell. Let them sit a little longer. You say it gets light outside? I will have to see that myself."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"join":"别拽缰绳，让它自己找浅水。要是它突然停下，我劝你也停；岸不总在前面。","joinEn":"Keep the rein loose. Let it find the shallows. If it stops, I suggest you stop too. The shore is not always ahead."},"暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"join":"筹码我留下，外套带走。钱可以改天再赢；你要真认得出口，这一局我跟。","joinEn":"I will leave the chips and take my coat. There will be other winnings. If you really know an exit, I am in."},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"join":"离那排牙远一点。它刚认了我，可没认你。走吧，等潮水抬头就不好走了。","joinEn":"Keep away from those teeth. It recognizes me now, but not you. Come on. Travel gets harder when the tide looks up."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"join":"先替它把眼睛盖住。岸上灯太亮，它不习惯。绳子你松着，它会跟上来的。","joinEn":"Cover its eyes first. The shore lights are too bright for it. Keep the rope loose. It will follow."},"暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"join":"你拿舵，我认星。认错了也别急着骂我，船沉了以后，星星就没待过原来的位置。","joinEn":"You take the helm. I will read the stars. Save your complaints if I am wrong; since the sinking, none has kept its old place."},"暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"join":"这副牌你洗，袖口翻出来。我也翻。走到一条船上，总得先学会互相提防。","joinEn":"You shuffle. Turn out your sleeves; I will do the same. Sharing a boat means learning how to watch each other."},"暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"join":"线绕在手腕上，别打死结。真有什么从底下拉，先松开我，救人不是这么个救法。","joinEn":"Wind the thread around your wrist. No tight knot. If something pulls below, let go of me first. That is no way to rescue anyone."},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"join":"床板我拿去补船。别问我睡哪里；睡过这一舱，站着都算好觉。","joinEn":"I will use the bunk boards to patch the boat. Do not ask where I will sleep. After that hold, standing up counts as a good night."},"暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"join":"灯罩你擦，我去提油。水底要是先回了信，就放进衣袋；饭后再读，省得白吃。","joinEn":"You polish the glass; I will fetch the oil. If a reply comes from below before our signal, pocket it. Read it after supper. No need to spoil a meal."},"暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"join":"把灯调暗一点，你就能看见我。亮着的时候跟紧些；连我也不知道自己躲去了哪里。","joinEn":"Lower the lamp and you can see me. Keep close while it is bright. Even I do not know where I go then."},"暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"join":"我坐左边，你坐右边。等船靠岸再换；水里的那两位，还在照着咱们学。","joinEn":"I sit left, you sit right. We can change ashore. The two in the water are still learning by watching us."},"暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"join":"手别伸进去，水会记住指纹。你要问它什么，让我来；它已经认识我的声音了。","joinEn":"Keep your hand out. The water remembers fingerprints. Let me ask the questions. It already knows my voice."},"暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"join":"草料不用带，带干毛巾。它跑得再快，也得先让蹄子相信，岸确实是干的。","joinEn":"Leave the feed. Bring dry towels. However fast it runs, its hooves need to believe the shore is dry."},"暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"join":"酒我不带了，免得你一路看着瓶子。杯子留着吧，出去以后，咱们也许还有得庆祝。","joinEn":"I will leave the wine. No need for you to watch the bottle all the way. Keep the glasses. We may have something to celebrate outside."},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"join":"枝子上那盏灯取下来，拿布包好。它不是挂上去的，我也不想让你看见它怎么长的。","joinEn":"Take the lamp from the antler and wrap it in cloth. Nobody hung it there. I would rather you did not see how it grows."},"暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"join":"潮声先别录。坐下喝口热水，听我说完；你上回来，少听的偏偏就是这一段。","joinEn":"Leave the recorder off. Sit and have something warm while I finish. Last time, this was the part you did not stay to hear."},"霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"join":"把角上的布再裹一层，别让它结冰。它要是敲起车窗来，里面的人会以为该下车了。","joinEn":"Wrap the horn again. Keep the ice off it. If it taps a window, the passengers inside will think it is time to get out."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"join":"跟着我踩旧脚印，新雪下面不结实。要是听见冰从头顶裂开，也别抬头。","joinEn":"Step in the old prints. The fresh snow is not sound beneath. If you hear ice cracking overhead, do not look up."},"霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"join":"绳结打松点。它闻得到回家的草，路上别再给它报站名，广播已经报错太多回了。","joinEn":"Loosen the knot. It can smell the grass at home. No more station names on the way. The announcements have been wrong often enough."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"join":"刀收鞘，汤还给你。外头要是真的下雪，总得带个能削木柴的人，算你没白请客。","joinEn":"The knife stays sheathed. Here is your soup. If it is really snowing outside, you will need someone who can shave kindling. Your meal was well spent."},"霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"join":"沿白线走，我把后头封住。别心疼胶带，它比车票便宜，也比人的皮结实。","joinEn":"Follow the white line. I will seal the way behind us. Do not spare the tape. Cheaper than a ticket, tougher than skin."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"join":"围巾留给它，咱们再找一条。你看它抱得多紧；有人从前，也是这样给它系上的。","joinEn":"Let it keep the scarf. We can find another. See how tightly it holds it? Someone once tied it on that way."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"join":"另一只袖子扎起来，免得灌雪。它还会往那边递东西，等空着的手去接，习惯改不过来。","joinEn":"Tie the empty sleeve against the snow. It still offers things to the missing hand. Some habits take longer to change."},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"join":"食盒你拿着，它就肯跟。别喂太快；这地方把饥饿留住了，饱意却留不长。","joinEn":"Carry the food tin and it will follow. Feed it slowly. This place keeps hunger well, but fullness never lasts."},"霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"join":"哨子挂你那边，我吹不响了。真到需要的时候，短的两声，长的那声留给站里。","joinEn":"You wear the whistle. I can no longer blow it. If we need it, two short notes. Leave the long one for the station."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"join":"名字先空着，我认得自己的行李。出了这里再告诉你，省得售票窗又替我改一遍。","joinEn":"Leave my name blank. I know my luggage. I will tell you outside, before the ticket window can change it again."},"霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"join":"门牌卸下来带走。没有站名，它就不好意思再叫人等车了，至少我这么想。","joinEn":"Take down the station sign. Without a name, it may be too embarrassed to make us wait for a train. I hope so, anyway."},"霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"join":"别把暖炉叫醒。它梦见的地方还不冷，等咱们过去，也许能剩一点热。","joinEn":"Do not wake the stove. It is dreaming of somewhere warm. Perhaps some heat will remain when we get there."},"霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"join":"热水壶带上，药包我背。路上谁说自己不冷，你先看看他的手，还会不会抖。","joinEn":"Bring the kettle. I will carry the medicine. If someone says they are not cold, check whether their hands can still tremble."},"霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"join":"耳机一人一边，听见敲三下就摘。别问第三下以后是什么，我还想在路上睡会儿。","joinEn":"One earpiece each. Take it off after three knocks. Do not ask what follows. I would like some sleep on the road."},"霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"join":"把水浇上去，别给我留面子。火真蹿起来，谁先赔不是都没用，靴子会先烧。","joinEn":"Throw the water. Spare my pride later. If it flares up, apologies will not help. The boots burn first."},"霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"join":"行李不多，等我关上柜子。我把旧地址留在里面；到了新地方，你再教我写一个。","joinEn":"Not much luggage. Let me shut the locker. I left the old address inside. When we arrive somewhere new, you can help me write another."},"星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"join":"书签别拔，我记不住页码。等你真找到最后一页，再叫醒我；别拿封底骗我。","joinEn":"Leave the bookmark. Page numbers slip my mind. Wake me when you find the last page. The back cover will not fool me."},"星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"join":"镜子给它蒙上，走路就不会老停。我也想看看，没那张脸盯着，自己还会不会认错门。","joinEn":"Cover the mirror so it stops us less. I would like to see whether I still take the wrong door without that face watching."},"星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"join":"梯子你扶着，我把那一点光摘下来。够不够照路，得先到了黑处才知道。","joinEn":"Steady the ladder. I will take down that bit of light. We will know whether it is enough when we reach the dark."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"join":"跟它走，别催。它还在等月亮转过去；有些路，得先让水里的影子腾个位。","joinEn":"Follow it. No hurry. It is waiting for the moon to turn. On some roads, the reflection has to make room first."},"星铸灯议长·图烙":{"join":"题目背面朝上，咱们出去再看答案。要是我又问你看见什么，就请我先闭上眼。","joinEn":"Keep the questions face down. We can read the answers outside. If I ask what you see again, tell me to shut my eyes first."},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"join":"碑文拓在纸上，石头就留下。人要走得快一点，总不能把每件错事都背在肩上。","joinEn":"Take a rubbing. Leave the stone. To make any speed, we cannot carry every wrong thing on our backs."},"星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"join":"脸上的布不用解，我认得你的鞋声。你走慢一点；我不想出门就认丢第一个朋友。","joinEn":"Leave the cloth on my face. I know your footsteps. Walk slowly. I would hate to lose my first friend just outside the door."},"星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"join":"灯别照着伤口，照脚下。裂缝里那些人不认路，喊得再客气，你也别替他们领路。","joinEn":"Light the ground, not the wound. The people in that crack do not know the road. However politely they ask, do not guide them."},"星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"join":"尾巴先松开，别再咬着。你看，它也累了。今晚让路往前伸一次，回来再说。","joinEn":"Let go of the tail. No more biting. See how tired it is? Let the road run forward tonight. We can discuss returning later."},"星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"join":"盘子我洗好了，就别再端上来。赶路的人得吃饭，可我总得学会分清客人和晚餐。","joinEn":"I washed the plate. Leave it there. Travelers need food, but I must learn the difference between a guest and a supper."},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"join":"你先过去，我把梁放稳。别忙着道谢，真要谢，出去给我找把不晃的椅子。","joinEn":"Go ahead while I settle the beam. Save your thanks. Outside, find me a chair that does not wobble."},"星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"join":"把绳子收起来，它不用牵。你停它就会停；别再往后数了，少的那只不会喜欢。","joinEn":"Put the lead away. It stops when you stop. Do not keep counting behind us. The missing one would not like it."},"星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"join":"椅子留空，外套拿走。我陪你站着等。这屋里坐过的人太多，谁都没等到自己的号。","joinEn":"Leave the chair empty. Take the coat. I will wait standing with you. Too many have sat here without their number being called."},"星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"join":"纱布按紧，名字等会儿签。人的血不该拿来校对，我早该想起这件事。","joinEn":"Hold the gauze down. The signature can wait. Blood was never meant for checking a form. I should have remembered sooner."},"星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"join":"笔我收了，你拿空白那份。外面要是还查姓名，咱们这回让他们先报自己的。","joinEn":"The pen is put away. You take the blank copy. If they ask our names outside, let them give theirs first."},"星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"join":"门替你留着，我也出去看看。你若又见到同一张桌子，别急着坐；替我多留把椅子。","joinEn":"I will hold the door and come out too. If you find the same table again, do not sit at once. Leave another chair for me."},"炽砂修灯师·瑟罗":{"join":"汤在炉边，喝完再走。我会把封条重新压好；今晚让那团火自己待着，别什么都有人陪。","joinEn":"Soup is by the furnace. Finish it before we go. I will press the seals down again. The fire can spend tonight alone; not everything needs company."}};
const BOSS_ENTRANCES={"苔庭铠卫·雅恩":{"world":"mire","level":1,"zh":{"title":"没有交班的人","text":"诺亚从门后的窄柜里取出一块旧毡布，铺在两只茶杯之间。他的制服领口磨得发白，右手少了一颗袖扣，针却牢牢别在原处。方才补好的手套，被他塞进了最深的口袋。\n“不是要走吗？”他拉开对面的椅子，“总得有人确认你醒着。”\n你问为什么不能直接签字。他抬眼看看停在03:17的钟，指腹缓缓搓过牌角，那里有一小块干掉的红。\n“签字太容易学。”他说。铁盆又响了一声。他没有回头，只把第一张牌推到灯下。"},"en":{"title":"The Man Who Never Changed Shifts","text":"Noah takes a piece of worn felt from the narrow cupboard behind the door and spreads it between the cups. His uniform collar has faded white. A cuff button is missing, but the needle remains in place. He pushes the mended glove deep into a pocket.\n“You wanted to leave. Someone has to establish that you are awake.” He pulls out the opposite chair.\nYou ask why a signature will not do. He glances at the clock, stopped at 03:17. His thumb works over a dried red spot on a card.\n“Signatures are easy to learn.”\nThe basin sounds again. Without turning, he slides the first card into the lamplight."}},"苔庭裂角客领誓·阿珀":{"world":"mire","level":2,"zh":{"title":"门框上的刻痕","text":"你沿熟食铺后巷走到测量所，里面先传出一声木头开裂的响动。亚伯侧身穿过门框，额头一支断角挂下细细的漆屑。他把旧呢帽拿在手里，帽檐剪了两个大小不同的洞。\n他来取一份量过三次的身高记录，却发现领取栏签着你的姓名。你说没来过。他不争，只将纸翻到背面，露出一副被压平的牌。\n“我想知道，是你撒谎，还是尺子。”\n他坐下时特意把断角朝向墙。那面墙已经凿出一个合适的凹口，边缘干净得像每天都有人擦。"},"en":{"title":"The Mark in the Doorframe","text":"A crack of timber comes from the survey office behind the food shop. Abel turns sideways through its doorway. Paint hangs from the broken horn on his forehead. He holds a felt hat with two holes cut through the brim, each a different size.\nHe has come for a height record measured three times. Your name occupies its collection field. You tell him you have never been here. Without arguing, he turns the sheet over and reveals a flattened deck.\n“I need to know whether you are lying, or the ruler.”\nHe sits with his broken horn toward the wall. A recess fits it perfectly. Its edges are clean, as though someone wipes them every day."}},"苔庭赤角兽领誓·艾珀":{"world":"mire","level":3,"zh":{"title":"空桶里的牛铃","text":"井边没有人，只有一只翻倒的铁桶在轻轻滚动。布鲁诺从低矮牛棚里顶开栅门，肩背沾着湿草，鼻环锈得发黑。一边牛角绑着布条，上面写了三次作废的工号。\n它用前蹄把铁桶拨正，桶底传出一声牛铃。你靠近时，它退到铺着牌的低矮木箱后，挡住通往后街的小门。\n箱上压着一张领水单：领用人，布鲁诺；代领人，空白。\n你伸手拿笔，它却用鼻尖把笔推远，只留下牌。牛棚深处响起两声咳嗽。它的耳朵转了过去，鼻孔里仍没有一点热气。"},"en":{"title":"The Bell in the Empty Bucket","text":"Nobody is at the well. An overturned bucket rolls quietly beside it. Bruno pushes through the cattle-shed gate, wet straw clinging to broad shoulders. His nose ring is black with rust. A strip tied around one horn bears a work number canceled three times.\nHe rights the bucket with a hoof. A bell sounds inside. When you approach, he backs behind a low crate laid with cards, blocking the door to the next street.\nA water-collection form names Bruno. The proxy field is blank.\nYou reach for a pencil. His muzzle pushes it away, leaving the cards. Two coughs come from the shed. His ears turn toward them. No warmth leaves his nostrils."}},"苔庭裂角客领誓·欧珀":{"world":"mire","level":4,"zh":{"title":"从屋顶下来","text":"雨刚停，西拉便沿着倒置的排水管滑下来。他的脚先碰到门楣，手最后才松开。长外套的下摆焦成硬片，颈侧有一圈擦不掉的浅痕；额角的小角，却被修剪得很整齐。\n他抱着一张折叠桌，是来向楼下房客讨回屋顶的使用权。房客已经搬走，只留下一封写给你的投诉信。\n“他们说我睡觉太响。”西拉将桌子支开，“可我整夜都没合眼。”\n他请你坐下，把牌一张张从焦黑衣缝里抽出来。水沿他的袖子往上流，直到你看不见的领口。"},"en":{"title":"Down From the Roof","text":"The rain stops. Silas slides down an inverted drainpipe, touching the lintel with his feet before releasing his hands. His coat hem has burned stiff. A pale ring marks his neck, while the little horns above it are carefully trimmed.\nHe carries a folding table. He has come to reclaim the use of the roof from a tenant downstairs. The tenant has left. A complaint addressed to you remains.\n“They say I make too much noise asleep.” He unfolds the table. “I have not closed my eyes all night.”\nHe offers you a chair and pulls cards from the scorched seams of his coat. Water runs upward along his sleeves, disappearing beneath the collar."}},"苔庭潜印客·莫恩":{"world":"mire","level":5,"zh":{"title":"已经空着的口袋","text":"候车亭的玻璃后，有人朝你晃了晃一张纸。芬恩穿着窄肩黑外套，袖口比手腕长出一截，头发被雨压在额角。他说自己从邮局来，要把寄错的口供送回去。\n纸上是你的姓名。你摸了摸外套，才发现口袋里的折页已经不见。\n“我没拿。”他摊开双手，指甲缝洗得很干净，“拿东西的人，通常不会把东西拿在手上。”\n他踢正候车亭里那张歪桌，请你替他判断哪份口供是真的。两张椅子的湿痕还在原位，等你坐下，靠街的那把却到了他背后。"},"en":{"title":"The Pockets Already Empty","text":"Someone waves a sheet behind the bus-shelter glass. Finn wears a narrow black coat with sleeves extending past his wrists. Rain has pressed his hair against his temples. He says he has come from the post office to return a misdirected statement.\nYour name is on it. You touch your pocket. The folded page is gone.\n“I took nothing.” He opens spotless hands. “People who take things seldom keep them in their hands.”\nHe straightens a crooked table with his shoe and asks you to decide which account is genuine. Two wet chair marks remain on the floor. When you sit, the chair nearest the road has somehow moved behind his back."}},"苔庭铠卫·欧恩":{"world":"mire","level":6,"zh":{"title":"迟到的巡逻","text":"欧文从街口的雾里走来，鞋跟每落一下，就带出一小片烟灰。他的旧警服紧绷在肩上，帽徽被磨掉了一半，胸前的口袋压着几根一样长的烟头。\n他来检查值夜后的锁，却发现每扇门都从里面插上了。只剩你身旁那家停业的修鞋铺，卷帘门还留着半尺。\n“进去坐。站着问话，别人会以为我还领薪水。”\n他在修鞋凳上铺开牌，说要听听你打算从哪条街离开。你讲到路口，他已伸手护住灯泡。那里刚刚暗了一次，他掌心的新伤却在光下慢慢合拢。"},"en":{"title":"The Late Patrol","text":"Owen comes out of the fog at the corner, ash falling from his heels. His old police jacket strains across the shoulders. Half the badge has worn off his cap. Several cigarette ends of equal length flatten his breast pocket.\nHe has come to inspect the night locks. Every door is bolted inside except the closed shoe shop beside you, whose shutter stands a handspan above the pavement.\n“Sit inside. Standing interviews make people think I am still paid.”\nHe spreads cards over a cobbler’s stool and asks which street you intend to take out of town. As you describe the junction, he cups a hand around the bulb. It has just dimmed. A fresh cut in his palm is closing beneath its light."}},"苔庭绛纹蝶领誓·乌珀":{"world":"mire","level":7,"zh":{"title":"讣告的两边","text":"报摊卷帘升起时，一只巨蝶从旧报纸间展开翅膀。伊拉的翅缘沾着细黑的粉，两块浅纹各藏着半张侧脸。触须碰过纸面，讣告左右两栏便同时轻颤。\n摊主不在，收钱的瓷碟里扣着一张照片。两端的人被抹去，只剩中间的你。\n伊拉循着照片来到这里，停在牌桌空出的那一侧。它每拍一次翅，几张牌便准确翻面，留出一条足够你伸手的缝。\n你问该找谁结账。报纸下传来很轻的笑声。翅上的两张脸没有动，桌角却慢慢落下一张写着“请坐”的价签。"},"en":{"title":"The Edges of the Obituary","text":"A huge moth unfolds between old newspapers as the stall shutter rises. Black powder rims Ira’s wings. Two pale markings each conceal half a face in profile. Her antennae touch the paper. Both obituary columns tremble.\nThe seller is absent. A photograph lies beneath the money dish. The people at either end have been rubbed out. You remain in the middle.\nIra has followed that photograph here. She settles opposite the empty chair. Each wingbeat turns selected cards, leaving room for your hand.\nYou ask whom to pay. A faint laugh comes from under the newspaper. The faces on the wings stay still. A price label lands at the table’s corner. It reads: PLEASE SIT."}},"苔庭织光蛛领誓·雅珀":{"world":"mire","level":8,"zh":{"title":"井口的缝补","text":"井盖被人从下面推开半寸，一只灰白的长脚先搭上石沿。梅布尔慢慢爬出，腹部挂着浸水的门牌，八只脚尖却干燥得没有一点泥。它沿一根断线找过来，停在你的袖口前。\n你退开，它也退开，给你留出井旁的矮凳。那凳面铺满细丝，压着几张已经烫弯的牌。\n门牌背面刻着一句话：欠下的，要先结清。\n你不知道自己欠了什么。梅布尔用前脚轻敲桌边，丝线上逐个亮起暗红小点。它没有扑来，只耐心等你碰到牌，像等一个终于肯接针的人。"},"en":{"title":"Mending at the Well","text":"The well cover lifts a little from below. A pale leg rests on the stone. Mabel climbs out slowly, wet house numbers hanging from her abdomen. All eight feet are dry and clean. She follows a broken thread to your cuff.\nYou step back. She retreats too, leaving the low stool beside the well for you. Fine silk covers its seat beneath heat-warped cards.\nSomeone has scratched a sentence behind a house number: SETTLE WHAT IS OWED FIRST.\nYou do not know what you owe. Mabel taps the table edge. Dull red points brighten along the threads. She does not spring. She waits for your hand to touch the cards, as patiently as someone waiting for you to accept a needle."}},"苔庭峰脊巨灵领誓·瑟珀":{"world":"mire","level":9,"zh":{"title":"担架的另一头","text":"雨果推着一辆没有病人的担架车，从邮局旁的窄门里出来。他宽得几乎塞满门口，脸色却很淡，洗过的围裙在膝上留下笔直折痕。担架最沉的地方，只有一条空毯子。\n“替我看一会儿。”他把车停在你身边，手仍压着毯角。\n他原本要送人去镇外，却在每个街口都遇到同一块路牌。现在他要确认，是路出了错，还是自己记错了乘客。\n你们把牌放到担架上。雨果坐得很轻，椅子却向地板沉了半寸。毯子底下，有什么东西替你拉开了座位。"},"en":{"title":"The Other End of the Stretcher","text":"Hugo pushes an unoccupied stretcher out through the narrow door beside the post office. His shoulders almost fill the entrance. His face is pale. Freshly washed folds run straight down his apron. Only an empty blanket covers the stretcher’s heaviest section.\n“Watch this a moment.” He stops beside you without releasing the blanket corner.\nHe was taking someone beyond town. At every junction he found the same road sign. Now he needs to establish whether the road is wrong or he has forgotten his passenger.\nYou lay the cards on the stretcher. Hugo sits gently. His chair sinks half an inch into the floor. Something beneath the blanket pulls out a seat for you."}},"苔庭铠卫领誓·维珀":{"world":"mire","level":10,"zh":{"title":"不在名单上的灯","text":"里昂从电房的侧门出来，手里提着一只没有玻璃罩的手电。他穿深色勤务服，领带结得很紧，胸前别着一块空白证件。你刚报出姓名，他便用拇指把证件翻了过去。\n他是来找断电前最后一个按开关的人。维修表上画着你的外套，脸的位置却只涂了一团黑。\n“我也没有证件。”你说。\n“那倒省事。”他搬来两把绝缘木凳，“至少不用查谁是真的。”\n手电闪了一下。他立刻将牌压在电房的检修桌上。墙内的电流声停了，只有他袖子里的金属扣仍在轻轻作响。"},"en":{"title":"The Light Outside the Roster","text":"Leon leaves the power room by its side door carrying a flashlight without its glass. His dark service jacket has a tight tie and a blank identity card. As you give your name, his thumb turns the card over.\nHe is looking for the last person who touched the switch before the outage. The maintenance sheet contains a drawing of your coat. The face is blacked out.\n“I have no papers either,” you tell him.\n“That saves time.” He brings two insulated wooden stools. “We need not establish which papers are real.”\nThe flashlight blinks. He pins the cards to the maintenance table. The current inside the wall falls silent. Only a metal fastener in his sleeve continues to click."}},"苔庭铠卫领誓·希珀":{"world":"mire","level":11,"zh":{"title":"桥下留下的位置","text":"里德沿桥墩的检修梯爬上来，背上挂着一只瘪水壶。制服下摆全湿了，膝盖处新补的布却很干净；一把短锤用绳子系在腕上，免得掉下去。\n他每天检查桥面正中那块木板。今天，板下塞着一张牌，背面写了你的姓名，钉孔正好穿过最后一笔。\n“先别踩过去。”他从护栏后抽出折凳，“我想听听，你为什么从下面来。”\n你明明沿大路走到这里。里德没有争辩，只把牌铺在工具箱上。桥底响起你的脚步声，迟了一会儿，才停在两人正下方。"},"en":{"title":"The Place Beneath the Bridge","text":"Reed climbs the inspection ladder beside the pier with a dented flask on his back. His uniform hem is soaked. The new patches over its knees are clean. A short hammer is tied to his wrist so it cannot fall.\nHe checks the central bridge plank every day. Today a card was wedged beneath it. Your name is written on its back, a nail hole piercing the final stroke.\n“Not across yet.” He retrieves folding stools from behind the rail. “Tell me why you came from below.”\nYou reached the bridge by the main road. Reed does not argue. He spreads the cards on his toolbox. Your footsteps sound underneath, arriving late and stopping directly beneath you both."}},"苔庭缄骨客领誓·米珀":{"world":"mire","level":12,"zh":{"title":"提前挖好的土","text":"阿莫斯从墓地后门拖着铲子过来，铁刃包在干净的枕套里。他的颧骨高得撑不起帽檐，颈侧一道旧裂口里看不见血；说话前，总先把下巴轻轻托回去。\n他来找一个取消了的埋葬日期。挖开的空穴边，只有你的姓名和一串被雨冲淡的数字。\n“坑不能空太久。”他说，“人会以为我偷懒。”\n他把两只骨灰箱并到一起，仔细垫平，再请你坐。阿莫斯要你用牌讲清楚，这个名字到底该留下还是划掉。铲子还没有碰地，你鞋边的土已经松开了一圈。"},"en":{"title":"The Earth Dug Early","text":"Amos comes through the cemetery’s back gate dragging a shovel wrapped in a clean pillowcase. His cheekbones cannot support the brim of his cap. No blood shows in an old split along his neck. Before speaking, he gently lifts his jaw back into place.\nHe is looking for a canceled burial date. Beside the open grave are your name and rain-blurred numbers.\n“A hole cannot stay empty long. People start thinking I am lazy.”\nHe puts two ash boxes together, levels them carefully and asks you to sit. Over the cards, he wants you to establish whether this name should remain or be crossed out. Before his shovel touches the ground, the soil loosens around your shoes."}},"苔庭铠卫领誓·阿恩":{"world":"mire","level":13,"zh":{"title":"不肯落下的签名","text":"赛斯追着一张被风吹跑的表格，从镇公所台阶上下来。他头发剃得很短，衬衣扣到最上面，掌根留着长期握枪的旧茧。枪套空着，走路时他却一直护着那一侧。\n他受托给一份证词签名，证词里却写着自己昨夜开过枪。他记得没有。\n“你在场吗？”他问。你摇头，他反而松了一口气。\n赛斯把表格铺到长桌上，用牌压住四角。他请你陪他重排那晚的次序，等有一份说法能站住脚再签。笔还悬在空栏上，纸背已经透出他姓名的最后一笔。"},"en":{"title":"The Signature That Would Not Land","text":"Seth follows a windblown form down the municipal steps. His hair is cropped short. His shirt is buttoned to the throat. Old gun calluses mark his palm. His holster is empty, but he keeps that side protected as he walks.\nHe was asked to sign a statement saying he fired last night. He remembers refusing to fire.\n“Were you there?”\nYou shake your head. He seems relieved.\nSeth lays the form on a long table and weights its corners with cards. He asks you to reconstruct the night with him before he commits to an account. The pen remains above the blank field. Through the paper, the final stroke of his signature is already visible."}},"苔庭晶棘蜥龙领誓·艾恩":{"world":"mire","level":14,"zh":{"title":"天气记录之外","text":"气象站的门被一截长尾推开，冷雾先流进走廊。埃兹拉收起破损的翼膜，细长的龙头垂在门框下，鳞片间嵌着几枚旧铅字。它一路追着烧焦的气味，从镇外山脊来到这里。\n管理员留下的板上写着：无异常。那四个字旁边，是一只与你鞋底大小相同的空印。\n它用爪尖敲了敲“无异常”，要你坐下打一局，替那次无人承认的失温作证。\n雾龙将头低到检修台边，喉间缓缓翻出一叠沾灰的牌。它不许你碰火炉，却把温度计推到你面前。\n你坐下后，牌背浮出水珠。温度计一格也没降，你刚呼出的气，已经结在它鼻尖。"},"en":{"title":"Outside the Weather Record","text":"A long tail opens the weather-station door. Cold fog enters first. Ezra folds torn wing membranes against a narrow scaled body and lowers a long dragon’s head beneath the frame. Old pieces of printing type are caught between the scales. The smell of burning has drawn the creature from the ridge outside town.\nThe attendant’s board says: NOTHING UNUSUAL. Beside the words lies a blank print the size of your shoe.\nA claw taps NOTHING UNUSUAL. It wants a game to bear witness to the cold spell nobody admits happened.\nThe drake lowers its head to the maintenance bench and slowly produces ash-dusted cards. It keeps you away from the stove, pushing a thermometer toward your chair instead.\nWater beads on the card backs. The thermometer has not moved. Your last breath is freezing against its muzzle."}},"苔庭裂角客领誓·伊恩":{"world":"mire","level":15,"zh":{"title":"借来的脸","text":"科尔从照相馆的冲洗间出来，肩上披着别人尺寸的外衣。他的脸很普通，只有嘴角两边的灰痕始终不变；额发下面，一截弯角被磨平，露出潮湿的浅色纹理。\n他拿着一张取件单，说来找一张还没有换过的照片。柜台里的样片却全写着你的姓名。\n“别急着认。”他按住你伸出的手，“你认得越快，他们换得越勤。”\n科尔把一副牌倒在照相凳上，请你先帮他分清哪张属于谁。手指擦过时，一张卡面的脸散成灰，牌下的布面却留下刚才那个人的体温。"},"en":{"title":"A Borrowed Face","text":"Cole leaves the developing room in a coat made for somebody broader. His face is unremarkable except for permanent ash marks beside the mouth. A curved horn has been filed flat beneath his hair, exposing pale, damp grain.\nHe brings a collection slip. He is looking for a photograph that has not yet been exchanged. Every sample behind the counter bears your name.\n“Do not recognize them too quickly.” He stops your reaching hand. “The sooner you do, the more often they change.”\nHe empties a deck onto the portrait stool and asks you to sort out who belongs on each card. A face powders into ash beneath his finger. The cloth underneath retains the warmth of that person."}},"苔庭灯议长·图珀":{"world":"mire","level":16,"zh":{"title":"给迟到者留的信","text":"尼尔斯抱着一只旧邮袋，从邮局通往钟楼的后门进来。他瘦得大衣几乎贴在肩骨上，袖口熨得笔直，一枚火柴夹在耳后，始终没有划过。\n他等的人没有来，寄来的回执却已经签好了。尼尔斯把那一叠信往你面前推了推，最上面一封没有收件人，封口却印着与你拇指相同的纹路。\n“我只想知道该把它交给谁。”他拉开椅子，“说姓名没用。这里同名的人太多。”\n他选了几张牌压住信角，等你坐下。通往钟楼的门仍开着。你抬手挡灯，桌上的影子已经替你碰到了第一张牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Letter Kept for the Late Arrival","text":"Niles enters through the post office’s rear door, on the passage toward the bell tower. An old mailbag strains against his thin shoulders. His cuffs are sharply pressed. An unstruck match rests behind one ear.\nThe person he expects has not arrived. The return receipts have already been signed. He pushes the letters toward you. The uppermost envelope has no recipient, but its seal carries the pattern of your thumb.\n“I only want to know whom to give it to.” He pulls out a chair. “Names are useless here. Too many people share them.”\nHe weights the letters with selected cards. The bell-tower door stays open. You raise a hand against the lamp. Your shadow has already touched the first card."}},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·维拉":{"world":"brass","level":1,"zh":{"title":"手心里的松香","text":"录音室的女人替你推开侧门，楼梯上先落下一阵松香末。奥托提着断绳走下来，肩膀擦过门框，墙皮便留在了褪色的工装上。他太高，只能歪着头看你。\n“上面没钟。”你说。他摊开磨出厚茧的手：“工钱也没有，照样得来。”他从鞋跟里倒出一粒铜屑，窗外的摊贩同时捂住耳朵。\n奥托把绳子盘在桌脚，搬来两张矮凳。他要你陪他核一遍今日的报时牌；有人把停工的那一张抽走了。你坐下时，他轻轻扶住桌面，楼板下面却响了一声重锤。"},"en":{"title":"Rosin in the Palm","text":"The woman in the recording room opens a side door. Rosin dust falls down the stairs before Otto appears, carrying a broken rope. His shoulders scrape plaster from the frame onto faded overalls. He must tilt his head to look at you.\n“There is no bell upstairs.” He opens a callused hand. “No wages either. Still have to come.” He shakes a copper shaving from his boot. Outside, the traders cover their ears.\nOtto coils the rope around a table leg and brings two low stools. He wants another pair of eyes on the day's timing cards; somebody has removed the one marked CLOSED. As you sit, he steadies the tabletop with great care. A hammer strikes beneath the floor."}},"铜钟铠卫领誓·瑟翎":{"world":"brass","level":2,"zh":{"title":"换班的人","text":"走廊尽头的门开了三次，库尔特才从里面走出来。他穿一件熨直的深蓝短外套，脸上罩着薄铁面，鼻梁附近有一圈新磨出的亮痕。腰间钥匙一碰裤缝，墙上的影子便向前挪了一格。\n他拦住你，只看你手中的交接表。“接班的，还是顶班的？”你说来问路。铁面后传来一声很轻的叹气，像这个答案最麻烦。\n库尔特把值守桌转向走廊，在两侧排好卡牌。他不肯让没有座位记录的人通过；你得在这局里给自己找出一个空位。他抬手示意你坐，袖口里却先伸出一截没有手腕的影子。"},"en":{"title":"The Shift Change","text":"The door at the end of the corridor opens three times before Kurt steps through. His dark blue jacket is sharply pressed. A thin iron mask covers his face, newly polished around the nose. His keys tap his trousers; the shadow on the wall advances one square.\n“Taking the shift, or covering it?” he asks, examining your handover form. You say you need directions. A small sigh comes through the mask. Apparently that is the difficult answer.\nHe turns the duty table into the corridor and arranges cards on either side. Nobody passes without a recorded seat. You must find yours in a match. He gestures for you to sit. A length of shadow reaches from his cuff before his hand does."}},"铜钟峰脊巨灵领誓·岚拉":{"world":"brass","level":3,"zh":{"title":"空衣服的重量","text":"升降笼停在你身后，里面没有人。直到一件旧大衣从铁网里缓缓撑起，你才看见埃米尔。他的胸口宽得能挡住整扇门，衣领上方却只露出一张苍白的窄脸，脸与领子之间隔着一截黑。\n他扶着笼门走到检修桌旁，脚步很重，地板却没有凹下去。“帮我签个在场。”声音从你身侧传来，不在他嘴边。\n桌上已经铺好一副牌。埃米尔说，检修员只承认跟他打过牌的人能证明这里有人。你拉开椅子，椅背后的人形凹痕便慢慢坐直。他把对面的空大衣扣好，给你让出灯光。"},"en":{"title":"The Weight of an Empty Coat","text":"The lift cage stops behind you, empty. Then an old coat slowly fills out against the wire mesh. Emil's chest could block the whole doorway. A narrow pale face rises above his collar, separated from it by a strip of darkness.\nHe holds the cage door and crosses to the inspection table. His footsteps are heavy, but the floor does not bend. “Sign me present.” The voice comes from beside you, nowhere near his mouth.\nA deck is waiting. Emil says the inspector accepts only someone who has played with him as proof that this room is occupied. You pull out a chair. The human-shaped hollow behind its back slowly straightens. Across the table, he buttons the empty coat and moves aside to leave you the light."}},"铜钟灯议长·莱拉":{"world":"brass","level":4,"zh":{"title":"早饭记在账上","text":"你循着算盘珠的声音找到夹层。艾达坐在一堆账簿后面，衬衫袖口勒得很紧，指节上沾着红蓝两种墨。眼镜只剩一边镜片，另一只眼睛仍会跟着珠子移动。\n“地址可以查，先结旧账。”艾达递来一页早餐明细，最下面是你的姓名。你说没吃过，对方便把利息划掉：“那就少收一顿。”\n艾达从收据夹里抽出牌，把烛台移到两人中间。账房要你帮忙对清一笔找不到付款人的账，输赢是这间办公室还能认得的签字方式。你摸到第一张牌时，账簿上那笔钱已经变成了昨天。"},"en":{"title":"Breakfast on the Ledger","text":"The sound of abacus beads leads you to a mezzanine. Ada sits behind stacked ledgers, tight cuffs above knuckles stained with red and blue ink. Their spectacles have only one lens. The uncovered eye still follows every bead.\n“Addresses are available. Old accounts first.” They offer an itemized breakfast bill with your name at the bottom. You say you never ate it. They strike off the interest. “One meal less, then.”\nCards emerge from a receipt clip. Ada moves the candle between you. They need help balancing an account with no traceable payer; a match is the only signature this office still recognizes. As you touch the first card, the charge in the ledger quietly changes to yesterday."}},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·岑拉":{"world":"brass","level":5,"zh":{"title":"推车上的空席","text":"地下的斜坡很滑。你扶着栏杆往下，莫里斯推着一辆没有座位的小车迎上来。他的制服干缩在肋骨外面，嘴唇裂开，露出一直没有合拢的牙。手腕上绕着两圈发黄的吊牌绳。\n“让一让，下一位赶时间。”他朝空车点头，停下后却先给你掸掉凳上的灰。轮轴内卡着细小的白骨，每转一下，都像有人咬紧牙关。\n他从车底拉出折叠桌，说地下出口的交接记录少了一个见证人，要你陪他打一局，把最后那次交接重新过一遍。莫里斯把牌推到你面前，又给空车留了一侧。你没问那位客人要不要坐，他已经替对方敲了两下桌沿。"},"en":{"title":"The Empty Place on the Trolley","text":"The basement ramp is slick. You grip the rail as Morris pushes a seatless trolley toward you. His uniform has dried tight around visible ribs. Cracked lips leave his teeth exposed. Yellow label strings circle both wrists.\n“Make way. The next one's in a hurry.” He nods toward the empty trolley, then dusts a stool for you. Small pale bones catch in its axle. Each turn sounds like teeth clenching.\nHe pulls a folding table from beneath the chassis. The last handover at the basement exit is missing a witness. He asks you to play through it with him, one card at a time. He offers the deck and leaves one side free for the trolley. Before you ask about its passenger, Morris taps twice on the table for them."}},"铜钟环藤蛇领誓·伦拉":{"world":"brass","level":6,"zh":{"title":"药盒里的名字","text":"医务柜的下层传来玻璃相碰的声音。巴兹尔从倒下的量杯间游出来，鳞片是浸旧的黄铜色，腹下拖着一道湿痕，颈侧却扣着一枚小小的病号牌。\n它盘上桌脚，舌尖碰过每一只贴着人名的药瓶，最后停在写有你姓名的那一只。广播里，一个沙哑的声音替它问：“服药前，知道自己是谁吗？”\n你摇头，蛇便松开瓶子，把压在腹下的牌一张张推出。药柜门后画着两把椅子，其中一把始终没有腿。它不让你拿走瓶子；先完成这场核名的牌局。第一张牌翻开，柜内有人吞咽了一下。"},"en":{"title":"Names in the Medicine Box","text":"Glass knocks inside the medicine cabinet. Basil slips between fallen measuring cups, scales the color of soaked brass. A wet line follows its belly. A tiny patient tag is fastened beside its neck.\nIt coils around the desk leg and touches each named medicine bottle with its tongue. At the bottle bearing your name, it stops. A hoarse voice in the speaker asks for it, “Before taking it, do you know who you are?”\nYou shake your head. The snake releases the bottle and slides cards from beneath its body. Two chairs are drawn inside the cabinet door; one has no legs. Basil will not let you take the medicine before a match to establish the name. You turn the first card. Somebody swallows inside the cabinet."}},"铜钟裂角客领誓·佩拉":{"world":"brass","level":7,"zh":{"title":"炉边没有火","text":"楼层之间有间狭窄的休息室。拉尔斯刚从烟道里落下来，弯曲的角擦着铁皮，发出细长的响声。他穿着烧坏的厚围裙，半边脸带着细裂纹，袖口不断冒出白气。\n你以为他冷，把凳子往炉边挪。他却伸手挡住，指尖凉得使你缩了一下。“别坐那儿，我上回坐的地方还没找回来。”\n拉尔斯用干净的那一角围裙擦好桌面，取出几张熏黑的牌。他被派来查一份没有火源的火警，偏偏每份证词都要从这场牌局开始。你坐下，他先把炉门关紧。门里空空荡荡，敲门声却停了。"},"en":{"title":"Nothing in the Stove","text":"A narrow break room lies between floors. Lars drops from its flue, curved horns scraping a long note from the metal. Half his face is finely cracked. Steam rises from the cuffs of a scorched leather apron.\nThinking he is cold, you move a stool toward the stove. He catches it. His fingertips are cold enough to make you flinch. “Not there. Haven't found the last place I sat yet.”\nHe wipes the table with a clean corner of the apron and takes out smoke-blackened cards. He was sent to investigate a fire with no source. Every statement, however, insists on beginning with this match. When you sit, he closes the stove door. Nothing is inside. The knocking stops."}},"铜钟裂角客领誓·泽拉":{"world":"brass","level":8,"zh":{"title":"三处没有响过的钟","text":"费利克斯把一辆工具车从楼梯上倒着拖下来，最后一级落地时，他背后的两截短角同时抖了抖。细长的手指裹着胶布，工作服胸前有三道烧穿的小孔，口袋里全是没有声音的铜铃。\n“不是我拆的。”你还没问，他先说了，又把一个完整的螺帽拧成两半。他在找一段被人藏起来的响声，认定你刚刚听过。\n费利克斯把三张焦黑照片排在桌子中间，自己坐到工具箱上。他要跟你打牌，听你什么时候会吸气。你把手放上桌，中央那张照片立刻凹下去，另外两张却仍像被什么撑着。"},"en":{"title":"Three Bells That Never Rang","text":"Felix drags a tool cart backward down the stairs. At the final step, two short horns twitch above his collar. Tape wraps his long fingers. Three holes burn through his work shirt; his pockets are full of silent little bells.\n“I didn't take it apart.” You have asked nothing. He twists an intact nut into two pieces. He is looking for a hidden sound and insists you have just heard it.\nFelix lays three blackened photographs across the table and sits on his toolbox. He wants a card match so he can hear when you draw breath. As your hands reach the tabletop, the middle photograph sags. Something continues holding the other two in shape."}},"铜钟织光蛛领誓·阿温":{"world":"brass","level":9,"zh":{"title":"表盘后的针脚","text":"你推开储物间，头顶的空表壳忽然沉了一下。格蕾塔从里面垂下来，八条长腿细得像钟表弹簧，腹部覆着灰白绒毛，下面系着一个被针脚缝住的卵袋。\n它沿拉出的丝线抵达桌面，把一张破记录补在你刚按过的位置。字迹露出来，竟是在登记有谁碰过它的孩子。你松手，丝线没有跟着松。\n桌沿排着一圈卡牌，白线分别连向你与它的座位。窗边的旧喇叭轻响：“打完才能核数，别把椅子带走。”格蕾塔抬起前腿，替你拉近凳子。卵袋里响了几声，你没能数清，纸上的总数却已写好。"},"en":{"title":"Stitches Behind the Dial","text":"The empty clock casing overhead dips when you enter the storeroom. Greta descends from it, eight legs thin as watch springs. Grey fluff covers its abdomen. A stitched egg sac hangs beneath.\nFollowing a thread to the table, it repairs a torn record exactly where your hand rested. The revealed writing lists those who have touched its young. You lift your hand. The thread does not slacken.\nCards circle the table, white lines connecting them to your seat and hers. An old speaker crackles. “The count comes after the match. Leave the chair here.” Greta raises a foreleg and pulls your stool closer. Several sounds come from the sac. You cannot count them. The total is already written down."}},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·欧温":{"world":"brass","level":10,"zh":{"title":"醒着的缝口","text":"医务室的床空着，床下却有一只手伸出来，先替你扶住了快倒的水杯。伊万慢慢爬起，脸上没有睡过的痕迹，眼皮边缘的线头却和楼顶垂下的旧绳一样粗。\n他披好病号外套，把断开的腕骨压回袖子里。“医生说，闭眼就能歇会儿。医生已经走了三班。”他说完，笑得很勉强。\n伊万把病历反扣在桌上，从枕套里取出牌。他要你陪他打完一局，好让值班人证明他还醒着，免得又被送回床下。你在他对面坐稳，走廊里一架坏钟开始走动，他的针脚也随之收紧。"},"en":{"title":"The Waking Seam","text":"The infirmary bed is empty. A hand reaches from beneath it and catches your falling water glass. Ivan slowly crawls out. His face shows no trace of sleep. The threads beside his eyelids are as thick as the old rope upstairs.\nHe pulls on a hospital coat and presses a separated wrist bone into its sleeve. “Doctor said I could rest if I closed my eyes. Three doctors have gone off shift.” His smile takes effort.\nHe places his chart facedown and fetches cards from a pillowcase. A completed match will let the attendant certify that he is awake, instead of sending him beneath the bed again. As you settle opposite, a broken clock starts in the corridor. His stitches tighten with each tick."}},"铜钟铠卫领誓·乌温":{"world":"brass","level":11,"zh":{"title":"替别人守门","text":"你经过失物间时，鲍里斯正把一面盾从衣架上取下来。盾的背带钉满向内弯的小刺，他的旧制服却没有一个破口；反光面里，另一张脸跟着他迟了一拍。\n他挡住门，先问你找几个人。你说还不知道，他便点头：“那先别往里数。我就是从一个开始的。”他说话时，把盾面转向墙上的失踪照片。\n鲍里斯从空衣架下面搬出一张桌子，解释只有当班者输掉牌局，来访者才算接过这扇门的看守。他没有催你，只给你留了能看见出口的座位。盾里的那个人却已经坐下，把手伸向了你的牌。"},"en":{"title":"Holding Someone Else’s Door","text":"At the lost-property room, Boris lifts a shield from a coat stand. Small spikes bend inward along its straps. His old uniform has no tears. In the mirror surface, a second face follows him a beat late.\n“How many are you looking for?” You say you do not know. He nods. “Don't count inside yet. I started with one.” He turns the shield toward the missing-person photographs.\nBoris brings a table from beneath an empty stand. Only when the attendant loses a card match, he explains, can a visitor take over guarding this door. He leaves you the seat facing the exit and does not hurry you. The person in the shield has already sat down and is reaching for your cards."}},"铜钟缄骨客领誓·洛温":{"world":"brass","level":12,"zh":{"title":"空杯不够解渴","text":"饮水间的龙头没有接水管，莉娜却站在那里，耐心等一滴水从锈口落下。那人穿着过大的灰衬衫，颈侧的皮肤干得发白，笑时露出几枚形状不同的牙。\n你递来杯子，莉娜先闻了闻，没有接。“别浪费。它们只认袋子上的名字。”墙边的证物袋轻轻摆动，袋内有颗牙正敲着玻璃。\n莉娜把湿透的登记卡摊在桌上，让你用牌局证明杯子属于谁，随后才肯开通往上层的门。你拉开椅子，门上的玻璃映出一张空椅；你指间的第一张牌却有了体温。那人终于拿起杯子，仍没有喝。"},"en":{"title":"An Empty Cup Is Not Enough","text":"The drinking-room tap has no pipe. Lena waits beneath it for a drop to fall from the rusted mouth. An oversized grey shirt hangs over chalk-dry skin. Several differently shaped teeth show when they smile.\nYou offer a cup. Lena smells it without taking it. “Don't waste it. They recognize only the names on the bags.” Evidence bags stir against the wall. A tooth inside one taps on glass.\nLena spreads wet registration cards across a table. You must establish who owns the cup through a match before the upper door can be opened. You pull out your chair. The door glass reflects an empty seat. The first card between your fingers grows warm. At last, Lena takes the cup, but still does not drink."}},"铜钟枝灯树灵领誓·诺温":{"world":"brass","level":13,"zh":{"title":"从地板里长来","text":"地板先翘起一小块，随后露丝的根挤进接待室，绕开了所有还放着热杯子的地方。树干弯在门内，旧树皮上夹着碎瓷，一半根须乌黑，一半泛着浸水后的白。\n你往后退，枝条却用很轻的力道接住了将要倾倒的椅子。接待桌上的值班簿翻开，一行字慢慢透出来：来复查的，不是来栽种的。\n露丝把根伸进两把空椅之间，将牌分开推向两侧。你若想走过被根封住的楼梯，就得陪它辨认哪一份记录属于活人。你坐下，树干深处响了一声咳嗽。那声音说了句“劳驾”，旁边的钟没有跟着走。"},"en":{"title":"Arriving Through the Floor","text":"A board rises first. Ruth's roots enter the reception room, carefully avoiding every place that holds a hot cup. The trunk bends inside the door. Pottery fragments lodge in old bark; half the roots are black, half water-pale.\nYou step back. A branch gently catches a tipping chair. The attendance book opens on the desk. A line slowly appears: HERE FOR AN EXAMINATION, NOT FOR PLANTING.\nRuth reaches between two empty chairs and divides the cards. To pass the stairs blocked by its roots, you must help distinguish the living person's record through a match. You sit. A cough sounds from deep inside the trunk. The voice says, “Much obliged.” The nearby clock does not start."}},"铜钟铠卫领誓·佩温":{"world":"brass","level":14,"zh":{"title":"账单背面的声音","text":"维克托沿外墙的检修梯进来，鞋跟带着冷雨，扣得笔直的长外套只湿了左半边。他的手套一黑一褐，喉结旁有块被反复揭起的胶布，底下看不见伤口。\n他把催款单放到你面前，问你认不认识落款的人。那签名只有一半。你还没回答，他换了副嗓音，替你说了“不认识”。\n维克托在等一份能作废旧账的证词。办公室不收口头申辩，他便提议用牌桌留下双方都不能改的记录。你拉开椅子，他压住喉边的胶布，把两人的牌摆齐；每次指尖碰到纸，窗外的雨就停一瞬。"},"en":{"title":"The Voice Behind the Bill","text":"Victor arrives by the exterior service ladder, rain on his heels. Only the left half of his neatly buttoned coat is wet. His gloves do not match. Beside his throat, repeatedly lifted tape covers no visible wound.\nHe lays a collection notice before you and asks whether you know its signatory. Only half a signature remains. Before you answer, another voice comes from his mouth: “Never met them.”\nVictor is waiting for testimony that can void an old account. This office accepts no spoken appeals, so he proposes a match whose record neither of you can alter. When you sit, he presses down the tape and squares the two hands of cards. Each time a finger touches paper, the rain outside briefly stops."}},"铜钟铠卫领誓·泽温":{"world":"brass","level":15,"zh":{"title":"回答总要晚一点","text":"档案升降口升起时，索尔背朝你坐在窄凳上，手里削着一支短铅笔。他转过头，左眼蒙着洗得发硬的布带，右眼却始终看着你的鞋尖。领口有一小片从制服上拆下来的编号。\n“我只问一件事。”你说。他点头，把“没有”写在纸上，才问你要问什么。铅笔刨下的木屑在他膝头慢慢拼成另一种字。\n索尔把问询桌横在你们中间，表示先用一局牌决定谁最后回答，免得又有人替他把口供填完。你放下牌，才听到他对第一句话的回答：“请说。”那张写过字的纸已经自己翻到了背面。"},"en":{"title":"An Answer Arrives Late","text":"Saul rises in the archive lift, seated backward on a narrow stool and sharpening a short pencil. A stiffly washed bandage covers his left eye. The right stays on your shoes. A number has been unstitched from his collar.\n“I have one question.” He nods, writes NO, then asks what it is. Pencil shavings on his knees slowly arrange themselves into other letters.\nHe sets the interview table between you. A match will establish who answers last, he says, before someone else completes his statement for him again. You lay down your cards. Only then does he reply to your first sentence: “Go ahead.” The paper he wrote on has turned itself over."}},"铜钟铠卫领誓·阿雅":{"world":"brass","level":16,"zh":{"title":"报时人的戒指","text":"楼梯在此终止。西里尔从一扇没有门牌的矮门里出来，黑外套肩头覆着细霜，头发修得很短，耳后有一道旧表链勒出的白印。他提着空钟罩，里面悬着一枚戒指。\n“找出口的？”他问。你点头，他把戒指隔着玻璃对准你的手指，大小正好，却没有让你试戴。“失物还没到认领的时间。”\n西里尔把停着的怀表压在牌盒上，说只有最后一份问询结束，楼梯才肯承认楼下还有一层。他替你摆正椅子，自己坐在离门最远的地方。你揭开牌盒，钟罩内的霜立刻往回缩了一圈。他一直没有看表。"},"en":{"title":"The Timekeeper’s Ring","text":"The stairs end here. Cyril emerges through a low, unmarked door, frost on the shoulders of his black coat. His hair is closely cut. A watch chain has left an old white mark behind one ear. A ring hangs inside the empty glass bell he carries.\n“Looking for the exit?” He holds the ring against the glass beside your finger. It would fit. “Not time to claim lost property.”\nHe places a stopped pocket watch on the card box. Only the final interview, he says, will make the stairs acknowledge another floor below. He straightens your chair and takes the seat farthest from the door. When you lift the lid, frost retreats around the glass. He never checks the watch."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·乌弥":{"world":"cinder","level":1,"zh":{"title":"闸门外的脚步","text":"传送带停着，栏杆上的油却还没干。古斯从检修梯上下来，肩膀宽得挤住了门框。灰制服洗成浅白，后背一道道黑手印，全朝着领口拖。\n他先把你的鞋底刮干净，才肯让你靠近炉门。“里面新拖过地。”他说。你看见门缝里的灰有半指厚。\n腰间的钥匙拧不开锁。他听了一会儿门内的动静，把值班桌拖过来，在两人中间摊开牌。“名单不认脸，得再核一次。”他按住最靠门的那张，背后的手印也跟着向前挪了一寸。"},"en":{"title":"Boots Outside the Gate","text":"The conveyor is still. Oil on the rail has not dried. Gus climbs down the inspection ladder, shoulders catching in the doorway. His washed-out uniform is marked with black handprints, all dragging toward the collar.\nHe scrapes the mud from your soles before allowing you near the furnace. “Freshly mopped inside.” Half an inch of ash lies beneath the door.\nHis keys will not turn the lock. After listening to something behind it, he drags over the duty desk and spreads a deck between you. “The list doesn't recognize faces. We'll have to check again.” He pins down the card nearest the door. On his back, a handprint moves an inch toward his neck."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·依弥":{"world":"cinder","level":2,"zh":{"title":"还没喝完的人","text":"罗尔夫是从运煤车底下爬出来的。安全帽磕在车轴上，响得你牙根发酸；他自己没有揉头，只把帽檐上的水倒进酒瓶。\n这个高个子男人胡茬发黄，膝盖缝着厚皮。他站了两次才站稳，扶你的手却稳得能摸出衣料里的线头。“别担心，喝的是水。酒早停供了。”\n他把帽子翻过来，里面刻满人名，最浅的一行与你相同。他说得确认今晚是谁戴它，才肯继续往前走。几张牌从帽衬里滑出，落在旧饭桌上；他替你拉开椅子，顺脚把空瓶踢到桌腿后面。"},"en":{"title":"Someone Still Drinking","text":"Rolf crawls out from beneath a coal truck. His helmet strikes the axle with a sound that hurts your teeth. He does not rub his head, only drains the water from the brim into a bottle.\nHe is tall, with yellowed stubble and leather patches over both knees. It takes him two attempts to stand. The hand steadying you is precise enough to find a loose thread in your coat. “Water. Don't worry. They stopped supplying drink years ago.”\nNames cover the helmet lining. The newest is yours. Before he goes farther, he wants to establish who is wearing it tonight. Cards slip from the lining onto a mess table. He pulls out your chair and nudges the empty bottle behind its leg."}},"炽砂灯议长·诺弥":{"world":"cinder","level":3,"zh":{"title":"两副眼镜","text":"你在碎玻璃上停步，听见有人先替你说了声小心。伊诺克从排烟管后侧身走出，瘦脸上架着两副眼镜，一副镜腿用细铜丝接着。\n他蹲下捡起玻璃，每一片都绕开自己的倒影。“镜片贵，眼睛更贵。”说完，他把其中一副递给你，却没有松手。\n镜里是干净的车间，镜外满地煤灰。他想找个人判断，究竟哪边已经下班。你们在擦窗工的窄桌边坐下，他把牌排在一块完整玻璃上。第一张落稳后，桌下的倒影才缓缓坐到对面的椅子里。"},"en":{"title":"Two Pairs of Glasses","text":"You stop at the broken glass. Someone warns you before your foot comes down. Enoch edges out behind an exhaust pipe, two pairs of spectacles balanced on his narrow face. Copper wire repairs one arm.\nHe crouches to collect the fragments, avoiding his reflection in each. “Lenses cost money. Eyes cost more.” He offers you one pair without releasing it.\nThrough the glass, the workshop is clean. Outside it, coal dust covers the floor. He needs someone to decide which side has finished its shift. You sit at a window cleaner's narrow table. He lays the cards on an unbroken pane. Only after the first one settles does the reflection beneath it sit slowly in the opposite chair."}},"炽砂灯议长·瑟弥":{"world":"cinder","level":4,"zh":{"title":"药柜旁的空座","text":"医务室的门从里面推开，埃德温端着两只搪瓷盘出来。他戴一副磨白的圆眼镜，衬衫袖口卷得不齐，指甲剪得很短，掌心贴着一瓶热水。\n他握你的手，不先问哪里疼，只问最近一次吃饭是什么时候。你说记不清。他叹了口气，把药柜钥匙放回口袋：“最难开的，总是这种方子。”\n桌边三把椅子，只有一把坐垫带着体温。他把病例挪到一旁，抽出牌请你坐下；他要看看你会先替谁留下位置。牌背擦过桌面时，水池里浮起一张出院单，病人的签字还在慢慢延长。"},"en":{"title":"The Seats Beside the Medicine Cabinet","text":"Edwin pushes open the infirmary door with two enamel trays balanced in his hands. His round spectacles are worn pale. His sleeves are rolled unevenly; his nails are clipped short. A hot-water bottle rests against his palm.\nHe takes your hand and asks when you last ate. You cannot remember. Sighing, he pockets the medicine-cabinet key. “Always the difficult prescriptions.”\nThree chairs stand beside the desk. Only one cushion is warm. He moves the case notes aside and invites you to a game. He wants to see whose place you will save first. As the cards brush the table, a discharge slip rises in the washbasin. The patient's signature is still lengthening across the page."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·维弥":{"world":"cinder","level":5,"zh":{"title":"补上的夜班","text":"更衣柜里先响了一下，安东才从柜门后走出来。他穿两件工作服，外面那件扣子扣错了位，里面那件背上有个空白的工牌框。\n他给你掸了掸袖口的灰，问有没有看到同一班的人。你问是哪一班，他翻开口袋里一叠相同的考勤表，看了很久。“这得看哪张还肯认我。”\n午饭桌上留着一副牌。他说有人欠了一班，总得有人补上；这局打完，也许能分清谁该休息。他坐下时先摸了摸旁边的空椅子，把自己的旧工牌压在牌堆下面。照片里，他身边的人又少了一截肩膀。"},"en":{"title":"The Shift to Make Up","text":"A locker knocks once before Anton emerges from behind its door. He wears two sets of work clothes. The outer one is buttoned wrong; the inner one has an empty badge frame on its back.\nHe brushes ash from your cuff and asks whether you have seen anyone from his shift. Which shift? He studies a stack of identical attendance sheets. “Depends which one still admits I was there.”\nA deck waits on the lunch table. Someone owes a shift, he says. Someone has to make it up. After this game, perhaps you can establish who is allowed to rest. Before sitting, he feels the empty chair beside him and weighs down the deck with his old badge. Another portion of his photographed colleague's shoulder has gone."}},"炽砂缄骨客领誓·希弥":{"world":"cinder","level":6,"zh":{"title":"最外面的椅子","text":"托比亚斯从铸件筐里站起来，手里还托着一块颌骨。麻布围裙空荡荡地垂在肋骨前，露出的牙齿沾着一点白色石膏。\n他用刷子扫净椅面，再仔细拂过自己的膝头。刷毛穿过去，灰却没有落地。“坐中间。”他对你说，声音从围裙里面发出来，“边上冷。”\n三排长凳只剩最外两排的木头被抓烂。他把捡到的牌一张张从骨缝里抽出来，要你帮忙排清最后一班的座次。你落座后，他将那块颌骨放在桌沿，轻轻推向最远的一端，像在给一个不肯回来的人留饭。"},"en":{"title":"The Outside Chairs","text":"Tobias rises from a basket of castings with a piece of jawbone balanced in his hand. His sacking apron hangs loose before exposed ribs. White plaster clings to his teeth.\nHe brushes a chair clean, then carefully sweeps his own knees. The bristles pass through. No dust reaches the floor. “Middle seat,” says a voice from inside the apron. “Edges are cold.”\nOnly the outside rows of the three benches have been clawed apart. He draws recovered cards from between his bones, one at a time. He needs help arranging the last shift's seating. When you sit, he places the jawbone on the table and pushes it toward the far end, as though saving supper for someone refusing to come back."}},"炽砂灯议长·米弥":{"world":"cinder","level":7,"zh":{"title":"红灯下的手指","text":"暗房的布帘动了，伊妮德端着显影盘退出来，先把门让给了一个没有跟上来的影子。发梢湿得贴住额头，黑围裙上满是浅白的指印。\n对方递来干布，自己却拿袖口擦镜片。药水的醋味很重，晾绳上的照片全背朝外。“拍得不好？”你问。那人笑了笑：“里面的人还没同意。”\n一张合影里空出两个座位。伊妮德把照片扣在桌上，拿出纸牌，说需要一份新的目击记录。你们相对坐下，红灯照着你洗不净的指缝；那根一直空着的晾绳，轻轻向下沉了一点。"},"en":{"title":"Fingers Under the Red Lamp","text":"The darkroom curtain stirs. Enid backs through it carrying a developing tray, holding the doorway for a shadow that does not follow. Wet hair clings to their forehead. Pale fingerprints cover a black apron.\nThey offer you a dry cloth but clean their spectacles on a sleeve. Vinegar rises from the trays. Every photograph faces the wall. Bad pictures? Enid smiles. “The people in them haven't agreed yet.”\nTwo seats are empty in a group photograph. Enid turns it facedown and brings out a deck, asking for a fresh witness record. You sit opposite each other. The red lamp reveals the dirt between your fingers. An unused line above the table sags a fraction lower, as though something has just been hung there."}},"炽砂峰脊巨灵领誓·索弥":{"world":"cinder","level":8,"zh":{"title":"不肯放下的重量","text":"锅炉吊架发出轻响，霍勒斯从它下面缓缓直起身。这个巨人几乎碰到天花板，肩上垫着折过四层的旧毯，毯子里陷着一段冷炉壳。\n他先把地上的饭盒踢到你面前，示意你坐远些。炉壳边缘一直在渗水，滴到他后颈时，他只轻轻缩一下肩。“撑不了多久？”你问。“饭倒是凉得挺快。”\n他想知道，当年的承重记录是谁签的。记录夹里夹着牌，他用两根粗大的指头把它们放上矮桌。你替他扶稳桌脚，他便低下头，等你先看那张写着一切正常的检查单。"},"en":{"title":"The Weight He Won’t Put Down","text":"The boiler gantry gives a small creak. Horace slowly straightens beneath it. The giant almost reaches the ceiling. A blanket folded four times cushions his shoulders beneath a section of cold furnace casing.\nHe nudges a lunch tin toward you and gestures for you to sit clear. Water leaks from the casing onto his neck. He only tightens one shoulder. You ask how long he can hold it. “Long enough for lunch to go cold.”\nHe wants to know who signed the old load inspection. Cards are clipped inside its folder. With two thick fingers, he places them on a low table. You steady its leg. He bends his head, waiting for you to read the sheet declaring that everything is normal."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莱弥":{"world":"cinder","level":9,"zh":{"title":"图上的那条路","text":"罗兰沿消防通道跑来，停下后却没有喘气。防烟外套的下摆烧出细孔，面罩内侧凝着水珠；他抬手擦了一下，水就顺着手套流向袖口。\n他把车间图铺在应急照明箱上，请你指出哪里安全。你还没碰纸，图上一点红痕已经朝你的指尖移过来。他把手压住，语气仍很客气：“慢慢看，逃生不差这一下。”\n地图背面是一张用烟熏黑的牌桌。他从口袋取出牌，要你替那晚没有走完的人选一条路。你拉来工具凳时，他始终站在通道外侧，像怕自己一让开，后面就有人追上。"},"en":{"title":"The Route on the Plan","text":"Roland runs down the fire passage and stops without breathing hard. Pinholes burn through the hem of his smoke coat. Water beads inside his visor; when he wipes it, the drops run up his glove into the cuff.\nHe spreads a workshop plan over an emergency-light box and asks where you would be safe. Before you touch it, a red mark moves toward your finger. He pins it down, still polite. “Take your time. Escaping can wait a moment.”\nThe reverse is marked out as a card table, blackened with smoke. He brings out a deck and asks you to choose a route for those who never completed theirs. As you pull over a tool stool, he stays on the passage's outside edge, afraid of what might follow if he moves."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·莫弥":{"world":"cinder","level":10,"zh":{"title":"面罩里面的亮光","text":"埃德加从炉门侧边的窄道挤出来，手里拖着一卷封条。厚皮外套没有烧痕，面罩里却横着一道发白的分叉，靠近时能听见干燥的噼啪声。\n他不让你帮忙，只请你把绝缘垫铺平。封条每贴好一道，他就摸一遍自己的脉搏。“修好了？”你问。他朝面罩里面看了看：“得看是哪边坏。”\n他把剩下的封条压住桌角，拿出一副边缘有焦点的牌。电工留下的报告缺一位在场人，他希望你坐在这里，替自己看完那次试验。你刚碰到牌背，灯丝亮了一瞬，炉门外的电缆却仍断着。"},"en":{"title":"Light Inside the Visor","text":"Edgar squeezes through the passage beside the furnace, dragging a roll of sealing tape. His heavy leather coat is unscorched. A white branching mark crosses the inside of his visor. Up close, it crackles dryly.\nHe refuses help, asking only that you flatten the insulating mat. After each seal, he checks his pulse. Fixed? He peers into the visor. “Depends which side is broken.”\nHe weighs down a table corner with the remaining tape and produces a deck flecked with burns. The electrician's report lacks one witness. He wants you to sit through the test and watch what he cannot. As you touch the first card, a filament flashes. Outside the furnace, the power cable remains cut."}},"炽砂灯议长·伦弥":{"world":"cinder","level":11,"zh":{"title":"留着的那一份","text":"销毁室里先伸出一只手，菲伊才抱着一摞纸从门后出现。窄肩沾满灰，短发被帽子压得贴住头皮；手腕缠着一圈从文件袋上拆下来的红绳。\n对方从你脚边捡起一页，吹掉灰，又吹了一次。“烧掉多省事。”你说。那人把纸贴近灯，纸上有道浅浅的伤口：“那也得有人签收。”\n桌上的牌是从废纸间挑出来的，边缘缺了很薄的一层。菲伊想替未领走的那份找到归处，请你坐下辨认。你伸手整牌，红绳忽然绷紧；纸堆后面，有一只同样缠着绳子的手，慢半拍收了回去。"},"en":{"title":"The Copy Kept Back","text":"A hand emerges from the disposal room before Faye appears behind it, carrying a stack of papers. Ash covers their narrow shoulders. A cap flattens their short hair. Red string salvaged from a document bag circles one wrist.\nThey retrieve a sheet beside your foot, blow away the ash, then blow again. Burning it would be easier, you suggest. Faye holds the page to the lamp. A shallow wound marks it. “Someone would still have to sign for it.”\nThe cards on the desk have been picked from wastepaper, their edges missing a thin layer. Faye needs a destination for the copy nobody collected. As you straighten the deck, the red string tightens. Behind the papers, another bound hand withdraws half a beat late."}},"炽砂灯议长·图弥":{"world":"cinder","level":12,"zh":{"title":"不沾灰的外套","text":"高压线旁有人朝你招手。薇拉踩过满地煤灰，鞋尖仍干净，旧长外套像刚从衣柜拿出来，只有胸前的工牌被风吹得不停翻面。\n那人摘下工牌，背面的人像正看着纸外。“照片不好看？”你问。对方摸了摸自己的脸：“它倒觉得这边太挤。”\n薇拉从一只空火盆里取出牌，挑掉夹在里面的碎纸，摆到电缆卷盘上。原本该销毁的记录已经找不到正面，需要你帮忙确认谁还留在这一边。你坐到卷盘对面，外套的影子却没有跟着落地，而是慢慢贴上头顶那根停电的线。"},"en":{"title":"The Coat Without Ash","text":"Someone beckons beside the high-voltage wires. Vera crosses the coal dust without dirtying their shoes. The long coat looks freshly taken from a wardrobe. Only the badge keeps turning in the wind.\nThey unpin it. The face printed on the back looks outward through the paper. An unflattering picture? Vera feels their own cheek. “It thinks this side is crowded.”\nA deck comes out of an empty brazier. Vera removes the scraps caught between its cards and lays it on a cable drum. The records meant for burning have lost their fronts. They need you to establish who remains on this side. When you sit opposite, the coat's shadow does not fall to the floor. It climbs slowly onto the dead wire overhead."}},"炽砂铠卫领誓·芮弥":{"world":"cinder","level":13,"zh":{"title":"又换了一件工具","text":"领料窗口开着一条缝，马丁侧身钻出来，动作熟得像每天都这么下班。他一边袖子短了半寸，露出的手腕上有四圈颜色不同的勒痕。\n他拿着扳手走到你面前，又回去换成钳子，接着是撬棒。最后他笑了，把空手摊给你：“今天总该不用借东西了。”\n四张领料单在桌上缺着不同的角，叠起来恰好露出一扇小门。他把牌放在门形的空处，说不是找你讨债，只想知道自己哪一班能真正离开。你拉过椅子，他却先看了一眼你的手，等你决定第一张牌怎么拿。"},"en":{"title":"Another Tool Changed","text":"The stores hatch stands slightly open. Martin slips through it as though this is how he leaves every day. One sleeve is half an inch short. Four differently colored pressure marks ring the exposed wrist.\nHe approaches with a wrench, returns to exchange it for pliers, then tries a pry bar. At last he spreads empty hands and smiles. “Perhaps I won't have to borrow anything today.”\nFour requisition slips lie on the desk, each missing a different corner. Together, their gaps form a small door. He places the deck inside its outline. He is not collecting a debt, he says. He wants to know which shift will finally let him leave. As you pull over a chair, he watches how you take the first card."}},"炽砂灯议长·伊罗":{"world":"cinder","level":14,"zh":{"title":"没人接的电话","text":"电话铃从空办公室里追出来，迈尔斯抱着交换台坐到走廊。他脸很白，耳后一块皮肤被听筒磨得发亮，衬衫口袋装着三支同样长的铅笔。\n他拔掉电线，铃声反而近了一些。“接错过？”你问。他点点头，把一张写满地址的纸对折：“对面也觉得是我打错了。”\n交换台下面夹着一副牌。他说需要有人帮忙判断，下一句话该留给谁，便把两把椅子对在通道中间。你坐下时，他按住其中一盏亮着的指示灯。听筒里传来拉椅子的声音，接着，一个很轻的呼吸，也等着你落牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Unanswered Line","text":"The telephone rings out of an empty office. Miles carries the switchboard into the corridor and sits beneath it. His face is pale. The receiver has polished a patch behind his ear. Three pencils of equal length fill his shirt pocket.\nHe disconnects the cable. The ringing moves closer. A wrong connection? He nods and folds a sheet of addresses. “They think I'm the one who called the wrong place.”\nA deck is wedged under the board. He needs help deciding who should receive the next sentence. He sets two chairs across the passage. As you sit, he holds down a glowing indicator. In the receiver, another chair scrapes. A quiet breath follows, waiting for your first card."}},"炽砂晶棘蜥龙领誓·雅罗":{"world":"cinder","level":15,"zh":{"title":"平面图装不下的东西","text":"你以为锅炉外壁裂开了，直到那道裂口缓缓张开，露出一只覆着铁锈色鳞片的眼睛。雷克斯盘在烟道后面，角擦着横梁，呼吸把炉灰吹成几条细线。\n一张旧检查单钉在它额前的鳞缝里。你伸手帮它摘下，它便把头压低，低得让地板跟着发出呻吟。单子上量好的长度，连它一根趾爪都容不下。\n它将烧黑的牌盒推到你脚边，用爪尖在清灰台上划出两个位置。烟里响起一句低哑的人声：“替我看看，哪边才算外面。”你坐下后，它先收住了那口一直不肯吐完的气。"},"en":{"title":"What the Plan Cannot Hold","text":"You think the boiler wall has split. Then the split opens, revealing an eye armored with rust-colored scales. Rex coils behind the flue. Its horns scrape the beam; each breath combs the ash into thin lines.\nAn inspection sheet is caught between the scales above its eye. As you reach to free it, the drake lowers its head until the floor groans. The recorded measurements would not contain a single claw.\nIt nudges a blackened card box toward your foot and scratches two places onto the ash-clearing bench. A hoarse human voice moves through the smoke. “Tell me which side counts as outside.” You sit. Before the first card, it holds back the breath it has never quite finished releasing."}},"炽砂灯议长·诺罗":{"world":"cinder","level":16,"zh":{"title":"没有结清的那一页","text":"多里安在停工公告下面等你，身旁是一把拆开的旧灯。这个瘦男人穿着褪色的办公室外套，袖口补得很仔细，指尖却黑得连掌纹都看不清。\n他用鞋把一张工资条推到桌下，才让出椅子。你问他为什么不直接去领钱。他看了看空荡荡的发薪窗口：“他们说我还差一天。我一直没敢请假。”\n那副牌压在二十七年前的停产通知上。他想知道该在哪一笔下面签字，才能把今晚交出去。你们坐定，他把旧灯转向你；灯里的修补刻痕与你的笔势相同，日期却比你出生还早。"},"en":{"title":"The Page Still Unsettled","text":"Dorian waits beneath the closure notice beside a dismantled lamp. He is thin, wearing a faded office coat with carefully mended cuffs. His fingertips are so black that their creases have disappeared.\nHe pushes a pay slip under the desk with his shoe before offering you a chair. Why not simply collect the money? He looks at the empty pay window. “They say I owe one more day. I've been afraid to ask for leave.”\nThe deck weighs down a closure notice dated twenty-seven years ago. He wants to know which line he must sign to hand over tonight. Once you are seated, he turns the old lamp toward you. The repaired groove inside follows your handwriting. Its date is older than your birth."}},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·莱尘":{"world":"tide","level":1,"zh":{"title":"逆着水来的鹿","text":"码头下的水正往东走，米洛却从相反的方向踏上台阶。它是一头瘦鹿，肩背沾着黑藻，鹿角上的渔线吊着几根针，走动时轻轻碰响。\n你挪开挡路的木箱。它没有过去，只低头舔了舔肋间的旧伤；那块皮毛干燥得发白，周围却在滴水。\n石墩上放着一副牌，旁边压着张褪色的修船收据。米洛把鼻端贴在收据上，慢慢推向你，又用前蹄按住了船名。\n你伸手去翻纸，它立即竖起耳朵。等你收回手、坐到石墩对面，它才松开蹄子，把第一张牌推过来。"},"en":{"title":"The Deer Against the Water","text":"Water runs east beneath the quay. Milo climbs the steps against it. The lean deer has black weed across its shoulders. Needles suspended from fishing line click against its antlers.\nYou move a crate aside. It stays where it is and licks an old wound between its ribs. The surrounding fur drips. The wound itself is dry and pale.\nA deck rests on a stone mooring block beside a faded boat-repair receipt. Milo noses the paper toward you, then covers the vessel’s name with a hoof.\nWhen you reach to turn it over, its ears rise. You withdraw your hand and sit opposite. Only then does Milo release the paper and slide you a card."}},"暮潮灯议长·岑尘":{"world":"tide","level":2,"zh":{"title":"没有声音的鸣笛","text":"裘德从售票亭后面钻出来，手里攥着一只铜哨。他穿着过大的条纹西装，领带塞进衬衣里，鼻下有一条擦得很匆忙的血痕。\n他吹了一声。你只看见两颊瘪下去，远处的一排空船却同时松开了缆绳。\n“别看船，看我。”他说，拿袖口抹了抹鼻子，“我今天还没输过。除了这件衣服。”\n他借来两只鱼筐，翻一块舱板当桌，把牌洗得干净利落。你问他堵住通道做什么，他指向你夹着的港务簿：“那上面有我的欠账。先打一局，再谈谁欠谁。”"},"en":{"title":"A Whistle Without Sound","text":"Jude emerges behind the ticket booth clutching a brass whistle. His striped suit is too large. His tie is tucked inside his shirt, and blood has been hastily wiped from beneath his nose.\nHe blows. You hear nothing. Across the water, a row of empty boats slips its moorings.\n“Watch me, not them.” He wipes his nose on his sleeve. “Haven’t lost today. Apart from the suit.”\nHe borrows two fish crates, lays a hatch cover across them and shuffles with practiced hands. You ask why he has blocked the passage. He points at your harbor ledger.\n“My debts are in there. A hand first. Then we can decide who owes whom.”"}},"暮潮裂角客领誓·莫尘":{"world":"tide","level":3,"zh":{"title":"衣领里的盐","text":"诊所的侧门被人从里面顶开。卢卡侧着肩挤出来，外套已经硬成一块，颈侧几道裂口里嵌着细密的白牙。\n他在水桶边搓手。盐壳脱落，露出的皮肤还没干，衣料便重新渗出水来。桶里漂着一张盖好章的检验单。\n“医生今天不见人。”他说，把桶盖扣上，“尤其不见已经付过钱的。”\n你要借路，他却从硬领口里抽出一叠干燥的牌，摆在诊所的折叠桌上。检验单的号码正好藏在牌下。他请你坐，指头始终压着那一角，像在等你先认出来。"},"en":{"title":"Salt in the Collar","text":"Someone forces the clinic’s side door outward. Luca squeezes through sideways. His coat has stiffened into a shell. Fine white teeth fill several cracks along his neck.\nHe rubs his hands over a bucket. Salt flakes away. Before the exposed skin dries, his sleeves begin leaking again. A stamped test sheet floats in the water.\n“The doctor isn’t seeing anyone. Especially people who have paid already.” He covers the bucket.\nYou ask to pass. Instead, Luca takes a dry deck from his rigid collar and lays it across the clinic’s folding table. The cards conceal the test number. He offers you a seat, keeping a finger on that corner as though waiting for you to recognize it."}},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·伦尘":{"world":"tide","level":4,"zh":{"title":"救援名单","text":"涨水把一头鹿送到台阶下面。奥林的腹部鼓胀，皮毛贴着身上的绳印；有人给它挂过救生圈，橡胶已经磨进了颈侧。\n它站起时，四只蹄子周围的水忽然退开，露出几张粘在泥里的救援名单。你弯腰去捡，鹿角先一步压住了纸。\n旁边的救生箱敞着，里面没有绷带，只有两副相同的牌。奥林衔出一副，放到空箱盖上，又把箱盖推向你。\n你在名单边看见一道划掉的编号。它用鼻子遮住那一行，等你坐下来，才把自己的牌翻到背面。"},"en":{"title":"The Rescue List","text":"The rising water delivers a deer to the steps. Orin’s belly is swollen. Rope marks press through its flattened coat. A life ring once hung around its neck; rubber has worn into the skin.\nWhen it stands, water withdraws from its four hooves, exposing rescue lists pasted into the mud. You bend to retrieve one. Its antlers reach the paper first.\nThe open first-aid chest contains no bandages, only two identical decks. Orin lifts one in its mouth and sets it on the lid, then nudges the lid toward you.\nA number has been crossed off the list. The deer covers that line with its nose. Once you sit, it turns its own cards face down."}},"暮潮灯议长·佩尘":{"world":"tide","level":5,"zh":{"title":"船长的矮桌","text":"一声咳嗽从搁浅的小艇上传来。哈兰扶着舷梯下来，右脚落地比左脚慢半拍，晾在肩上的船长帽还在掉盐。\n他把帽子拍干净，端端正正戴好，才招呼你进艇舱。矮桌的两条腿用旧锚链绑着，铅笔拴在桌边，短得只剩两根指头能捏。\n“地图只画到这儿。”他指着一处被擦破的纸，“后面的得有人陪我看。”\n你问船还能不能开。哈兰没回答，先替你垫稳了椅子，然后铺牌。桌下传来沉重的拖曳声，锚链绷紧了；他把脚踩在上面，继续等你切牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Captain’s Low Table","text":"A cough comes from a stranded boat. Harlan descends its ladder, his right foot following half a beat late. Salt falls from the captain’s cap drying on his shoulder.\nHe beats it clean and puts it squarely on before inviting you below. Old anchor chain binds two legs of the low table. A pencil tied to its edge is barely long enough for two fingers.\n“The map ends here.” He touches a place rubbed through the paper. “Need company to look beyond it.”\nYou ask whether the boat can still move. He steadies your chair instead and deals. Something heavy drags beneath the table. The chain tightens. Harlan pins it with his boot and waits for you to cut."}},"暮潮潜印客领誓·泽尘":{"world":"tide","level":6,"zh":{"title":"另一盘带子","text":"尼科从检票队伍里退出来，背上贴着一张没有被撕走的旧船票。他戴着指尖剪开的皮手套，笑时上唇不动。\n他把你带到堆放空录音盒的小棚，拉开椅子。桌上的一盘磁带颜色发青，末端还连着一截带鳞片的薄皮。\n“换带子还是换口供？”你问。\n“先换个坐姿。你挡住出口了。”他侧身让你看门，自己却始终坐在没有门的那一边。\n你要核对盒上的编号，他把一张牌压在号码上。再挪开时，号码已经不同。尼科两手摊平，示意你选一副他还没碰过的牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Other Tape","text":"Nico backs out of the ticket queue with an old passage stub still stuck to his coat. His leather gloves have their fingertips cut away. His upper lip never moves when he smiles.\nHe takes you to a shed of empty recording boxes. A greenish tape on the table ends in a strip of translucent, scaled skin.\n“Changing tapes or statements?” you ask.\n“Your seat first. You’re blocking the exit.” He shows you the door but remains against the windowless wall.\nYou reach to check a box number. He covers it with a card. When he lifts the card, the number has changed. Nico spreads both hands and lets you choose a deck he has not touched."}},"暮潮织光蛛领誓·图尘":{"world":"tide","level":7,"zh":{"title":"八只手的针线","text":"你沿缆绳走到仓库外，先看见一枚比拳头大的顶针。玛塔倒挂在梁下，腹部的细毛沾满盐粒，八条长腿把救生圈转得很慢。\n圈内裹着一团人形的茧。你伸手去碰，一根蛛丝落在腕上，力道像有人轻轻拦了一下。\n梁下吊着一块平板，四角的丝线刚好够把它拉成桌子。玛塔用前足铺开牌，一张张抹平潮起的边。\n茧里传来一个很客气的声音：“让她做完这点活。”你问还要多久，蛛足便敲了敲空座位。你坐下后，那枚顶针才停止摇晃。"},"en":{"title":"The Sewing Left to Finish","text":"Following a mooring rope to the warehouse, you find a thimble larger than your fist. Marta hangs beneath a beam. Salt grains cling to the fine hair of its abdomen. Eight long legs slowly rotate a life ring.\nA human-shaped cocoon fills the ring. When you reach toward it, a strand settles on your wrist with the gentleness of a restraining hand.\nFour threads suspend a flat board below the beam. Marta tensions them into a table and smooths a deck across it, pressing down the damp corners.\nA courteous voice comes from the cocoon. “Let her finish.” You ask how long. One foreleg taps the empty seat. When you sit, the thimble stops swinging."}},"暮潮缄骨客领誓·阿汀":{"world":"tide","level":8,"zh":{"title":"自己上岸的人","text":"排水口的铁盖抬起来，康拉德先递出一顶帽子，再把自己撑上岸。他的皮肤灰得发亮，领口灌着细沙，左耳边垂下一截缝合线。\n他把帽子拧干，放在打捞站的长桌上，按顺序摆开几张空白的死因记录。每摆一张，就停下来听听水底。\n“你在等谁？”\n“等一个肯亲自签字的。”他把笔推给你，指头冷得没有在桌上留下水汽。\n你不肯替陌生人签名。康拉德看了一会儿，把表格收进袖口，换成纸牌。“那就从你会的开始。”他给对面的椅子擦去一层新鲜的泥。"},"en":{"title":"The One Who Came Ashore","text":"A drain cover rises. Conrad passes up his hat before hauling himself ashore. His gray skin shines. Fine sand fills his collar, and a length of stitching hangs beside his left ear.\nHe wrings out the hat on the salvage-station table and arranges blank cause-of-death forms. After each sheet, he pauses to listen below.\n“Who are you waiting for?”\n“Someone willing to sign in person.” He offers the pen. His fingers are too cold to leave condensation on the wood.\nYou refuse to sign for a stranger. Conrad studies you, pockets the forms and produces cards.\n“Start with something you know, then.” He wipes fresh mud from the opposite chair."}},"暮潮灯议长·艾汀":{"world":"tide","level":9,"zh":{"title":"灯罩后面","text":"伊莱从航灯的玻璃后抬起头，眉毛上落着细细的铜屑。他的袖口磨得发白，手背横着一道旧烫伤，伤痕旁还夹着半根没拔出的线头。\n他把螺丝收进烟盒，拿干布擦出桌上的两块空地方。水下先亮了一次，灯芯却还躺在他掌心。\n“别急着看信。”他说，“先让我看看，你会把哪张留到最后。”\n你问这和灯号有什么关系。伊莱把信封翻过来，遮住落款，自己在背风处坐下。他洗牌时只用完好的那只手，受伤的手一直护着你这边快要被吹灭的小灯。"},"en":{"title":"Behind the Lamp Glass","text":"Eli looks up from behind the navigation lamp, fine brass filings caught in his eyebrows. His cuffs have worn white. An old burn crosses one hand; a thread is trapped beside its scar.\nHe stores the screws in a tobacco tin and clears two places with a dry cloth. A light flashes beneath the water. The unlit wick still lies in his palm.\n“Leave the letter. First, show me which card you save until last.”\nYou ask what that has to do with signals. Eli turns the envelope over, hiding its signature, and sits out of the wind. He shuffles with his sound hand. The injured one shelters the small lamp beside you."}},"暮潮浮辉使领誓·塔尘":{"world":"tide","level":10,"zh":{"title":"湿鞋边的声音","text":"渡口的雾往两边分开，泰丝从中走来。长外套贴着一副过分单薄的身体，衣摆下面没有脚印，只有两道平行的水线。\n你问路，回答却从自己鞋边传上来。泰丝的嘴唇一直合着，喉咙里有水轻轻碰响。\n一张旧桌子被雾推到栏杆旁。桌布的四角都绣着同一个缩写，唯独泰丝坐下的那一角被剪掉了。\n“这里说话太费力。”鞋边的声音说，“换种办法，让我听听你。”\n它把牌推过来。你拉开椅子，水线也停下了；直到你把手放上桌，雾里才传来那把椅子的响声。"},"en":{"title":"A Voice Beside Your Shoes","text":"The ferry fog parts around Tess. A long coat clings to an unnaturally thin shape. No footprints follow its hem, only two parallel lines of water.\nYou ask for directions. The reply rises beside your shoes. Tess keeps its lips closed. Water taps softly inside its throat.\nFog pushes an old table against the rail. The cloth carries the same initials at three corners. The fourth, where Tess sits, has been cut away.\n“Speaking costs too much here,” says the voice at your feet. “Let me hear you another way.”\nIt offers the deck. The water lines stop when you draw out your chair. Only after your hands reach the table does the chair scrape inside the fog."}},"暮潮灯议长·乌汀":{"world":"tide","level":11,"zh":{"title":"另一侧的座位","text":"达蒙夹着两把折椅从客船下来，腕上系着一条褪色的乘务袖带。他脸颊被风吹裂了，黑色短发朝同一边压着，像睡了很久才起来。\n他把一把椅子摆到你左边，想了想，又换到右边，拿袖子擦去椅背上的水。\n“你习惯坐哪边？”\n你说都行。他却皱起眉，把一张印满座号的纸翻来覆去看。纸上有个位置刚被人用牙咬掉。\n他把牌放到两把椅子中间的行李箱上。“打一会儿。我得确定换过去的，还是原来那个人。”他说完，先检查了一遍自己外套上的名牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Seat on the Other Side","text":"Damon comes down the passenger ramp carrying two folding chairs. A faded steward’s band circles his wrist. Wind has split his cheeks. His black hair lies flat on one side, as though he has slept on it for years.\nHe places your chair to the left, then moves it right and wipes the back dry.\n“Which side do you usually take?”\nYou say either. Frowning, he studies a seating chart. Someone has bitten a position out of the paper.\nHe lays cards on a suitcase between the chairs.\n“Play awhile. I need to know whether the person who moves is still the one who started.” Then he checks his own name badge."}},"暮潮折面星客领誓·依汀":{"world":"tide","level":12,"zh":{"title":"验水瓶","text":"诊疗棚里没有人应门，帘子却自己抬起。埃丝梅伏在一张宽椅上，折叠的灰白皮肤一层层收拢，中间露着一只湿润的大眼睛。\n桌边的橡胶手套被撑得很满，指头却都朝外弯。它把一只验水瓶推到你手边，瓶里的水面浮着一枚完整的指纹。\n“没碰过海水的人，我记不住。”声音从椅背后传来。\n你擦了擦手，没有去碰瓶子。那只眼睛慢慢缩小，视线落到口袋里露出的牌角。\n埃丝梅挪开瓶子，给你留出一块干燥的桌面。牌摆好以后，玻璃上的指纹也跟着换了位置。"},"en":{"title":"The Water Sample","text":"Nobody answers at the examination tent. Its curtain lifts anyway. Esme rests in a broad chair, folds of gray-white skin contracting around one large, wet eye.\nRubber gloves on the table seem full, but all their fingers bend outward. One slides a sample bottle toward you. A complete fingerprint floats on its water.\n“I cannot remember anyone who has not touched the sea,” says a voice behind the chair.\nYou wipe your hands and leave the bottle alone. The eye narrows, fixing on the corner of your deck above your pocket.\nEsme moves the bottle aside and clears a dry space. As you lay out the cards, the fingerprint changes position on the glass."}},"暮潮踏铃驹领誓·雅汀":{"world":"tide","level":13,"zh":{"title":"没上岸的马","text":"你在缆桥尽头等了很久，贾尔斯才从水下的台阶走上来。它是一匹高大的灰马，鬃毛结成粗辫，鞍边挂着两块互相敲击的许可牌。\n前蹄到了干木板上，它就停住，后蹄仍站在水里。你伸手去牵，它把头偏开，鼻息带着温热的铁味。\n马鞍下面夹着两份相反的航线，纸角各压着一张牌。你读出其中一个港名，两只耳朵同时竖起来。\n贾尔斯衔住牌，把它放到桥边的矮桩上，又用蹄子把另一张压向相反方向。它不肯替你选路，却显然要先看看，你会怎样对待一副分成两边的牌。"},"en":{"title":"The Horse at the Landing","text":"You wait at the end of the gangway until Giles climbs the steps below the water. The tall gray horse has a coarsely braided mane. Two passage tags strike each other beside its saddle.\nIt stops with its front hooves on dry boards and its hind hooves still submerged. When you reach for the bridle, it turns away, breathing warm iron onto your hand.\nTwo opposing courses are tucked beneath the saddle, each weighted with a card. You read one harbor name. Both ears rise.\nGiles sets a card on a low mooring post and presses the other in the opposite direction. It will not choose your route. It wants to see what you do with a divided deck."}},"暮潮灯议长·维汀":{"world":"tide","level":14,"zh":{"title":"杯沿的红色","text":"酒馆后门通着一条只够侧身走的通道，卢西安端着两只酒杯从里面出来。他穿深色马甲，袖扣一新一旧，指甲边缘有洗不掉的暗红。\n他把杯子放在靠窗的桌上，用手帕擦了擦空椅。“别误会，没人请你喝酒。杯子替我占个座。”\n你看见窗外一盏航灯转过来，他却立刻把灯芯压低。一滴红色从他指尖落进酒里，远处的光也跟着暗下去。\n你问那艘船的名字。卢西安收起手帕，铺开一副没有酒渍的牌。“等你能忍住不先开口，再问。”他坐下时，窗上的另一道人影没有跟着动。"},"en":{"title":"Red on the Rim","text":"Lucian comes through the narrow passage behind the tavern carrying two wineglasses. His waistcoat is dark, his cufflinks mismatched. Red remains beneath his nails.\nHe sets the glasses at a window table and wipes the empty chair.\n“Not an invitation to drink. They were keeping my seat.”\nA navigation lamp swings toward the window. He lowers its wick at once. One red drop falls from his finger into the wine. The distant light dims with it.\nYou ask the ship’s name. Lucian pockets his handkerchief and lays out an unstained deck.\n“Ask when you can bear not to speak first.” He sits. The other figure in the window does not move."}},"暮潮星枝鹿领誓·诺汀":{"world":"tide","level":15,"zh":{"title":"发热的缆绳","text":"仓库外有人拖动缆绳。你循声过去，只看见芙萝拉低着头穿过雨棚。鹿角上缠着烧黑的绳圈，每一步都从地上扯起一缕白汽。\n它的左眼蒙着灰翳，耳朵缺了一小块，颈侧挂着一个旧工牌壳。壳里的照片被水泡烂，只剩别针的位置还清楚。\n你拿起水桶，想给缆绳降温。它却急促后退，把一副牌碰落到干燥的托盘里。\n牌背上留着同样的绳结压痕。芙萝拉用前蹄把托盘推给你，又朝被烧黑的另一头看了一眼。你把桶放下，坐到它够得着的矮凳旁，那股热气才慢慢平了。"},"en":{"title":"The Hot Mooring Rope","text":"A rope drags outside the warehouse. You follow it to Flora, head lowered beneath the awning. Burned coils bind the deer’s antlers. Each step draws a thread of steam from the ground.\nA gray film covers its left eye. One ear is notched. An old badge case hangs at its neck; water has erased the photograph, leaving only the pin’s impression.\nYou lift a bucket to cool the rope. Flora backs away sharply and knocks a deck into a dry tray.\nMatching knot marks dent the card backs. The deer pushes the tray toward you and glances at the burned end. You lower the bucket and sit beside a low stool. The steam begins to settle."}},"暮潮灯议长·希汀":{"world":"tide","level":16,"zh":{"title":"不能照亮的字","text":"诺兰在船尾等你，外套的扣子一颗不缺，领子却扣错了一格。他两只耳朵长得很不一样，一边苍白细小，另一边有一道被线拉紧的旧疤。\n你举灯去看船尾刻着的字。他抬手遮住光，动作很快，又很快放低声音道了歉。\n“有些话一读出来，就得有人接着说。”\n船舱里摆着两把靠背椅。他把靠门的一把让给你，自己背对那行刻字坐下，拿出一直揣在胸前的牌。\n你问他守在这里多久。诺兰听了听水，把一张牌放下。“先陪我等完这一阵。”船身轻轻一震，岸上的电报机响了。"},"en":{"title":"The Words Left in Shadow","text":"Nolan waits at the stern. Every button is present, though his collar is fastened one hole wrong. His ears do not match. One is small and pale; an old, tightly stitched scar crosses the other.\nYou lift your lamp toward the words cut into the stern. He blocks the light quickly, then lowers his voice to apologize.\n“Read some things aloud, and somebody has to finish them.”\nTwo backed chairs wait below. He gives you the one beside the door and sits with his back to the carving, producing cards warmed against his chest.\nHow long has he waited? Nolan listens to the water and lays down a card.\n“Stay through this tide.” The boat shivers. Ashore, a telegraph begins."}},"霜枝铜缄裂角客":{"world":"frost","level":1,"zh":{"title":"灯下的外套","text":"站台最远的灯晃了一下，埃里克便从两节空车厢之间走来。他额角的一截硬骨露在帽外，另一截用脏布裹着；外套很长，袖口却短得遮不住发青的手腕。\n他拖来一件湿衣服，小心铺到暖气旁，像怕弄醒里面的人。你看见衣领朝自己转了一寸，底下没有鞋。\n“有人把它落下了。”他指着空桌，“我得等失主。等着也是等着。”\n他从内袋取出牌，先替对面的椅子抹掉雪。每张牌背都写过一个姓名，字迹被擦得只剩凹痕。他看着你坐下，才把灯转向桌面。"},"en":{"title":"The Coat Beneath the Lamp","text":"The last platform lamp sways. Erik comes out between two empty carriages. A piece of horn protrudes through his cap; the other is wrapped in dirty cloth. His coat is long, but its sleeves leave his blue wrists bare.\nHe drags a wet coat to the radiator and spreads it gently, as though someone inside might wake. Its collar turns an inch toward you. No shoes show beneath it.\n“Somebody left this. I have to wait for the owner.” He indicates the table. “Might as well have company.”\nHe wipes snow from the opposite chair and produces a deck. Names once marked its backs; only the pressure of the writing remains. When you sit, he turns the lamp toward the cards."}},"霜枝铠卫领誓·泽芙":{"world":"frost","level":2,"zh":{"title":"靴底的冰","text":"你沿检修通道找路，先听到一下一下敲钢轨的声音。布拉姆提着凿冰镐迎面走来，制服肩部缝着旧皮，眉梢结了白霜，一只耳朵藏在厚厚的绷带里。\n他在门槛上磕净靴底，雪落成两条整齐的线。你身后的轨道明明没有车，他仍伸手把你拦到黄线以内。\n“换线之前，得有人看着对面。”他说，“这回我坐，你盯。”\n值守间的小桌擦得很干净。镐被放在伸手够得到的地方，牌却一张张摆得温柔。你刚落座，他便把旁边那把空椅子转向墙，动作熟练得没有看。"},"en":{"title":"Ice on the Soles","text":"In the maintenance passage, you hear measured blows against a rail. Bram approaches with an ice pick. Old leather reinforces his uniform shoulders. Frost whitens his eyebrows; a heavy bandage covers one ear.\nHe knocks the ice from his boots at the threshold. It falls in two straight lines. Although the track behind you is empty, he guides you inside the yellow boundary.\n“Someone watches the other side before a line change,” he says. “I'll sit. You watch.”\nThe small table in his room has been scrubbed clean. He puts the pick within reach, then lays out the cards with unexpected care. As you sit, he turns a spare chair toward the wall without looking at it. He has done that many times."}},"霜枝苔痕赤角兽":{"world":"frost","level":3,"zh":{"title":"没有终点的铃","text":"候车室的双门被顶开时，你以为列车终于到了。进来的却是伊瓦尔：一头肩背高过柜台的牛，毛上挂着冻硬的站票，两只眼蒙着乳白色的膜。\n它角间缠着一段红电线，末端拖过地面，没有接头。每走一步，广播里的一个站名就被短促的杂音吞掉。\n桌边的椅子已经撤走。伊瓦尔把角尖搁在铺好的牌旁，颈圈上褪色的铜牌露出“牵引”两个字。\n喇叭忽然说：“请完成本班检查。”它便不再向前，低低呼出一口热气。你拉过另一把椅子，它把第一张牌推到了你够得着的地方。"},"en":{"title":"A Bell With No Terminus","text":"When the waiting-room doors swing open, you think a train has arrived. It is Ivar: a bull with shoulders above the counter, frozen tickets caught in its coat, and milk-white films over both eyes.\nRed wire winds around its horns. The loose end trails without a connector. With each step, static swallows another station name from the announcement.\nSomeone has removed the chair on its side of the table. Ivar lowers a horn beside the cards. A worn brass tag on its collar still reads TRACTION.\n“Complete the shift inspection,” says the loudspeaker.\nThe bull stops and releases a low, warm breath. When you bring over a chair for yourself, it slides the first card within reach."}},"霜枝潜印客领誓·图芙":{"world":"frost","level":4,"zh":{"title":"没跟来的影子","text":"暗房门只开了一指宽。马雷克侧身挤出来，黑外套贴着肩，头发剪得很短，左耳边留着一道细白疤。她两只手都空着，门框上却多了一把薄刀。\n“防着关门。”她解释，取下刀，拿它削掉桌沿的一根木刺。\n她是来取一张旧底片的。柜台不肯给，只让她等照片里的人先走。她朝你笑笑，把牌摊开：“替我看一局。谁还坐在这里，就算谁。”\n你在她对面坐下。身后的玻璃映出两个人，她脚边的影子却还停在暗房门口，正慢慢把门拉上。"},"en":{"title":"The Shadow Left Behind","text":"The darkroom door opens a finger's width. Marek slips through in a close-fitting black coat, her hair cropped short, a pale scar beside her left ear. Both hands are empty. A narrow knife has appeared in the frame.\n“Keeps it from shutting,” she explains. She removes it and pares a splinter from the table.\nShe came to collect an old negative. The counter will not release it until the person in the photograph leaves.\n“Watch for one game,” she says, spreading a deck. “Whoever is still here counts.”\nYou sit opposite her. The glass behind you reflects two people. Her shadow remains beside the darkroom door, slowly pulling it closed."}},"霜枝铠卫领誓·芮芙":{"world":"frost","level":5,"zh":{"title":"接线的人","text":"安塞尔顺着墙脚的电线来到你身边，膝盖和袖肘都沾着黑油。他的头盔少了半圈衬垫，额头被勒出一道深红痕，细铜丝从胸袋里露出来，擦得很亮。\n他掀开长桌下的接线盒，停了很久，又原样盖上。屋里所有灯都亮着，盒子里却没有一根线。\n“检修单上说，故障在对面。”他用扳手指了指你的椅子，“他们总这么写。”\n他需要有人坐在那里，等电流表稳下来。你刚坐稳，他就递来牌，自己把厚手套脱掉。指针指向你时，他没有抬头，只问：“谁先？”"},"en":{"title":"The Man Following the Wire","text":"Ansel follows the wire along the skirting until he reaches you. Black grease marks his elbows and knees. Half the lining is missing from his helmet, leaving a deep red groove across his forehead. Fine copper wire shines in his pocket.\nHe opens the junction box beneath the table, waits, then closes it exactly as before. Every lamp is burning. There are no wires inside.\n“The repair sheet says the fault is opposite.” He points a spanner at your chair. “They always write that.”\nHe needs someone there until the meter settles. As you sit, he hands you cards and removes his heavy gloves. When the needle points straight at you, he keeps his eyes down.\n“Who starts?”"}},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·阿诺":{"world":"frost","level":6,"zh":{"title":"观察窗上的手","text":"货运推车停在暖气边，车门从里面推开。阿洛攀着门框下来，白毛沾着干掉的药膏，眼圈发青，长指甲被人整齐地剪平。它先把门锁按回原位，才走近你。\n观察窗冻得发白。它在上面擦出一小块，随即用掌心盖住，喉咙里发出压低的急叫。\n桌上留着看护员的字条：解冻前，陪它做些安静的事。下面的签名被阿洛反复摸过，纸已起毛。\n它抱来一盒牌，把最干燥的那一叠留给你。你坐下时，它也照做，双手端正摆好，始终挡在你和那扇窗之间。"},"en":{"title":"A Hand at the Observation Window","text":"A freight trolley waits beside the radiator. Its door opens from within. Arlo climbs down, dried ointment clinging to white fur, blue shadows around its eyes. Someone has clipped its long nails neatly. Before approaching you, it presses the lock back into place.\nThe observation window is opaque with frost. Arlo clears a small patch, immediately covers it with a palm, and makes a low, urgent sound.\nA keeper's note lies on the table: keep it quietly occupied until the thaw. Arlo has rubbed the signature until the paper has frayed.\nIt brings a box of cards and leaves you the driest stack. When you sit, it copies you, hands folded properly, keeping itself between you and the window."}},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·艾诺":{"world":"frost","level":7,"zh":{"title":"食盆旁的空位","text":"你循着金属食盆刮地的声音，找到行李间最里面。乌尔里克坐在矮柜上，灰白长毛里露出一截空袖，肩部缠着旧绷带，头颈被一条洗薄的围巾遮住。\n它用剩下的手端起食盆，将一口饭送到柜顶以外。那里没有灯，你只听见一个耐心的声音：“慢一点，还烫。”\n盆底压着半副旧牌。它把掉在地上的几张拾起来，和桌上的空位来回比，仿佛少的东西必须先凑成一局。\n你替它拉开椅子。它把牌推来，轻轻拍了拍自己的空袖，随后指向对面的座位。柜顶又响起一声咀嚼。"},"en":{"title":"The Empty Place by the Bowl","text":"Following a metal bowl scraping the floor, you reach the back of the luggage room. Ulric sits on a low cabinet. An empty sleeve hangs among grey-white hair. Old bandages cover one shoulder; a washed-thin scarf conceals its head and neck.\nWith its remaining hand, it lifts a spoon beyond the cabinet top. No light reaches there. You hear a patient voice: “Slowly. Still hot.”\nHalf a deck is trapped beneath the bowl. Ulric retrieves the scattered cards and compares them with the spaces on the table, as though the missing pieces might make a complete game.\nYou pull out a chair. It offers the cards, pats its empty sleeve, then points to the opposite place. Above the cabinet, something chews."}},"霜枝攀钟猿领誓·伊诺":{"world":"frost","level":8,"zh":{"title":"给旧伴留的位置","text":"内斯托从站房屋顶落到雨棚上，攀着排水管下来。它比笼舍的猿更瘦，背毛泛黄，嘴边一圈白得像结霜，爪间却一直攥着一块磨圆的肥皂。\n它在水龙头下洗过手，才碰桌上的牌。你把椅子拖近，它忽然伸手拦住，把旁边那个空位重新空出来。\n一张旧清点单挂在它腕上，数量那栏写着二，又被人改成一。内斯托把两颗纽扣放在桌边，给其中一颗推来一张牌。\n它抬眼等你，眼神安静得近乎请求。你拿起另一叠，墙上的猿影立刻挪了挪，替谁让出半张椅子的宽度。"},"en":{"title":"A Place for an Old Companion","text":"Nestor drops from the station roof onto the awning and climbs down a drainpipe. It is thinner than the caged apes, with yellowing back fur and a ring of frosty white around its mouth. A rounded cake of soap stays clenched in one hand.\nIt washes before touching the cards. When you draw your chair closer, it stops you and clears the neighboring place again.\nAn old counting sheet hangs from its wrist. Someone has changed TWO to ONE. Nestor sets two buttons beside the deck and deals a card to one of them.\nIts quiet look is almost a request. You take the other stack. On the wall, an ape's shadow shifts aside, leaving half a chair's width for someone else."}},"霜枝灯议长·欧诺":{"world":"frost","level":9,"zh":{"title":"衣服里的纸声","text":"交班铃响过，阿尔玛才从侧门进来。防寒服把肩膀裹得方方正正，领口露出苍白的下巴，睫毛上有没化的冰。落座前，阿尔玛先把衣襟按平，里面响起翻纸的声音。\n“别站风口。它喜欢认错人。”一只戴着破手套的手替你扶住门。\n桌上两份病历都贴着同一张脸，出院日期却相差许多年。阿尔玛取出牌，把两份记录压在下面，说交接总得有个先后，不能永远两边都签。\n你坐过去时，衣服内衬露出整页手写病历。名字被汗浸开，纸上的那双眼睛，却跟着第一张牌动了。"},"en":{"title":"Paper Inside the Coat","text":"Alma enters through the side door after the shift bell. The winter coat squares the shoulders; a pale chin shows above its collar, and unmelted ice catches in the lashes. Before sitting, Alma smooths the coat. Paper rustles inside.\n“Out of the draft. It mistakes people.” A hand in a torn glove holds the door for you.\nTwo medical files on the table bear the same face. Their discharge dates are years apart. Alma puts a deck over them. A handover needs an order, Alma says; you cannot keep signing for both sides.\nAs you take the other seat, whole handwritten case sheets show through the coat lining. Sweat has blurred the names. The pictured eyes follow the first card."}},"霜枝潜印客领誓·依诺":{"world":"frost","level":10,"zh":{"title":"不说姓名的人","text":"索伦从布告栏后探出半张脸，等你经过，才沿墙边跟来。灰围巾遮住嘴，眉毛修得很短，拇指和食指沾着洗不净的蓝黑墨。\n他没问你叫什么，只递来一张口供。需要停顿的地方都画了小线，有几处墨迹已经长出细毛。\n“别念。”他说，从你手里抽回那页，“纸也会学。”\n他把牌摆到靠窗的小桌上，想用一局没有姓名的交谈，弄清谁替谁作过证。你刚拿起牌，他就把自己的证件倒扣过去。照片背面有三个字，是你听见过、却怎么也想不起出处的称呼。"},"en":{"title":"The Man Who Leaves Names Unsaid","text":"Half of Soren's face appears behind the noticeboard. He waits until you pass before following along the wall. A grey scarf covers his mouth. His eyebrows are cut short; blue-black ink stains his thumb and forefinger.\nHe asks no name. Instead, he offers a statement with small lines marking the pauses. Fine hairs have begun growing from several ink marks.\n“Don't read it aloud.” He takes the page back. “Paper learns.”\nAt a window table, he lays out cards. He wants one conversation without names, to establish who once spoke for whom. As you lift your hand, he turns his identification face down. Three words on the photograph's back sound familiar. You cannot remember where you heard them."}},"霜枝灯议长·乌诺":{"world":"frost","level":11,"zh":{"title":"最后一件冬衣","text":"衣物寄存处的帘子一掀，英格丽抱着几件冬衣走出来。铁灰头发用铅笔绾住，鼻梁上架着细边眼镜，指节布满针扎的红点；外套袖口只缝好一边。\n英格丽把衣架挪离暖气，低头核对领口的布签。每件都有人名，没有一件有人来领。\n“他们说搬走了。走得真急，连冷都没带上。”那副眼镜终于抬向你。\n桌上留着一副从口袋里收出的牌。英格丽想认出它原来的主人，便邀你照自己的习惯打一局。你坐下后，一件空外套慢慢鼓起来，比旁边那件高了一寸。针线筐里没有少一根线。"},"en":{"title":"The Last Winter Coat","text":"The cloakroom curtain lifts. Ingrid emerges carrying winter coats, iron-grey hair pinned with a pencil, fine spectacles on the nose. Needle pricks mark the knuckles. Only one cuff of Ingrid's own coat has been repaired.\nThe hangers are moved away from the radiator. Every collar has a name tag. Nobody has collected one.\n“They say they moved. Such a hurry, they left the cold behind.” The spectacles finally turn toward you.\nA deck recovered from a pocket waits on the table. Ingrid hopes to identify its owner from a familiar manner of play and asks you for a game. Once you sit, an empty coat slowly fills out, an inch taller than its neighbor. Not a thread is missing from the sewing basket."}},"霜枝晶棘蜥龙领誓·维诺":{"world":"frost","level":12,"zh":{"title":"站台下面的吸气声","text":"广播里的一次吸气，让站台地板震了一下。雷夫从检修坑探出头，狭长的额骨结着冰，鳞片边缘焦黑，两只前爪还挂着铅封断开的维修链。\n它沿暖气管缓慢爬来，尾巴留在门外，像不愿把整场睡梦拖进屋里。你拉椅子的声音使它猛地睁眼，瞳孔里横过一道细白的电光。\n牌桌的一条短腿，恰好压着它胸前脱下的旧鳞。\n雷夫把牌盒推给你，又用爪尖敲了敲空椅子。它需要一个能轮流响起的声音，免得再次睡过换班铃。你落座，听见广播里那口气终于缓缓吐尽。"},"en":{"title":"A Breath Beneath the Platform","text":"A breath over the loudspeaker shakes the platform floor. Leif raises its head from the inspection pit. Ice crusts a long brow; the scales are blackened at the edges. Broken maintenance seals and lengths of chain hang from its foreclaws.\nIt follows the heating pipes slowly indoors, leaving its tail outside as though reluctant to bring the whole dream in. Your chair scrapes. Its eyes snap open, a thin line of white current crossing each pupil.\nA shed chest scale steadies the table's short leg.\nLeif pushes the card box toward you and taps the empty chair. It needs alternating sounds to keep awake through the next shift bell. As you sit, the breath in the loudspeaker finally escapes."}},"霜枝灯议长·希诺":{"world":"frost","level":13,"zh":{"title":"先暖手","text":"通往山路的门被推开，希尔达带进一阵湿冷的药味。灰发贴着额头，旧大衣在肩上磨得发亮，眼镜腿用细线绑着；随身的药箱比候车室所有行李都小。\n希尔达先把水壶贴在胸前，等手不再发抖，才检查你的指尖。“还能嫌水烫，就还用不着抬。”说完，给桌子两边各放一只杯。\n山路封了，下一位病人也没有到。希尔达取出一副边角卷曲的牌，说陪人熬夜总得找点事做。\n你坐下时，诊疗簿里忽然多出一个湿手印。希尔达用吸墨纸盖住它，没有问你刚才把手放在了哪里。"},"en":{"title":"Warm Your Hands First","text":"Hilda opens the mountain-road door, bringing the damp smell of medicine. Grey hair clings to the forehead. The old coat shines at the shoulders; thread repairs a spectacle arm. The medical case is smaller than any luggage in the room.\nFirst, Hilda warms the kettle against the chest. Only when the hands stop shaking are your fingertips examined.\n“If you can complain it's hot, we needn't carry you yet.” A cup is placed on either side of the table.\nThe mountain road is closed. The next patient has not arrived. Hilda brings out a curled deck: keeping someone awake requires an occupation.\nAs you sit, a wet handprint appears in the casebook. Hilda covers it with blotting paper, without asking where your hands have been."}},"霜枝潜印客领誓·雅诺":{"world":"frost","level":14,"zh":{"title":"耳机里的空位","text":"内尔从售票窗下面的小门钻出来，先理外套，再摘耳机。耳垫上的皮已经裂开，头发被压出一道整齐的凹痕；一枚不属于这身制服的领章藏在翻领里。\n“说轻点。墙薄。”内尔敲敲桌子，等墙里的咳嗽声停下。\n耳机递到你手边，里面只剩一个人的呼吸。内尔说少了一句要紧的话，想看看你犹豫时会留下怎样的停顿，便从收线盒里取出牌。\n你坐在听筒够不到的那一侧。第一张牌还没翻过来，耳机已经咳了一声；内尔随即在本子上划去一格，手稳得没有半点惊讶。"},"en":{"title":"The Empty Place in the Headphones","text":"Nell crawls through the little door beneath the ticket window, straightens the coat, then removes the headphones. Their leather has split. A neat groove divides the hair. An insignia belonging to another uniform is hidden inside the lapel.\n“Quietly. Thin walls.” Nell taps the table and waits for the cough inside the wall to stop.\nThe offered headphones contain only one person's breathing. An important sentence is missing. Nell wants to hear what pause you leave while deciding, and takes a deck from the cable box.\nYou sit beyond the receiver's reach. Before the first card turns, the headphones cough. Nell crosses a square off the notebook with a perfectly steady hand, unsurprised."}},"霜枝裂角客领誓·瑟诺":{"world":"frost","level":15,"zh":{"title":"雪里烧过的人","text":"雪墙后面有一处橘红，你走近时，塔伦正用掌根抹掉墙上的人影。帽子盖不住额角的弯骨，皮肤细细开裂，黑外套里散出热灰，却没有火星。\n他转身，掌心新添一道烧伤。手腕还套着寄物处的纸环，号码被反复烫穿，只剩末尾一个零。\n“他们说这是雪。我干过烧窑的活，认得灰。”\n他跟着你进候车室，把牌盒放到远离暖气的桌边。每当停下来，手就会伸向墙上那道空影；他想借一局牌让自己坐稳。你拉开椅子，他把烫黑的一面手掌藏到桌下。"},"en":{"title":"The Guest Burned in Snow","text":"Orange light shows behind the snow wall. As you approach, Taran is rubbing a human outline away with the heel of his hand. Curved horn-bone escapes his cap. Fine cracks mark his skin. Hot ash leaves his black coat without a spark.\nHe turns. A new burn crosses his palm. A cloakroom paper band circles his wrist, its number burned through until only a final zero remains.\n“They call it snow. I've worked a kiln. I know ash.”\nHe follows you into the waiting room and places his deck far from the radiator. Whenever he pauses, his hand reaches toward the absent outline. A game might keep him seated. As you draw up a chair, he hides the blackened palm beneath the table."}},"霜枝灯议长·诺诺":{"world":"frost","level":16,"zh":{"title":"把行李放在脚边","text":"乔纳斯从站台尽头走来。褐色大衣刷得很干净，领口钉着两颗不配套的蓝扣子，胡须里有一道压白的痕；他提行李的姿势像提着一只睡着的动物。\n他在门边解开绳结，又原样系上，特意留出一根手指的宽度。“到家手冻僵了，也能拆。”他说。\n你问哪一班车回家。他笑着把箱子挪到桌脚，露出压在下面的一副旧牌。\n“你找出口，我找站名。坐着想，总比在雪里找强。”\n他替你理平翘起的衣领，指尖被里面的细铁丝划破。乔纳斯没看伤口，只把第一张牌放下，背面印着两座同名的站台。"},"en":{"title":"Keep Your Luggage Close","text":"Jonas approaches from the end of the platform. His brown coat is carefully brushed. Two mismatched blue buttons close its collar; a pale pressure mark divides his beard. He carries his case like a sleeping animal.\nAt the door, he unties the rope and ties it again, leaving a finger's width in the knot.\n“For frozen hands, when I get home.”\nYou ask which train goes there. Smiling, he moves the case beneath the table, revealing an old deck.\n“You want an exit. I want a station name. Better to think sitting down.”\nHe straightens your raised collar. Fine wire inside it cuts his fingertip. He ignores the wound and lays the first card down. Its back shows two stations with the same name."}},"星铸铠卫领誓·洛玟":{"world":"astral","level":1,"zh":{"title":"门缝里的袖口","text":"白墙上的门只有铅笔画出的轮廓。你听见布料撕开，卡勒布从那条细缝里侧身出来，制服的一角仍夹在墙里。他肩膀很窄，帽檐压着一道旧伤，左袖的纽扣却一颗比一颗新。\n他没有先看你的脸，而是翻过案卷，数了数缺页。“少一张也能结案。”他说，“只是得有人补进去。”\n你问他守的是门还是纸。他把被夹住的袖口拉平，在桌边放下一双叠好的手套。“先把这一局打完。然后你再决定，哪个问题值得问。”"},"en":{"title":"The Cuff in the Door","text":"The door is only a pencil outline on the white wall. Cloth tears. Caleb slips sideways through the line, leaving a corner of his uniform caught inside it. He has narrow shoulders, an old scar beneath his cap, and a row of buttons that become newer toward his wrist.\nHe checks the missing pages before he looks at your face. “A file can close with one page short. Somebody just has to fill the gap.”\nYou ask whether he guards the door or the paper. He smooths the trapped cuff and sets folded gloves beside the table. “Finish this game first. Then decide which question is worth asking.”"}},"星铸裂角客领誓·佩烙":{"world":"astral","level":2,"zh":{"title":"排在最后的人","text":"问询室里的人已经散了，奥蒂斯才从队尾走过来。他的黑外套湿在里面，翻开的衣领却很干。额角有两段磨钝的骨突，脸上一条旧裂缝从鼻梁延到下颌，说话时，两侧的嘴唇总慢半拍。\n“迟到了。”你说。他拿出一张签到纸，指给你看最早的那个时间。纸上的订书钉扎进桌面，拔不出来。\n他在对面坐下，小心把裂开的那边脸避开灯光。“他们总让我最后说。牌桌好一些，至少总有轮到我的时候。”他用指节敲齐牌角，等你落座。"},"en":{"title":"The Last to Arrive","text":"The others have left the interview room when Otis approaches from the back of the queue. His black coat is wet inside; its upturned collar is dry. Two blunt bony points rise at his temples. An old split runs from nose to jaw, and one side of his mouth speaks half a beat behind the other.\n“You're late.” He produces the attendance sheet and points to the earliest time. Its staple has entered the table and will not come out.\nHe sits with the split side turned from the lamp. “They always hear me last. A card table is better. My turn has to come eventually.” He taps the deck square and waits for you to sit."}},"星铸灯议长·泽烙":{"world":"astral","level":3,"zh":{"title":"两份副本","text":"你推开复印间的门，沃恩正从高处摘下一张卡住的纸。人字梯已经收好，他却仍站在你肩膀以上。等你眨过眼，他双脚又稳稳落在地上，灰马甲的口袋鼓着半盒订书钉。\n他戴着一副只有单边镜片的眼镜，食指染黑，笑起来露出缺了一角的门牙。“原件不在我这。人人都这么说，所以我特地记下来了。”\n他把两份相反的口供推到桌上，两处签名都压着同一道折痕。你想仔细看，他却用一副牌盖住。“赢不赢都得选说法。先让我看看，你怎样处理手里的那一份。”"},"en":{"title":"Two Copies","text":"You open the copying room and find Vaughn taking a jammed sheet from above your head. The stepladder is already folded. When you blink, his feet are on the floor again. Half a box of staples bulges in his grey waistcoat.\nHis glasses have one lens. Ink stains a forefinger, and his smile exposes a chipped front tooth. “I haven't got the original. Everyone says that. I made a note of it.”\nHe lays down two contradictory statements. The same crease crosses both signatures. Before you can study them, he covers them with a deck. “Win or lose, you'll have to choose an account. First, show me what you do with the one in your hand.”"}},"星铸巡影狼领誓·阿霖":{"world":"astral","level":4,"zh":{"title":"走廊里的爪声","text":"门外先响起皮鞋踩过湿地板的声音。进来的却是一头灰狼。罗南的右耳缺了半边，颈毛压着一圈褪色的布领，后腿沾满白灰；每落下一只爪，地上就多出一枚人的鞋印。\n它绕过灯下那把椅子，在长桌另一端停住。墙上的监控里，它还在走廊走，迟迟没有抵达门口。\n你伸手去关屏幕，它低吼了一声，把一张旧巡查表推到牌堆旁。表上最后一栏空着。它将前爪按在牌背，望向你，又望向出口，像一个非得等人接班才能离开的值勤者。你拉开椅子，它才收回爪子。"},"en":{"title":"Claws in the Corridor","text":"Wet footsteps approach in leather shoes. A grey wolf enters instead. Half of Ronan's right ear is missing. A faded cloth collar presses down his neck fur, and white dust coats his hind legs. Each paw leaves a human shoeprint.\nHe circles the chair beneath the lamp and stops at the far end of the table. On the monitor, he is still walking down the corridor, nowhere near its door.\nYou reach to switch it off. He growls and noses an old patrol sheet beside the deck. Its final field is empty. He rests a paw on the card backs, looks at you, then at the exit: a watchman waiting for relief. Only when you pull out a chair does he withdraw his paw."}},"星铸灯议长·图烙":{"world":"astral","level":5,"zh":{"title":"背面的照片","text":"伊欧妮循着椅脚的摩擦声走进来，细杖先碰门框，鞋尖随后才跨过门槛。来人的头发剪得很短，眼镜涂着不透光的黑漆，袖口却夹着一把干净的放大镜。\n桌上有张背面朝上的照片。你问画面里是什么，伊欧妮隔着手套摸了摸纸角。“先别告诉我。说出来就不好改了。”\n细杖横在你准备离开的那一边。来人解释，这是一次不看结果的核对，普通问答已经试过太多遍。三张牌被推到灯下，纸背朝着你。伊欧妮的手始终没有碰到牌面，却把歪掉的一角慢慢摆正。"},"en":{"title":"The Back of the Photograph","text":"Ione follows the scrape of a chair into the room. A thin cane touches the frame before their shoe crosses the threshold. Their hair is cropped short. Black paint covers both lenses of their glasses, but a spotless magnifier is clipped inside one cuff.\nA photograph lies face down. You ask what it shows. Ione feels its corner through a glove. “Don't tell me yet. Once it's said, changing it gets difficult.”\nThe cane rests across the side where you meant to leave. This is a check without seeing the result, they explain. Questions have already failed too often. Three cards slide under the lamp, backs toward you. Ione never touches their faces, yet slowly straightens a crooked corner."}},"星铸铠卫领誓·芮烙":{"world":"astral","level":6,"zh":{"title":"靠墙的座位","text":"西塞尔从运石的小推车旁抬起头，肩上全是粉白的灰。那件执勤外套大得不合身，胸口却绷得很紧，像底下藏着一块平整的硬物。你经过时，他侧身让路，裤脚里掉出一小撮碎砂。\n他把靠墙的椅子拖到桌子中央，请你坐。你说坐哪里都一样。他笑了笑，手掌贴在墙上，掌纹里的灰一下被吸干了。\n“那是还没有人给你量尺寸。”他压低声音。\n桌旁只留两把椅子。他从衣袋里取出一副沾着石粉的牌，说要核对一下谁应坐在里面。你落座后，他仍用脚抵着你的椅腿，没有让它退回原处。"},"en":{"title":"The Seat by the Wall","text":"Cecil looks up from a stone trolley, his shoulders powdered white. The duty coat is too large, yet tight across his chest, as though something flat and hard is hidden beneath it. He turns to let you pass. Sand trickles from a trouser cuff.\nHe drags the chair by the wall to the center of the table. You say one seat is much like another. He smiles and places a palm against the wall. The dust in his skin vanishes.\n“Nobody's measured you yet.”\nOnly two chairs remain. He takes a dusty deck from his pocket and proposes checking who belongs on the inside. When you sit, he keeps a foot against your chair leg, preventing it from returning to the wall."}},"星铸铠卫领誓·米玟":{"world":"astral","level":7,"zh":{"title":"没有照片的证件","text":"门锁连响两次，奥尔顿才把通行证从读卡器里抽出来。他的制服熨得很齐，脸却始终落在帽檐那片浅得不该遮住东西的影子里。你看得清他的睫毛，记不住眼睛的位置。\n“换过证了？”他问。你说没有。他低头把自己的证件翻过来，塑封里一张空白照片正缓缓裂开。\n他原是来收旧证的，见了你的案卷，却把装证件的信封塞回口袋。长桌上已有两处擦得发亮的位置。\n“办手续太慢。”他拉开椅子，把牌放在空白照片上，“按这里的老办法，先看你能不能认出属于自己的东西。”"},"en":{"title":"The Unpictured Pass","text":"The lock sounds twice before Alton removes his pass from the reader. His uniform is neatly pressed. His face stays beneath a shadow too thin to hide it. You can see his eyelashes, but cannot retain the position of his eyes.\n“Changed your pass?” You say no. He turns his own over. A blank photograph is splitting inside the plastic.\nHe came to collect old passes. After seeing your file, he pockets the collection envelope. Two places at the long table have been polished by repeated use.\n“Paperwork takes too long.” He pulls out a chair and lays the deck over the empty photograph. “We'll use the old method. First, let's see whether you recognize what belongs to you.”"}},"星铸裂角客领誓·伊玟":{"world":"astral","level":8,"zh":{"title":"袋中的停顿","text":"达拉坐在问询室外的长凳上，膝头摆着几只扎口的透明袋。外套两肩撑得尖锐，领口露出一圈细小的骨刺；脸很年轻，眼下的皱纹却叠了好几层。每当他停下呼吸，袋子就鼓起一点。\n你问他等了多久。他看一眼没有指针的表，把一只袋子往里挪。“上一位还没说完。”\n房里已经空了。他仍仔细听着，直到你脚下响起一声咳嗽。\n达拉这才起身，把长凳搬到牌桌前。他说自己不想再等一份迟迟不到的口供，请你用一局牌证明现在确实轮到了他。袋口的水珠在他落座时一起滑了下去。"},"en":{"title":"Pauses in a Bag","text":"Dara waits outside the interview room with tied clear bags on his knees. His coat shoulders form sharp points. Small bone spurs ring the collar. His face is young; several folds of age sit beneath each eye. Whenever he holds his breath, the bags swell.\nYou ask how long he has waited. He checks a handless watch and moves one bag aside. “The last person hasn't finished.”\nThe room is empty. He keeps listening until a cough sounds beneath your feet.\nOnly then does he rise and carry the bench to the card table. He will not wait for another statement that never arrives. A game, he suggests, might prove that his turn has really come. As he sits, every drop on the bags slides downward together."}},"星铸环藤蛇领誓·阿玟":{"world":"astral","level":9,"zh":{"title":"洗手池的来客","text":"水龙头没开，洗手池里却不断涌出温水。阿斯彭顺着排水管爬上来，灰白的鳞片贴得很密，尾尖卷成完整的一圈。它脖颈上缠着一条旧纱布，姓名写在布面，墨迹从里面渗出来。\n你退开半步，它便把一片薄皮送到桌上。薄皮下压着一张出院单，签名处刚好缺了一角。\n“要谁签字？”你问。蛇轻轻撞了撞牌盒，再朝门边的病历柜昂起头。\n它不像来找食物，倒像在等最后一次查房。你把牌铺开，它盘在对面的空椅子上，露出纱布下面尚未脱尽的旧伤，耐心等你开始核对。"},"en":{"title":"A Visitor from the Basin","text":"The tap is shut, but warm water keeps rising in the basin. Aspen climbs out through the drain. Closely fitted grey-white scales cover its body; the tip of its tail curls into a complete ring. An old bandage encircles its neck. A name has seeped through the cloth from inside.\nYou step back. The snake slides a thin skin onto the table. Beneath it lies a discharge slip with a corner missing from the signature field.\n“Whose signature?” It taps the card box and lifts its head toward the records cabinet.\nIt seems to be waiting for a final ward visit, not food. You spread the cards. It coils on the opposite chair, exposing an old wound beneath the bandage, and patiently waits for the check to begin."}},"星铸裂角客领誓·艾玟":{"world":"astral","level":10,"zh":{"title":"自备的墨水","text":"你在配餐窗口找到埃尔默。他端着空餐盘，瘦长的手指从袖子里露出来，指甲磨得平整，额角的骨突却被油污浸黑。窗口早已关上，他还盯着里面那盏不亮的灯。\n“夜班不供饭？”你问。他抬起头，嘴角带着一小道红色的印子。“供。先得把账核清。”\n他领你到旁边的桌子，抬手时，纸巾下露出一道刚结痂的割口。那只手压住一支完全干透的钢笔，笔尖仍写出一个字。\n埃尔默把餐盘放在椅脚边，推来牌堆。他说赢不赢都得吃饭，可先坐下来的人，至少有资格问这顿饭是谁订的。"},"en":{"title":"Ink of His Own","text":"You find Elmer at the serving hatch with an empty tray. Long fingers extend from his cuffs, the nails carefully filed. Grease darkens the bony points at his temples. The hatch is shut. He keeps watching its unlit bulb.\n“No night meal?” He looks up, a red mark at the corner of his mouth. “There is. Accounts first.”\nHe leads you to a nearby table. As he raises his hand, a fresh scab shows beneath a paper napkin. The hand rests on a completely dry fountain pen. Its nib still writes one word.\nElmer places the tray beside his chair and pushes you the deck. Win or lose, he says, people must eat. Those willing to sit down may at least ask who ordered the meal."}},"星铸峰脊巨灵领誓·欧玟":{"world":"astral","level":11,"zh":{"title":"肩上的铁门","text":"天花板低了一截。你抬头，才发现是路德扛着一扇铁门走过来，门框上的墙灰还没掉净。他高得必须侧过脖子，厚外套的肩缝全开了，露出的皮肤上排列着旧钉孔。\n门后有人敲了三下。他用指关节敲回两下，动作熟练得像在回答迟到的同事。\n你给他让出过道，他却把门倚在长桌旁。疏散图上，同一个位置明明画着实墙。\n“站着问不算交接。”他说，膝盖压得椅子发出细响。他把牌放到你手边，请你坐稳；他得弄清，接下来该替哪一边的人把门扛着。"},"en":{"title":"The Door on His Shoulder","text":"The ceiling seems lower. Then you see Luther approaching with an iron door on his shoulder, wall dust still clinging to its frame. He must bend his neck. Both shoulder seams of his thick coat have opened, revealing old nail holes in the skin.\nThree knocks sound behind the door. He answers with two taps, as routinely as acknowledging a late colleague.\nYou clear the passage. Instead, he props the door beside the long table. On the evacuation plan, that position is marked as solid wall.\n“Standing questions don't count as a handover.” The chair complains beneath his knees. He sets cards by your hand and asks you to sit properly. He needs to establish which side he will be carrying the door for next."}},"星铸巡影狼领誓·乌玟":{"world":"astral","level":12,"zh":{"title":"带子断开的地方","text":"韦德从废纸间走出来时，嘴里还叼着半截录音带。它比你先前见过的狼更瘦，肩胛骨顶起暗色的毛，左前腿缠着早已干硬的胶布。它走得很慢，身后的门却不停发出奔跑时才有的碰撞声。\n你蹲下看那截带子。磁带上没有录音编号，只有一排深浅不一的指纹。它避开你的手，将带子放到牌桌的中央。\n旁边的空白记录表上多出两个字：别接。\n韦德把椅子往你这边推了一点，自己守在另一头。它像是要借这场牌局拖住你，又像终于找到一个肯替它听完那段空白的人。"},"en":{"title":"Where the Tape Breaks","text":"Wade emerges from the wastepaper room carrying half a recording tape. This wolf is thin enough for its shoulder blades to lift the dark fur. Stiff old adhesive wraps its left foreleg. It walks slowly, though the door behind it keeps banging at a runner's pace.\nYou crouch to inspect the tape. It has no recording number, only a row of fingerprints pressed at different depths. Wade avoids your hand and deposits it in the middle of the card table.\nTwo words appear on the blank sheet nearby: DON'T CONNECT.\nIt pushes a chair toward you and takes the opposite end. Perhaps the game is meant to delay you. Perhaps it has finally found somebody willing to listen to the whole silence."}},"星铸灯议长·雅玟":{"world":"astral","level":13,"zh":{"title":"两边的出口","text":"两扇门同时开了，勒内从左边进来，右边那扇门后却传来一模一样的鞋声。他穿一件没有口袋的浅色外套，领口扣得很高，手背的皮肤干净得看不到毛孔。\n他替你指出出口，左手向左，右手向右。你看见两只手掌有完全相同的纹路，连小指根部那道断线也一样。\n“你选哪边？”他问。你没有答。他的肩膀反倒松了一点。\n桌上有张空座位牌，只有你的椅子没有姓名。勒内把它翻扣，提出先打一局。他说口头选择总容易被人改写，落在桌上的东西，至少能让双方都看见。"},"en":{"title":"Two Ways Out","text":"Both doors open. Rene enters from the left while identical footsteps sound beyond the right. His pale coat has no pockets. Its collar is fastened high. No pores are visible on the backs of his hands.\nHe indicates the exits, left hand left, right hand right. Both palms have exactly the same lines, including a break beneath the little finger.\n“Which one?” You do not answer. His shoulders ease.\nAn empty place card stands on the table. Yours is the only chair without a name. Rene turns the card face down and proposes a game first. Spoken choices are too easily rewritten, he says. Something placed on the table can at least be witnessed by both sides."}},"星铸铠卫领誓·维玟":{"world":"astral","level":14,"zh":{"title":"纸下的血迹","text":"阿丝特莉推着一辆药车进来，轮子上缠着几根白线，一转就轻轻抽打地面。来人的袖口套着旧护腕，颈侧有一条压平的疤，手套却换得很勤，桌边已经叠了四双。\n你手上的小伤不知何时又破了。阿丝特莉递来棉片，等你按住，才把沾血的纸抽走。纸下面还有一份口供，最新一行只写了你尚未出口的犹豫。\n“先别替我解释。”来人说，“我见过太多擦干净就说没发生的事。”\n药车里层装着一副牌。阿丝特莉取出来，坐到灯下，要求用一场对局核验这份记录，而不是再听一遍你准备好的说法。"},"en":{"title":"Blood Beneath the Paper","text":"Astrid wheels in a medicine trolley. White threads caught in a caster tap the floor as it turns. Old wrist guards cover their cuffs. A flattened scar runs beside the neck. Fresh gloves are changed often; four used pairs lie stacked by the table.\nA small cut on your hand has opened again. Astrid offers cotton, waits for you to press it down, then removes the bloodstained sheet. Another statement lies beneath it. Its newest line records a hesitation you have not voiced.\n“Don't explain for me. Too many people wipe something clean and say it never happened.”\nA deck occupies the trolley's inner shelf. Astrid takes it out and sits beneath the lamp, asking to verify the record through a game rather than hear your prepared account again."}},"星铸灯议长·诺玟":{"world":"astral","level":15,"zh":{"title":"署名之前","text":"你看见欧内斯特从白室另一端搬来一把椅子。走廊没有门，椅腿却带着外面才有的泥。他把磨白的袖口垫在桌边，头发梳得很整齐，耳后夹着一支几乎咬扁的笔。\n他请你报姓名，听到一半便低头记，随即又全部划掉。“抱歉，总得有一回写对。”他说，笑容里有一点真正的疲倦。\n你还没纠正，纸上那一笔已经转成你小时候的写法。\n欧内斯特看了看自己的手，把笔放远。他不是来问路的，只想确认这只手还能不能做自己的决定。牌推过来时，他用另一只手扣住了椅子的扶手。"},"en":{"title":"Before the Signature","text":"Ernest brings a chair from the far end of the White Room. The corridor has no doors, yet outdoor mud clings to its legs. He cushions the desk edge with a whitened cuff. His hair is neatly combed; a nearly flattened, chewed pen waits behind one ear.\nHe asks your name, writes before you finish, then crosses it all out. “Sorry. It has to be right once.” There is real fatigue in his smile.\nBefore you correct him, the stroke has turned into your childhood handwriting.\nErnest studies his hand and places the pen out of reach. He is not asking directions. He wants to know whether the hand can still make a decision of its own. As the cards slide toward you, his other hand grips the chair arm."}},"星铸折面星客领誓·瑟玟":{"world":"astral","level":16,"zh":{"title":"门后空出来的位置","text":"门向里开着，埃文却从它的背面走出来。你没看见他绕过门轴。那件外套的袖子磨得发白，手指很长，指节上有搬家具留下的旧伤；灯照到他的脸时，轮廓总比五官慢一点清楚。\n他替你扶着门，让你闻见里面煮水的气味。壶把上缠着一块布，断口与你袖边那条破线相接。\n“你是等我的？”你问。他整理桌上的空白表，抽出夹在最底下的一副牌。\n“我在等有人肯把最后一段听完。”他把对面的椅子拉开，“出去的人，通常不肯坐下。”门没有关。他没再催，只把笔留在了你够得到的地方。"},"en":{"title":"The Space Behind the Door","text":"The door opens inward. Evan steps out from behind it, though you never see him pass the hinges. His coat cuffs have worn white. Long fingers carry an old furniture-moving scar. When the light reaches his face, the outline becomes clear a moment after its features.\nHe holds the door, letting you smell boiling water. Cloth wraps the kettle handle. Its torn edge matches the loose thread at your sleeve.\n“Were you waiting for me?” He straightens blank forms and retrieves the deck beneath them.\n“For somebody willing to hear the last part.” He draws out the opposite chair. “People leaving don't usually sit.”\nThe door stays open. He does not hurry you. He only leaves the pen within your reach."}}};
