 '物理':'Physical','火':'Fire','雷':'Lightning','光':'Light','暗':'Dark','血':'Blood','魔':'Magic','冰':'Ice','毒':'Poison',
 '练习灯偶':'Training Dummy','练习巡灯者':'Practice Mireglass Silverdew Bonebound','鎏金灯蛛':'Gilded Wick Spider','鎏金余芯':'Gilded Wick','碎灯偶':'Bones',
